(function(){var D={"en":{"dc_install_t":"Install and first start","dc_install_h":"Folder, server.cfg, setup token, first login","dc_install_s":"Put the folder in resources/, add the ensure line, start the server and finish the setup wizard in your browser. There is no SQL import and no build step.","dc_hosting_t":"Game host or own server: addresses and ports","dc_hosting_h":"Which address to use, firewall, domain and HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"The panel answers on its own port (3000 by default) and through the game port. Use the own port when it is reachable. On a game host where only the game port is open, use the game-port address.","dc_settings_t":"Find a setting","dc_settings_h":"Convars for server.cfg and keys for config.json","dc_settings_s":"Most settings are in the panel under Management, then Configuration. The convars and config.json keys below are for things that must exist before the panel is up, and for secrets. A convar overrides the same key in config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Back up, update and uninstall","dc_backup_h":"What to keep, how to update safely, how to remove it","dc_backup_s":"Everything you set up lives in config.json and the unlWeb/ folder. Keep those two and you can replace the rest of the resource at any time.","dc_access_t":"Give staff access (panel and in game)","dc_access_h":"Roles, users, FiveM ID, /admin and ACE groups","dc_access_s":"The web panel and the in-game menu are two separate accesses. Make a role, make the user, then link the user to their game account.","dc_whitelist_t":"Set up whitelist and queue","dc_whitelist_h":"Access modes, Discord roles, queue limit and priority","dc_whitelist_s":"The whitelist is off by default, so installing never locks anyone out. Turn it on when you are ready. The queue only matters when the server is full.","dc_security_t":"Security: what to keep private","dc_security_h":"Secrets, HTTPS and least privilege","dc_security_s":"Staff log in with passwords and the panel can change your server, so treat it like an admin tool.","dc_liveview_t":"Set up Live View","dc_liveview_h":"Screen and voice, TURN for strict networks","dc_liveview_s":"Live View streams a player's screen to your browser with WebRTC, directly between the game and the browser. It often works without setup. If players are on mobile networks or strict routers, add a TURN server. FiveM only.","dc_logs_t":"Search and read logs","dc_logs_h":"Log types, the Scripts tab and search operators","dc_logs_s":"The Logs page has one live tab per log type and a search that looks across all of them. History is kept for 90 days by default (Configuration).","dc_discord_t":"Send logs to Discord","dc_discord_h":"One webhook per log type","dc_discord_s":"Each log type can post to its own Discord channel through a webhook. Money has its own because it is high volume.","dc_items_t":"Make items do things (effects)","dc_items_h":"Health, hunger, screen effects, animations, money","dc_items_s":"Attach effects to an item in the panel and they run when a player uses it. No scripting. Use the editor; do not write the effects by hand.","dc_panelclosed_t":"The panel does not open","dc_panelclosed_h":"Wrong address, closed port, resource not started","dc_panelclosed_s":"Work through the steps in order. Turn on Debug logging first (Configuration): then every web request shows in the console.","dc_denied_t":"\"Denied: admin access required\" in game","dc_denied_h":"The in-game menu does not open","dc_denied_s":"The in-game menu does not use ACE permissions by default. It checks the FiveM name (fxname) on a panel user. If it does not match your identifier, the menu says Denied.","dc_ratelimit_t":"429 errors or Live View keeps dropping","dc_ratelimit_h":"FiveM request limits are too low for the panel","dc_ratelimit_s":"This happens when the panel is used through the game port. FiveM limits requests per IP, and the panel needs more. The startup report warns about it.","dc_write_t":"Saving fails: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"Job, gang, item and vehicle editors need permission","dc_write_s":"Newer server artifacts only let Unlimited save into other resources when server.cfg allows it. The editors need it; the rest of the panel works without it.","dc_console_t":"What a console message means","dc_console_h":"Console messages and what to do","dc_console_s":"The console is quiet by default: it shows the startup summary, warnings and errors. Everything else (web requests, sockets, Live View sessions) only shows while Configuration, Debug logging is on. Turn it on while you troubleshoot and off again when it works. Everything is always written to the log file.","dc_g_install":"Install and host","dc_g_access":"Access and staff","dc_g_features":"Features","dc_g_problems":"Problems","dc_nav":"Docs","dc_title":"Documentation","dc_lead":"Short guides for running Unlimited Reforged. Pick what you need to do, or use the search at the top.","dc_ask":"What do you need help with?","dc_back":"Back to topics","dc_more":"Read the full guide","dc_gs":"Need more help with a step?","q12":"Why does the game say \"Denied: admin access required\"?","a12":"The in-game menu checks the FiveM name (fxname) on your panel user. Set it to your own identifier, or use an ACE group. The full steps are in the documentation.","dc_install_1":"Unpack the zip and put the folder in resources/. The folder name is the resource name and part of the panel address.","dc_install_2":"Add the lines for your framework to server.cfg. The order matters: oxmysql, framework, inventory, and Unlimited last.","dc_install_3":"On newer server artifacts, also add the write permission lines for your framework before the ensure line.","dc_install_4":"Show the write permission lines","dc_install_5":"Start the server. The console prints a one-time setup token and the panel addresses (lines starting with [Unlimited]).","dc_install_6":"Open the panel address and follow the wizard: language, master account (username and password), then paste the token. Log in.","dc_install_7":"The token changes on every restart, so always use the newest one from the console. Unlimited detects your framework, inventory and slot count by itself and prints one line about it, for example [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Tables in the database are created automatically.","dc_install_8":"The panel address does not match? See addresses and ports","dc_hosting_1":"Route","dc_hosting_2":"Address","dc_hosting_3":"Own panel port (home server, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Game port (game hosts with only the game port open)","dc_hosting_5":"Through the game port, keep the / at the end. When the resource starts, the console prints the exact addresses.","dc_hosting_6":"Open the panel port (TCP) in your firewall or host panel. On a game host, ask for an extra port and set it in server.cfg.","dc_hosting_7":"If you use the game-port address, add the rate limit lines below. FiveM limits requests per IP by default, which is too low for the panel.","dc_hosting_8":"For a domain with HTTPS, put a reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy or Cloudflare) in front. The panel itself serves plain HTTP. The proxy must forward Host and X-Forwarded-Proto and allow WebSocket upgrades.","dc_hosting_9":"Only if the panel is hosted on another site (unlDisableServe true): list that site address in unlPanelAllowedOrigins. It is not needed when the panel is opened from this server.","dc_hosting_10":"Getting 429 errors? See rate limits","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Default","dc_settings_3":"What it does","dc_settings_4":"Own panel port.","dc_settings_5":"host port, else 30120","dc_settings_6":"Game port shown in the startup report.","dc_settings_7":"Look up the public IP at startup.","dc_settings_8":"true = do not serve the panel from this resource (external hosting).","dc_settings_9":"empty","dc_settings_10":"Extra web addresses allowed to use the panel API from another site, comma separated.","dc_settings_11":"Chat command for the in-game menu. RedM default: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Players' report command. It cannot be the same as the menu command.","dc_settings_13":"Which panel role an ACE group gets, as JSON.","dc_settings_14":"Live View engine: auto, screencapture or webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (use set, never setr).","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API token (use set, never setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = no new-version notice in the console and on the Dashboard.","dc_settings_18":"false = turn off the live server console in the in-game menu.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Event of your clothing script; empty = auto-detect.","dc_settings_21":"config.json key","dc_settings_22":"depends on inventory","dc_settings_23":"Where stashes, trunks and gloveboxes live. Must match your inventory, or stashes look empty.","dc_settings_24":"Same as the convar. Empty = default.","dc_settings_25":"Same as the convar. Empty = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"STUN and TURN servers for Live View.","dc_settings_28":"Discord webhook per log type. The other ones are listed in the Discord topic.","dc_settings_29":"true = no weapon logging at all.","dc_settings_30":"true = weapon logs stay out of Discord only.","dc_settings_31":"config.json must be valid JSON; // and /* */ comments are allowed. Framework names, inventory and slots are detected from what runs, and a value that does not fit is ignored with a Warning: line in the console. An old config.json can stay.","dc_settings_32":"Discord webhooks","dc_backup_1":"Path","dc_backup_2":"What is in it","dc_backup_3":"Panel users, roles, settings, notes and waypoints.","dc_backup_4":"The log files: player, game, money, dev, web and scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Your own settings and webhooks.","dc_backup_6":"Back up","dc_backup_7":"Copy config.json and the unlWeb/ folder to a safe place.","dc_backup_8":"Update","dc_backup_9":"Copy the new files over the old folder. Do not delete the folder first, and never delete unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Keep your own config.json. Compare it with the new one for new options.","dc_backup_11":"Restart the server. Check your roles afterwards: a role that lacks a new permission loses that button.","dc_backup_12":"Uninstall","dc_backup_13":"Remove the ensure line and the add_filesystem_permission lines from server.cfg and stop the server.","dc_backup_14":"Move the resource folder away. Keep a copy of unlWeb/ if you may come back.","dc_backup_15":"The tables Unlimited created in the database (names starting with unl_) and two columns (bans.tokens and players.isWhitelisted) stay. They do no harm; remove them only if you are sure.","dc_backup_16":"Deleting unlWeb/data.json starts the setup wizard again and removes all panel users, roles, notes and waypoints.","dc_access_1":"Management, Roles: create a role and tick only the permissions that person needs.","dc_access_2":"Management, Users: create the user and assign the role. A user without a role cannot log in.","dc_access_3":"On the same user, fill in the FiveM name (fxname) with their identifier, for example the code below. Without it the in-game menu says Denied.","dc_access_4":"In game, type /admin on FiveM or /unladmin on RedM.","dc_access_5":"Staff with an ACE group (from txAdmin or add_principal) also get the in-game menu without their own panel user. Say which panel role each group gets; the role with that name decides what they can do. A panel user linked to the player always goes first. Use {} to turn it off.","dc_access_6":"What","dc_access_7":"How to change it","dc_access_8":"Menu command: /admin on FiveM, /unladmin on RedM","dc_access_9":"Configuration, In-game admin menu, or set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" in server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Players' report command: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Configuration, Player report command, or set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"RedM hotkey for the menu (an RDR control hash such as 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"Same place as the menu command. RedM has no key bindings for scripts, so it is optional.","dc_access_14":"If another menu already owns /admin (for example qbx_adminmenu), the console says so at start: pick another command. On ESX, esx_adminmenu keeps /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Action","dc_access_16":"Role permission","dc_access_17":"Warn, send a message","dc_access_18":"Player: warn","dc_access_19":"Kick","dc_access_20":"Player: kick","dc_access_21":"Ban","dc_access_22":"Player: ban","dc_access_23":"Live View, spectate","dc_access_24":"Player: view screen","dc_access_25":"Server console in the menu: read / run commands","dc_access_26":"Configuration: read / modify","dc_access_27":"Queue: view / let in","dc_access_28":"Whitelist: read / modify","dc_access_29":"Getting Denied? See the fix","dc_whitelist_1":"Access mode","dc_whitelist_2":"No check.","dc_whitelist_3":"A license must be whitelisted in the database.","dc_whitelist_4":"Decided by Discord roles on your guild.","dc_whitelist_5":"Local whitelist first, then Discord. This is the default.","dc_whitelist_6":"Open the Whitelist page and switch on the global enforcement when you are ready.","dc_whitelist_7":"Choose the access mode under Access Control. For Discord roles, enter the guild ID and the bot token, then give each role a priority.","dc_whitelist_8":"Set the queue limit (Max players). It defaults to sv_maxclients, which is never exceeded. Players who are still downloading or loading count as connected and never lose their seat.","dc_whitelist_9":"Use slot groups to reserve seats, for example for staff. Staff in ACE groups (group.admin, group.moderator) always get access.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: maintenance mode is also checked when VORP decides access. RSG-Core: when rsg-queue runs it is the queue, and the in-game menu shows its list read only. ESX: when esx_whitelist runs and its whitelist is on, it decides who may join and Unlimited only runs the queue (Configuration, Whitelist source).","dc_security_1":"Never share the setup token, unlWeb/data.json, a Discord bot token, a webhook URL, the Cloudflare TURN API token or a TURN password. Remove them before you post console output or config.json for support.","dc_security_2":"Put the panel behind HTTPS with a reverse proxy when it is reachable from the internet.","dc_security_3":"Give each role only the permissions it needs. Keep the master account for the owner and check roles after every update.","dc_security_4":"Put secrets in server.cfg with set, never setr. setr sends the value to every player.","dc_security_5":"Tell your players in the rules that staff can listen to in-game voice with Live View, and that a player sees an indicator while being watched by a screencapture stream.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited is a monitoring and administration tool, not an anti-cheat. Do not rely on Live View to catch paid cheat menus.","dc_liveview_1":"Option","dc_liveview_2":"When to use it","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture with its Cloudflare stream","dc_liveview_4":"Most stable and many viewers. Used automatically when set up, with WebRTC as the fallback.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (built in)","dc_liveview_6":"Direct connections fail. Easiest fix.","dc_liveview_7":"Your own TURN server (for example coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"You already run one, or want fixed credentials.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, step by step","dc_liveview_10":"In the Cloudflare dashboard open Realtime, then TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Create a TURN key. Copy the Turn Token ID and the API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Put them in server.cfg with set.","dc_liveview_13":"Restart. With Debug logging on, the console shows the line below.","dc_liveview_14":"Your own TURN server goes in config.json. Keep the STUN line.","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture stream: set up its live worker, then add the lines below. The resource screencapture must start before Unlimited. Limits: 720p, 30 fps, no game audio, a new stream every 30 minutes. To never use it, set unlLiveScreenEngine to webrtc.","dc_liveview_16":"Message","dc_liveview_17":"Fix","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"Add TURN (above).","dc_liveview_20":"Wrong Turn Token ID.","dc_liveview_21":"Wrong API token.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Install screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"The stream drops again and again","dc_liveview_25":"Check the rate limit lines if you use the game-port address.","dc_liveview_26":"Voice: Live View also plays the player's proximity voice in your own game. You need to be in the game with your FiveM name set on your panel user, the role permission Listen to voice, and pma-voice or mumble-voip. In game: /admin, player, Live View; stop with /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Rate limits","dc_logs_1":"Log","dc_logs_2":"Contains","dc_logs_3":"Player","dc_logs_4":"Actions on characters, joins, leaves, kicks, bans, weapon hits.","dc_logs_5":"Game","dc_logs_6":"Deaths, revives, and what other resources send in.","dc_logs_7":"Money","dc_logs_8":"Every money change with account, amount and reason.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Changes to items, jobs, gangs and vehicles.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"Panel audit trail: logins with IP, who changed what.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Startup, system and error lines.","dc_logs_15":"Scripts","dc_logs_16":"Lines that other scripts send in. New scripts show up by themselves.","dc_logs_17":"Search","dc_logs_18":"Finds","dc_logs_19":"Everything about one player, by id or identifier.","dc_logs_20":"The same, by character name.","dc_logs_21":"Only one log type. Use a comma for several: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Lines from one script.","dc_logs_23":"Only info, warn or error lines.","dc_logs_24":"Lines that contain this text.","dc_logs_25":"You can combine operators. Plain text that matches a player shows everything about that player; otherwise it searches the text.","dc_logs_26":"Script owners log into Unlimited with one server-side call. The Scripts tab filters on script, level, category, player and text, and needs the role permission logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Limits: 20 lines per second per script. The script log file rotates at 10 MB and keeps 3 old files.","dc_discord_1":"In Discord: channel settings, Integrations, Webhooks, New Webhook. Copy the webhook URL.","dc_discord_2":"Put it in config.json under the key for that log type, or in server.cfg with set.","dc_discord_3":"Restart the resource. Messages arrive as colour-coded embeds.","dc_discord_4":"Key / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (panel audit)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (general)","dc_discord_7":"A webhook URL is a password: anyone with it can post in your channel. Weapon logs can be turned off (disableWeaponLogs) or kept out of Discord only (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). The queue has its own optional webhook in the queue settings. Discord roles for the whitelist are set up on the Whitelist page.","dc_discord_8":"Whitelist and queue","dc_items_1":"Open Dev, then Items, and open the item.","dc_items_2":"Add effects: health and armour, hunger and thirst, screen effects, animations, sounds, items and money. Each effect can have a delay and a duration in milliseconds (15 seconds is 15000).","dc_items_3":"Save. On FiveM with ox_inventory the effects are saved on the item as unlEffects in your ox_inventory items, which needs the write permission.","dc_items_4":"Use the item in game to test it.","dc_items_5":"Saving fails? See write permission","dc_items_6":"RedM with VORP: open the item and use the Consumable section. The effects are saved in the table unl_item_effects and registered in vorp_inventory at once. A brand-new item still needs a restart of vorp_inventory.","dc_items_7":"Items listed in vorp_metabolism Config.ItemsToUse are left to vorp_metabolism, so nothing runs twice.","dc_items_8":"If another script already registers the item as usable, do not give it effects here. vorp_inventory keeps one handler per item.","dc_items_9":"Sprint and swim multipliers are capped at 1.49 by the game. For visibly faster movement use the move rate override.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Find the lines starting with [Unlimited] in the server console and open exactly the addresses they print.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Look for Oppstart STOPPET (startup failed, the reason follows) or the line below. Change the port if it is taken.","dc_panelclosed_3":"If the console says Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra, the own port is not open at your host. Use the game-port address, with the / at the end.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Open the panel with Debug logging on. If no HTTP GET lines appear, the request never reached the server: wrong address or port, or a firewall.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Behind a reverse proxy, make sure it allows WebSocket upgrades.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Addresses and ports","dc_denied_1":"Management, Users: open your user.","dc_denied_2":"Set the FiveM name to your own identifier, for example the line below.","dc_denied_3":"Check that the user's role has the permissions you expect.","dc_denied_4":"Or use an ACE group: add yourself to group.admin and set unlAdminMenuAceRoles, see the Access topic.","dc_denied_5":"Does /admin open another menu? Another script owns the command. Pick a new one in Configuration.","dc_denied_6":"Give staff access","dc_ratelimit_1":"Add these lines to server.cfg, before ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Restart the server.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Or open the own panel port instead. It is not affected by these limits.","dc_write_1":"Add the add_filesystem_permission lines for your framework. The startup report and the editor pages show the exact lines your server needs.","dc_write_2":"Put them before ensure unlimited-reforge, then restart the server.","dc_write_3":"Still failing? The resource Unlimited writes into must often have the same author in its fxmanifest.lua as Unlimited. Add the line below in both, and restart.","dc_write_4":"Show the permission lines for every framework","dc_console_1":"Console message","dc_console_2":"Meaning and fix","dc_console_3":"Startup failed; the reason follows. The panel will not start.","dc_console_4":"The resource cannot save its data. Check file permissions on the host.","dc_console_5":"Same: the server process needs write access to the resource folder.","dc_console_6":"The panel port is not open at your host. Use the game-port address.","dc_console_7":"Add the rate limit lines.","dc_console_8":"The panel lost its connection, often a 429. Add the rate limit lines.","dc_console_9":"Live View may fail between networks. Set up TURN.","dc_console_10":"No connection between player and viewer. See Live View.","dc_console_11":"Error in the panel; the lines above show the cause.","dc_console_12":"Change the port with unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"The framework is not started yet or has another name. Start Unlimited after it.","dc_console_14":"Setup token does not work: it changes on every restart, use the one from the latest start. Lost the master password: deleting unlWeb/data.json starts the wizard again, but also removes all panel users, roles, notes and waypoints. Copy the file somewhere safe first."},"no":{"dc_install_t":"Installasjon og første oppstart","dc_install_h":"Mappe, server.cfg, oppsetts-token, første innlogging","dc_install_s":"Legg mappen i resources/, legg til ensure-linjen, start serveren og fullfør oppsettsveiviseren i nettleseren. Det er ingen SQL-import og ingen byggesteg.","dc_hosting_t":"Spillhost eller egen server: adresser og porter","dc_hosting_h":"Hvilken adresse du skal bruke, brannmur, domene og HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"Panelet svarer på sin egen port (3000 som standard) og gjennom spillporten. Bruk den egne porten når den er åpen. På en spillhost der bare spillporten er åpen, bruker du adressen via spillporten.","dc_settings_t":"Finn en innstilling","dc_settings_h":"Convars for server.cfg og nøkler for config.json","dc_settings_s":"De fleste innstillinger finner du i panelet under Ledelse, så Konfigurasjon. Convarene og config.json-nøklene under er for ting som må finnes før panelet er oppe, og for hemmeligheter. En convar overstyrer samme nøkkel i config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Sikkerhetskopi, oppdatering og avinstallering","dc_backup_h":"Hva du bør ta vare på, hvordan du oppdaterer trygt, hvordan du fjerner det","dc_backup_s":"Alt du har satt opp ligger i config.json og mappen unlWeb/. Ta vare på de to, så kan du bytte ut resten av resursen når som helst.","dc_access_t":"Gi staben tilgang (panel og i spillet)","dc_access_h":"Roller, brukere, FiveM-ID, /admin og ACE-grupper","dc_access_s":"Nettpanelet og menyen i spillet er to adskilte tilganger. Lag en rolle, lag brukeren, og koble så brukeren til spillkontoen sin.","dc_whitelist_t":"Sett opp hviteliste og kø","dc_whitelist_h":"Tilgangsmodi, Discord-roller, køgrense og prioritet","dc_whitelist_s":"Hvitelisten er av som standard, så du låser ingen ute ved å installere. Slå den på når du er klar. Køen har bare noe å si når serveren er full.","dc_security_t":"Sikkerhet: hva som må holdes privat","dc_security_h":"Hemmeligheter, HTTPS og minst mulig rettigheter","dc_security_s":"Staben logger inn med passord, og panelet kan endre serveren din. Behandle det som et adminverktøy.","dc_liveview_t":"Sett opp Live View","dc_liveview_h":"Skjerm og stemme, TURN for strenge nettverk","dc_liveview_s":"Live View strømmer skjermen til en spiller til nettleseren din med WebRTC, direkte mellom spillet og nettleseren. Det fungerer ofte uten oppsett. Hvis spillerne sitter på mobilnett eller bak strenge rutere, legger du til en TURN-server. Bare FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Søk i og les logger","dc_logs_h":"Logg-typer, Skript-fanen og søkeoperatorer","dc_logs_s":"Logger-siden har én live-fane per logg-type og et søk som leter i dem alle. Historikken lagres i 90 dager som standard (Konfigurasjon).","dc_discord_t":"Send logger til Discord","dc_discord_h":"Én webhook per logg-type","dc_discord_s":"Hver logg-type kan poste til sin egen Discord-kanal via en webhook. Penger har sin egen fordi det er mange meldinger.","dc_items_t":"Få gjenstander til å gjøre noe (effekter)","dc_items_h":"Helse, sult, skjermeffekter, animasjoner, penger","dc_items_s":"Legg effekter på en gjenstand i panelet, så kjøres de når en spiller bruker den. Ingen scripting. Bruk editoren, ikke skriv effektene for hånd.","dc_panelclosed_t":"Panelet åpner seg ikke","dc_panelclosed_h":"Feil adresse, stengt port, resursen er ikke startet","dc_panelclosed_s":"Gå gjennom stegene i rekkefølge. Slå først på Debug logging (Konfigurasjon): da vises hver webforespørsel i konsollen.","dc_denied_t":"«Denied: admin access required» i spillet","dc_denied_h":"Menyen i spillet åpner seg ikke","dc_denied_s":"Menyen i spillet bruker ikke ACE-rettigheter som standard. Den sjekker FiveM-navnet (fxname) på en panelbruker. Hvis det ikke stemmer med identifikatoren din, står det Denied i menyen.","dc_ratelimit_t":"429-feil, eller Live View faller stadig ut","dc_ratelimit_h":"FiveMs forespørselsgrenser er for lave for panelet","dc_ratelimit_s":"Dette skjer når panelet brukes gjennom spillporten. FiveM begrenser forespørsler per IP, og panelet trenger mer. Oppstartsrapporten advarer om det.","dc_write_t":"Lagring feiler: «write not allowed»","dc_write_h":"Editorene for jobb, gjeng, gjenstand og kjøretøy trenger tillatelse","dc_write_s":"Nyere serverartefakter lar bare Unlimited lagre i andre resurser når server.cfg tillater det. Editorene trenger det. Resten av panelet fungerer uten.","dc_console_t":"Hva en konsollmelding betyr","dc_console_h":"Konsollmeldinger og hva du gjør","dc_console_s":"Konsollen er stille som standard: den viser oppstartsoppsummeringen, advarsler og feil. Alt annet (webforespørsler, sockets, Live View-økter) vises bare mens Konfigurasjon, Debug logging er på. Slå den på mens du feilsøker, og av igjen når det virker. Alt blir alltid skrevet til loggfilen.","dc_g_install":"Installer og host","dc_g_access":"Tilgang og stab","dc_g_features":"Funksjoner","dc_g_problems":"Problemer","dc_nav":"Dokumentasjon","dc_title":"Dokumentasjon","dc_lead":"Korte veiledninger for å drive Unlimited Reforged. Velg det du skal gjøre, eller bruk søket øverst.","dc_ask":"Hva trenger du hjelp med?","dc_back":"Tilbake til emnene","dc_more":"Les hele veiledningen","dc_gs":"Trenger du mer hjelp med et steg?","q12":"Hvorfor står det «Denied: admin access required» i spillet?","a12":"Menyen i spillet sjekker FiveM-navnet (fxname) på panelbrukeren din. Sett det til din egen identifikator, eller bruk en ACE-gruppe. Alle stegene står i dokumentasjonen.","dc_install_1":"Pakk ut zip-filen og legg mappen i resources/. Mappenavnet er navnet på resursen og en del av panel-adressen.","dc_install_2":"Legg linjene for rammeverket ditt i server.cfg. Rekkefølgen har noe å si: oxmysql, rammeverk, inventar, og Unlimited sist.","dc_install_3":"På nyere serverartefakter må du også legge til skrivetillatelses-linjene for rammeverket ditt før ensure-linjen.","dc_install_4":"Vis skrivetillatelses-linjene","dc_install_5":"Start serveren. Konsollen skriver ut et engangs oppsetts-token og panel-adressene (linjer som starter med [Unlimited]).","dc_install_6":"Åpne panel-adressen og følg veiviseren: språk, hovedkonto (brukernavn og passord), og lim så inn tokenet. Logg inn.","dc_install_7":"Tokenet endres ved hver omstart, så bruk alltid det nyeste fra konsollen. Unlimited finner rammeverk, inventar og antall plasser selv og skriver én linje om det, for eksempel [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Tabellene i databasen opprettes automatisk.","dc_install_8":"Stemmer ikke panel-adressen? Se adresser og porter","dc_hosting_1":"Vei","dc_hosting_2":"Adresse","dc_hosting_3":"Egen panelport (hjemmeserver, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Spillport (spillhoster der bare spillporten er åpen)","dc_hosting_5":"Gjennom spillporten må du ha med / på slutten. Når resursen starter, skriver konsollen ut de nøyaktige adressene.","dc_hosting_6":"Åpne panelporten (TCP) i brannmuren eller host-panelet. På en spillhost ber du om en ekstra port og setter den i server.cfg.","dc_hosting_7":"Hvis du bruker adressen via spillporten, legger du til rate limit-linjene under. FiveM begrenser forespørsler per IP som standard, og det er for lavt for panelet.","dc_hosting_8":"For et domene med HTTPS setter du en reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy eller Cloudflare) foran. Selve panelet serverer vanlig HTTP. Proxyen må sende videre Host og X-Forwarded-Proto og tillate WebSocket-oppgraderinger.","dc_hosting_9":"Bare hvis panelet ligger på et annet nettsted (unlDisableServe true): list adressen til det nettstedet i unlPanelAllowedOrigins. Det trengs ikke når panelet åpnes fra denne serveren.","dc_hosting_10":"Får du 429-feil? Se rate limits","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Standard","dc_settings_3":"Hva den gjør","dc_settings_4":"Egen panelport.","dc_settings_5":"hostens port, ellers 30120","dc_settings_6":"Spillporten som vises i oppstartsrapporten.","dc_settings_7":"Slå opp den offentlige IP-en ved oppstart.","dc_settings_8":"true = ikke server panelet fra denne resursen (ekstern hosting).","dc_settings_9":"tom","dc_settings_10":"Ekstra webadresser som får bruke panel-APIet fra et annet nettsted, kommaseparert.","dc_settings_11":"Chat-kommando for menyen i spillet. Standard på RedM: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Rapportkommando for spillere. Den kan ikke være lik menykommandoen.","dc_settings_13":"Hvilken panelrolle en ACE-gruppe får, som JSON.","dc_settings_14":"Live View-motor: auto, screencapture eller webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (bruk set, aldri setr).","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API-token (bruk set, aldri setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = ingen melding om ny versjon i konsollen og på Dashboard.","dc_settings_18":"false = slå av live-serverkonsollen i menyen i spillet.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Event fra klesscriptet ditt. Tom = finn automatisk.","dc_settings_21":"config.json-nøkkel","dc_settings_22":"avhenger av inventaret","dc_settings_23":"Hvor stash, bagasjerom og hanskerom ligger. Må stemme med inventaret ditt, ellers ser stash-ene tomme ut.","dc_settings_24":"Som convaren. Tom = standard.","dc_settings_25":"Som convaren. Tom = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"STUN- og TURN-servere for Live View.","dc_settings_28":"Discord-webhook per logg-type. De andre står i emnet om Discord.","dc_settings_29":"true = ingen våpenlogging i det hele tatt.","dc_settings_30":"true = våpenlogger holdes bare utenfor Discord.","dc_settings_31":"config.json må være gyldig JSON. // og /* */ som kommentarer er tillatt. Rammeverk, inventar og antall plasser finnes ut fra det som kjører, og en verdi som ikke passer blir ignorert med en Warning:-linje i konsollen. En gammel config.json kan beholdes.","dc_settings_32":"Discord-webhooks","dc_backup_1":"Sti","dc_backup_2":"Hva som ligger der","dc_backup_3":"Panelbrukere, roller, innstillinger, notater og veipunkter.","dc_backup_4":"Loggfilene: player, game, money, dev, web og scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Dine egne innstillinger og webhooks.","dc_backup_6":"Sikkerhetskopi","dc_backup_7":"Kopier config.json og mappen unlWeb/ til et trygt sted.","dc_backup_8":"Oppdatering","dc_backup_9":"Kopier de nye filene oppå den gamle mappen. Ikke slett mappen først, og slett aldri unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Behold din egen config.json. Sammenlign den med den nye for å se nye valg.","dc_backup_11":"Start serveren på nytt. Sjekk rollene dine etterpå: en rolle som mangler en ny rettighet mister den knappen.","dc_backup_12":"Avinstallering","dc_backup_13":"Fjern ensure-linjen og add_filesystem_permission-linjene fra server.cfg og stopp serveren.","dc_backup_14":"Flytt resursmappen vekk. Ta vare på en kopi av unlWeb/ hvis du kanskje kommer tilbake.","dc_backup_15":"Tabellene Unlimited opprettet i databasen (navn som starter med unl_) og to kolonner (bans.tokens og players.isWhitelisted) blir liggende. De gjør ingen skade. Fjern dem bare hvis du er sikker.","dc_backup_16":"Hvis du sletter unlWeb/data.json, starter oppsettsveiviseren på nytt, og alle panelbrukere, roller, notater og veipunkter forsvinner.","dc_access_1":"Ledelse, Roller: lag en rolle og kryss av bare for rettighetene personen trenger.","dc_access_2":"Ledelse, Brukere: lag brukeren og gi den rollen. En bruker uten rolle kan ikke logge inn.","dc_access_3":"På samme bruker fyller du inn FiveM-navnet (fxname) med identifikatoren deres, for eksempel koden under. Uten det står det Denied i menyen i spillet.","dc_access_4":"I spillet skriver du /admin på FiveM eller /unladmin på RedM.","dc_access_5":"Stab i en ACE-gruppe (fra txAdmin eller add_principal) får også menyen i spillet uten egen panelbruker. Si hvilken panelrolle hver gruppe får. Rollen med det navnet bestemmer hva de kan gjøre. En panelbruker koblet til spilleren går alltid foran. Bruk {} for å slå det av.","dc_access_6":"Hva","dc_access_7":"Slik endrer du det","dc_access_8":"Menykommando: /admin på FiveM, /unladmin på RedM","dc_access_9":"Konfigurasjon, Admin-meny i spillet, eller set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" i server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Rapportkommando for spillere: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Konfigurasjon, Rapportkommando for spillere, eller set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"Hurtigtast for menyen på RedM (en RDR-kontrollhash som 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"Samme sted som menykommandoen. RedM har ingen tastebindinger for scripts, så den er valgfri.","dc_access_14":"Hvis en annen meny allerede bruker /admin (for eksempel qbx_adminmenu), sier konsollen fra om det ved oppstart: velg en annen kommando. På ESX beholder esx_adminmenu /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Handling","dc_access_16":"Rollerettighet","dc_access_17":"Advar, send en melding","dc_access_18":"Spiller: advar","dc_access_19":"Kick","dc_access_20":"Spiller: kick","dc_access_21":"Ban","dc_access_22":"Spiller: ban","dc_access_23":"Live View, se på","dc_access_24":"Spiller: se skjerm","dc_access_25":"Serverkonsoll i menyen: lese / kjøre kommandoer","dc_access_26":"Konfigurasjon: lese / endre","dc_access_27":"Kø: se / slippe inn","dc_access_28":"Hviteliste: lese / endre","dc_access_29":"Får du Denied? Se løsningen","dc_whitelist_1":"Tilgangsmodus","dc_whitelist_2":"Ingen sjekk.","dc_whitelist_3":"En lisens må være på hvitelisten i databasen.","dc_whitelist_4":"Avgjøres av Discord-roller på guilden din.","dc_whitelist_5":"Lokal hviteliste først, så Discord. Dette er standard.","dc_whitelist_6":"Åpne Hviteliste-siden og slå på den globale håndhevingen når du er klar.","dc_whitelist_7":"Velg tilgangsmodus under Tilgangskontroll. For Discord-roller oppgir du guild-ID og bot-token, og gir så hver rolle en prioritet.","dc_whitelist_8":"Sett køgrensen (Max players). Den er sv_maxclients som standard, og den overskrides aldri. Spillere som fortsatt laster ned eller laster inn regnes som tilkoblet og mister aldri plassen sin.","dc_whitelist_9":"Bruk plass-grupper til å reservere plasser, for eksempel til staben. Stab i ACE-grupper (group.admin, group.moderator) får alltid tilgang.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: vedlikeholdsmodus sjekkes også når VORP avgjør tilgang. RSG-Core: når rsg-queue kjører, er det den som er køen, og menyen i spillet viser listen bare for lesing. ESX: når esx_whitelist kjører og hvitelisten er på, avgjør den hvem som slipper inn, og Unlimited kjører bare køen (Konfigurasjon, Whitelist-kilde).","dc_security_1":"Del aldri oppsetts-tokenet, unlWeb/data.json, et Discord-bot-token, en webhook-URL, Cloudflare TURN API-tokenet eller et TURN-passord. Fjern dem før du poster konsollutskrift eller config.json til support.","dc_security_2":"Sett panelet bak HTTPS med en reverse proxy når det kan nås fra internett.","dc_security_3":"Gi hver rolle bare rettighetene den trenger. Hold hovedkontoen for eieren, og sjekk rollene etter hver oppdatering.","dc_security_4":"Legg hemmeligheter i server.cfg med set, aldri setr. setr sender verdien til alle spillere.","dc_security_5":"Fortell spillerne i reglene at staben kan lytte til stemmen i spillet med Live View, og at en spiller ser en indikator mens vedkommende blir sett på via en screencapture-strøm.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited er et verktøy for overvåking og administrasjon, ikke en anti-cheat. Ikke stol på Live View for å ta betalte juksemenyer.","dc_liveview_1":"Valg","dc_liveview_2":"Når du bruker det","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture med Cloudflare-strømmen sin","dc_liveview_4":"Mest stabil og passer for mange seere. Brukes automatisk når det er satt opp, med WebRTC som reserve.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (innebygd)","dc_liveview_6":"Direkte tilkoblinger feiler. Enkleste løsning.","dc_liveview_7":"Din egen TURN-server (for eksempel coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Du kjører en allerede, eller vil ha faste påloggingsdata.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, steg for steg","dc_liveview_10":"Åpne Realtime i Cloudflare-dashbordet, så TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Lag en TURN-nøkkel. Kopier Turn Token ID og API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Legg dem i server.cfg med set.","dc_liveview_13":"Start på nytt. Med Debug logging på viser konsollen linjen under.","dc_liveview_14":"Din egen TURN-server legger du i config.json. Behold STUN-linjen.","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture-strøm: sett opp live-workeren, og legg så til linjene under. Resursen screencapture må starte før Unlimited. Begrensninger: 720p, 30 fps, ingen spill-lyd, ny strøm hvert 30. minutt. Sett unlLiveScreenEngine til webrtc hvis du aldri vil bruke den.","dc_liveview_16":"Melding","dc_liveview_17":"Løsning","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"Legg til TURN (over).","dc_liveview_20":"Feil Turn Token ID.","dc_liveview_21":"Feil API-token.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Installer screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"Strømmen faller ut igjen og igjen","dc_liveview_25":"Sjekk rate limit-linjene hvis du bruker adressen via spillporten.","dc_liveview_26":"Stemme: Live View spiller også av spillerens nærstemme i ditt eget spill. Du må være i spillet med FiveM-navnet satt på panelbrukeren din, ha rollerettigheten Lytte på voice, og ha pma-voice eller mumble-voip. I spillet: /admin, spiller, Live View. Avslutt med /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Rate limits","dc_logs_1":"Logg","dc_logs_2":"Inneholder","dc_logs_3":"Spiller","dc_logs_4":"Handlinger på karakterer, innlogginger, utlogginger, kicks, bans, våpentreff.","dc_logs_5":"Spill","dc_logs_6":"Dødsfall, gjenopplivinger og det andre resurser sender inn.","dc_logs_7":"Penger","dc_logs_8":"Hver pengeendring med konto, beløp og årsak.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Endringer i gjenstander, jobber, gjenger og kjøretøy.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"Revisjonsspor for panelet: innlogginger med IP, hvem som endret hva.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Oppstarts-, system- og feillinjer.","dc_logs_15":"Skript","dc_logs_16":"Linjer som andre scripts sender inn. Nye scripts dukker opp av seg selv.","dc_logs_17":"Søk","dc_logs_18":"Finner","dc_logs_19":"Alt om én spiller, på id eller identifikator.","dc_logs_20":"Det samme, på karakternavn.","dc_logs_21":"Bare én logg-type. Bruk komma for flere: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Linjer fra ett script.","dc_logs_23":"Bare info-, warn- eller error-linjer.","dc_logs_24":"Linjer som inneholder denne teksten.","dc_logs_25":"Du kan kombinere operatorer. Vanlig tekst som treffer en spiller, viser alt om den spilleren. Ellers søkes det i teksten.","dc_logs_26":"Script-eiere logger inn i Unlimited med ett kall på serversiden. Skript-fanen filtrerer på script, nivå, kategori, spiller og tekst, og krever rollerettigheten logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Begrensninger: 20 linjer per sekund per script. Script-loggfilen roterer ved 10 MB og beholder 3 gamle filer.","dc_discord_1":"I Discord: kanalinnstillinger, Integrations, Webhooks, New Webhook. Kopier webhook-URL-en.","dc_discord_2":"Legg den i config.json under nøkkelen for den logg-typen, eller i server.cfg med set.","dc_discord_3":"Start resursen på nytt. Meldingene kommer som fargekodede embeds.","dc_discord_4":"Nøkkel / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (panelets revisjonsspor)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (generelt)","dc_discord_7":"En webhook-URL er som et passord: alle som har den kan poste i kanalen din. Våpenlogger kan slås av (disableWeaponLogs) eller holdes bare utenfor Discord (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). Køen har sin egen valgfrie webhook i køinnstillingene. Discord-roller for hvitelisten setter du opp på Hviteliste-siden.","dc_discord_8":"Hviteliste og kø","dc_items_1":"Åpne Dev, så Artikler, og åpne gjenstanden.","dc_items_2":"Legg til effekter: helse og rustning, sult og tørst, skjermeffekter, animasjoner, lyder, gjenstander og penger. Hver effekt kan ha en forsinkelse og en varighet i millisekunder (15 sekunder er 15000).","dc_items_3":"Lagre. På FiveM med ox_inventory lagres effektene på gjenstanden som unlEffects i ox_inventory-gjenstandene dine, og det krever skrivetillatelsen.","dc_items_4":"Bruk gjenstanden i spillet for å teste den.","dc_items_5":"Feiler lagringen? Se skrivetillatelse","dc_items_6":"RedM med VORP: åpne gjenstanden og bruk Consumable-delen. Effektene lagres i tabellen unl_item_effects og registreres i vorp_inventory med en gang. En helt ny gjenstand krever fortsatt omstart av vorp_inventory.","dc_items_7":"Gjenstander som står i vorp_metabolism Config.ItemsToUse overlates til vorp_metabolism, så ingenting kjører to ganger.","dc_items_8":"Hvis et annet script allerede registrerer gjenstanden som brukbar, må du ikke gi den effekter her. vorp_inventory har én handler per gjenstand.","dc_items_9":"Sprint- og svømmemultiplikatorer er begrenset til 1.49 av spillet. For synlig raskere bevegelse bruker du move rate override.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Finn linjene som starter med [Unlimited] i serverkonsollen, og åpne nøyaktig de adressene de skriver ut.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Se etter Oppstart STOPPET (oppstarten feilet, årsaken følger) eller linjen under. Bytt port hvis den er opptatt.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Hvis konsollen sier Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra, er den egne porten ikke åpen hos hosten din. Bruk adressen via spillporten, med / på slutten.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Åpne panelet med Debug logging på. Hvis det ikke dukker opp noen HTTP GET-linjer, kom forespørselen aldri fram til serveren: feil adresse eller port, eller en brannmur.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Bak en reverse proxy må du sørge for at den tillater WebSocket-oppgraderinger.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Adresser og porter","dc_denied_1":"Ledelse, Brukere: åpne brukeren din.","dc_denied_2":"Sett FiveM-navnet til din egen identifikator, for eksempel linjen under.","dc_denied_3":"Sjekk at rollen til brukeren har rettighetene du forventer.","dc_denied_4":"Eller bruk en ACE-gruppe: legg deg selv til i group.admin og sett unlAdminMenuAceRoles, se emnet om tilgang.","dc_denied_5":"Åpner /admin en annen meny? Da bruker et annet script kommandoen. Velg en ny i Konfigurasjon.","dc_denied_6":"Gi staben tilgang","dc_ratelimit_1":"Legg disse linjene i server.cfg, før ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Start serveren på nytt.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Eller åpne den egne panelporten i stedet. Den påvirkes ikke av disse grensene.","dc_write_1":"Legg til add_filesystem_permission-linjene for rammeverket ditt. Oppstartsrapporten og editor-sidene viser nøyaktig hvilke linjer serveren din trenger.","dc_write_2":"Legg dem før ensure unlimited-reforge, og start serveren på nytt.","dc_write_3":"Feiler det fortsatt? Resursen Unlimited skriver til må ofte ha samme forfatter i fxmanifest.lua som Unlimited. Legg til linjen under i begge, og start på nytt.","dc_write_4":"Vis tillatelseslinjene for alle rammeverk","dc_console_1":"Konsollmelding","dc_console_2":"Betydning og løsning","dc_console_3":"Oppstarten feilet, årsaken følger. Panelet starter ikke.","dc_console_4":"Resursen kan ikke lagre dataene sine. Sjekk filrettighetene på hosten.","dc_console_5":"Det samme: serverprosessen trenger skrivetilgang til resursmappen.","dc_console_6":"Panelporten er ikke åpen hos hosten din. Bruk adressen via spillporten.","dc_console_7":"Legg til rate limit-linjene.","dc_console_8":"Panelet mistet tilkoblingen, ofte på grunn av en 429. Legg til rate limit-linjene.","dc_console_9":"Live View kan feile mellom nettverk. Sett opp TURN.","dc_console_10":"Ingen forbindelse mellom spiller og seer. Se Live View.","dc_console_11":"Feil i panelet. Linjene over viser årsaken.","dc_console_12":"Bytt port med unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"Rammeverket er ikke startet ennå, eller har et annet navn. Start Unlimited etter det.","dc_console_14":"Oppsetts-tokenet virker ikke: det endres ved hver omstart, så bruk det fra siste oppstart. Mistet hovedpassordet: hvis du sletter unlWeb/data.json, starter veiviseren på nytt, men alle panelbrukere, roller, notater og veipunkter blir også borte. Kopier filen et trygt sted først."},"de":{"dc_install_t":"Installation und erster Start","dc_install_h":"Ordner, server.cfg, Setup-Token, erste Anmeldung","dc_install_s":"Lege den Ordner in resources/, füge die ensure-Zeile hinzu, starte den Server und schließe den Einrichtungsassistenten im Browser ab. Es gibt keinen SQL-Import und keinen Build-Schritt.","dc_hosting_t":"Game-Host oder eigener Server: Adressen und Ports","dc_hosting_h":"Welche Adresse du nimmst, Firewall, Domain und HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"Das Panel antwortet auf einem eigenen Port (standardmäßig 3000) und über den Game-Port. Nimm den eigenen Port, wenn er erreichbar ist. Bei einem Game-Host, bei dem nur der Game-Port offen ist, nimm die Adresse über den Game-Port.","dc_settings_t":"Eine Einstellung finden","dc_settings_h":"Convars für server.cfg und Schlüssel für config.json","dc_settings_s":"Die meisten Einstellungen findest du im Panel unter Verwaltung, dann Einstellungen. Die Convars und config.json-Schlüssel unten sind für Dinge, die vor dem Start des Panels vorhanden sein müssen, und für Geheimnisse. Eine Convar überschreibt denselben Schlüssel in config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Sichern, aktualisieren und deinstallieren","dc_backup_h":"Was du aufbewahren solltest, wie du sicher aktualisierst, wie du es entfernst","dc_backup_s":"Alles, was du eingerichtet hast, liegt in config.json und im Ordner unlWeb/. Behalte diese beiden, dann kannst du den Rest der Resource jederzeit ersetzen.","dc_access_t":"Team-Zugriff geben (Panel und im Spiel)","dc_access_h":"Rollen, Benutzer, FiveM-ID, /admin und ACE-Gruppen","dc_access_s":"Das Web-Panel und das Menü im Spiel sind zwei getrennte Zugänge. Erstelle eine Rolle, erstelle den Benutzer und verknüpfe ihn dann mit seinem Spielkonto.","dc_whitelist_t":"Whitelist und Warteschlange einrichten","dc_whitelist_h":"Zugriffsmodi, Discord-Rollen, Warteschlangen-Limit und Priorität","dc_whitelist_s":"Die Whitelist ist standardmäßig aus, die Installation sperrt also niemanden aus. Schalte sie ein, wenn du bereit bist. Die Warteschlange spielt nur eine Rolle, wenn der Server voll ist.","dc_security_t":"Sicherheit: was privat bleiben muss","dc_security_h":"Geheimnisse, HTTPS und minimale Rechte","dc_security_s":"Das Team meldet sich mit Passwörtern an, und das Panel kann deinen Server verändern. Behandle es wie ein Admin-Werkzeug.","dc_liveview_t":"Live View einrichten","dc_liveview_h":"Bildschirm und Sprache, TURN für strenge Netzwerke","dc_liveview_s":"Die Live View streamt den Bildschirm eines Spielers per WebRTC in deinen Browser, direkt zwischen Spiel und Browser. Oft funktioniert sie ohne Einrichtung. Wenn Spieler im Mobilfunknetz oder hinter strengen Routern sind, füge einen TURN-Server hinzu. Nur FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Logs durchsuchen und lesen","dc_logs_h":"Log-Typen, der Tab Skripte und Suchoperatoren","dc_logs_s":"Die Seite Logs hat pro Log-Typ einen Live-Tab und eine Suche, die alle durchsucht. Der Verlauf wird standardmäßig 90 Tage gespeichert (Einstellungen).","dc_discord_t":"Logs an Discord senden","dc_discord_h":"Ein Webhook pro Log-Typ","dc_discord_s":"Jeder Log-Typ kann über einen Webhook in einen eigenen Discord-Kanal posten. Geld hat einen eigenen, weil dort viel anfällt.","dc_items_t":"Items etwas bewirken lassen (Effekte)","dc_items_h":"Gesundheit, Hunger, Bildschirmeffekte, Animationen, Geld","dc_items_s":"Hänge im Panel Effekte an ein Item, dann laufen sie, wenn ein Spieler es benutzt. Ohne Scripting. Nutze den Editor und schreibe die Effekte nicht von Hand.","dc_panelclosed_t":"Das Panel öffnet sich nicht","dc_panelclosed_h":"Falsche Adresse, geschlossener Port, Resource nicht gestartet","dc_panelclosed_s":"Geh die Schritte der Reihe nach durch. Schalte zuerst Debug logging ein (Einstellungen): Dann erscheint jede Web-Anfrage in der Konsole.","dc_denied_t":"„Denied: admin access required“ im Spiel","dc_denied_h":"Das Menü im Spiel öffnet sich nicht","dc_denied_s":"Das Menü im Spiel nutzt standardmäßig keine ACE-Rechte. Es prüft den FiveM-Namen (fxname) eines Panel-Benutzers. Passt er nicht zu deinem Identifier, zeigt das Menü Denied.","dc_ratelimit_t":"429-Fehler oder die Live View bricht ständig ab","dc_ratelimit_h":"Die Anfrage-Limits von FiveM sind für das Panel zu niedrig","dc_ratelimit_s":"Das passiert, wenn das Panel über den Game-Port genutzt wird. FiveM begrenzt Anfragen pro IP, und das Panel braucht mehr. Der Startbericht warnt davor.","dc_write_t":"Speichern schlägt fehl: „write not allowed“","dc_write_h":"Die Editoren für Jobs, Gangs, Items und Fahrzeuge brauchen eine Erlaubnis","dc_write_s":"Neuere Server-Artifacts lassen Unlimited nur dann in andere Resources speichern, wenn server.cfg es erlaubt. Die Editoren brauchen das. Der Rest des Panels funktioniert auch ohne.","dc_console_t":"Was eine Konsolenmeldung bedeutet","dc_console_h":"Konsolenmeldungen und was zu tun ist","dc_console_s":"Die Konsole ist standardmäßig ruhig: Sie zeigt die Startzusammenfassung, Warnungen und Fehler. Alles andere (Web-Anfragen, Sockets, Live View-Sitzungen) erscheint nur, solange Einstellungen, Debug logging an ist. Schalte es zur Fehlersuche ein und danach wieder aus. Alles wird immer in die Logdatei geschrieben.","dc_g_install":"Installation und Hosting","dc_g_access":"Zugriff und Team","dc_g_features":"Funktionen","dc_g_problems":"Probleme","dc_nav":"Doku","dc_title":"Dokumentation","dc_lead":"Kurze Anleitungen für den Betrieb von Unlimited Reforged. Such dir aus, was du tun willst, oder nutze die Suche oben.","dc_ask":"Wobei brauchst du Hilfe?","dc_back":"Zurück zu den Themen","dc_more":"Die ganze Anleitung lesen","dc_gs":"Brauchst du bei einem Schritt mehr Hilfe?","q12":"Warum zeigt das Spiel „Denied: admin access required“?","a12":"Das Menü im Spiel prüft den FiveM-Namen (fxname) deines Panel-Benutzers. Setze ihn auf deinen eigenen Identifier oder nutze eine ACE-Gruppe. Alle Schritte stehen in der Dokumentation.","dc_install_1":"Entpacke die Zip-Datei und lege den Ordner in resources/. Der Ordnername ist der Name der Resource und Teil der Panel-Adresse.","dc_install_2":"Füge die Zeilen für dein Framework in server.cfg ein. Die Reihenfolge ist wichtig: oxmysql, Framework, Inventar, und Unlimited zuletzt.","dc_install_3":"Bei neueren Server-Artifacts füge vor der ensure-Zeile auch die Schreibrechte-Zeilen für dein Framework hinzu.","dc_install_4":"Schreibrechte-Zeilen anzeigen","dc_install_5":"Starte den Server. Die Konsole gibt ein einmaliges Setup-Token und die Panel-Adressen aus (Zeilen, die mit [Unlimited] beginnen).","dc_install_6":"Öffne die Panel-Adresse und folge dem Assistenten: Sprache, Master-Konto (Benutzername und Passwort), dann das Token einfügen. Melde dich an.","dc_install_7":"Das Token ändert sich bei jedem Neustart, nimm also immer das neueste aus der Konsole. Unlimited erkennt Framework, Inventar und Slot-Anzahl selbst und gibt dazu eine Zeile aus, zum Beispiel [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Die Tabellen in der Datenbank werden automatisch angelegt.","dc_install_8":"Die Panel-Adresse passt nicht? Siehe Adressen und Ports","dc_hosting_1":"Weg","dc_hosting_2":"Adresse","dc_hosting_3":"Eigener Panel-Port (Heimserver, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Game-Port (Game-Hosts, bei denen nur der Game-Port offen ist)","dc_hosting_5":"Über den Game-Port musst du den / am Ende behalten. Beim Start der Resource gibt die Konsole die genauen Adressen aus.","dc_hosting_6":"Öffne den Panel-Port (TCP) in deiner Firewall oder im Host-Panel. Bei einem Game-Host frag nach einem zusätzlichen Port und trage ihn in server.cfg ein.","dc_hosting_7":"Wenn du die Adresse über den Game-Port nutzt, füge die Rate-Limit-Zeilen unten hinzu. FiveM begrenzt Anfragen standardmäßig pro IP, und das ist für das Panel zu wenig.","dc_hosting_8":"Für eine Domain mit HTTPS setze einen Reverse Proxy (nginx, Caddy oder Cloudflare) davor. Das Panel selbst liefert einfaches HTTP. Der Proxy muss Host und X-Forwarded-Proto weitergeben und WebSocket-Upgrades erlauben.","dc_hosting_9":"Nur wenn das Panel auf einer anderen Seite gehostet wird (unlDisableServe true): Trage die Adresse dieser Seite in unlPanelAllowedOrigins ein. Wird das Panel von diesem Server geöffnet, ist das nicht nötig.","dc_hosting_10":"429-Fehler? Siehe Rate Limits","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Standard","dc_settings_3":"Was sie bewirkt","dc_settings_4":"Eigener Panel-Port.","dc_settings_5":"Host-Port, sonst 30120","dc_settings_6":"Game-Port, der im Startbericht angezeigt wird.","dc_settings_7":"Beim Start die öffentliche IP abfragen.","dc_settings_8":"true = das Panel nicht von dieser Resource ausliefern (externes Hosting).","dc_settings_9":"leer","dc_settings_10":"Weitere Web-Adressen, die die Panel-API von einer anderen Seite aus nutzen dürfen, durch Komma getrennt.","dc_settings_11":"Chat-Befehl für das Menü im Spiel. Standard bei RedM: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Melde-Befehl für Spieler. Er darf nicht derselbe sein wie der Menü-Befehl.","dc_settings_13":"Welche Panel-Rolle eine ACE-Gruppe bekommt, als JSON.","dc_settings_14":"Live View-Engine: auto, screencapture oder webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (set verwenden, nie setr).","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API-Token (set verwenden, nie setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = keine Hinweise auf neue Versionen in der Konsole und im Dashboard.","dc_settings_18":"false = die Live-Serverkonsole im Menü im Spiel ausschalten.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Event deines Kleidungs-Scripts. Leer = automatisch erkennen.","dc_settings_21":"config.json-Schlüssel","dc_settings_22":"hängt vom Inventar ab","dc_settings_23":"Wo Stashes, Kofferräume und Handschuhfächer liegen. Muss zu deinem Inventar passen, sonst wirken Stashes leer.","dc_settings_24":"Wie die Convar. Leer = Standard.","dc_settings_25":"Wie die Convar. Leer = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"STUN- und TURN-Server für die Live View.","dc_settings_28":"Discord-Webhook pro Log-Typ. Die anderen stehen im Thema Discord.","dc_settings_29":"true = überhaupt keine Waffen-Logs.","dc_settings_30":"true = Waffen-Logs bleiben nur aus Discord heraus.","dc_settings_31":"config.json muss gültiges JSON sein; // und /* */ als Kommentare sind erlaubt. Framework-Namen, Inventar und Slots werden aus dem erkannt, was läuft. Ein Wert, der nicht passt, wird ignoriert und mit einer Warning:-Zeile in der Konsole gemeldet. Eine alte config.json kann bleiben.","dc_settings_32":"Discord-Webhooks","dc_backup_1":"Pfad","dc_backup_2":"Was darin liegt","dc_backup_3":"Panel-Benutzer, Rollen, Einstellungen, Notizen und Wegpunkte.","dc_backup_4":"Die Logdateien: player, game, money, dev, web und scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Deine eigenen Einstellungen und Webhooks.","dc_backup_6":"Sichern","dc_backup_7":"Kopiere config.json und den Ordner unlWeb/ an einen sicheren Ort.","dc_backup_8":"Aktualisieren","dc_backup_9":"Kopiere die neuen Dateien über den alten Ordner. Lösche den Ordner nicht vorher und lösche niemals unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Behalte deine eigene config.json. Vergleiche sie mit der neuen, um neue Optionen zu finden.","dc_backup_11":"Starte den Server neu. Prüfe danach deine Rollen: Einer Rolle, der ein neues Recht fehlt, fehlt auch dieser Button.","dc_backup_12":"Deinstallieren","dc_backup_13":"Entferne die ensure-Zeile und die add_filesystem_permission-Zeilen aus server.cfg und stoppe den Server.","dc_backup_14":"Verschiebe den Resource-Ordner weg. Behalte eine Kopie von unlWeb/, falls du zurückkommen willst.","dc_backup_15":"Die Tabellen, die Unlimited in der Datenbank angelegt hat (Namen beginnen mit unl_), und zwei Spalten (bans.tokens und players.isWhitelisted) bleiben bestehen. Sie schaden nicht. Entferne sie nur, wenn du sicher bist.","dc_backup_16":"Wenn du unlWeb/data.json löschst, startet der Einrichtungsassistent neu, und alle Panel-Benutzer, Rollen, Notizen und Wegpunkte sind weg.","dc_access_1":"Verwaltung, Rollen: Erstelle eine Rolle und hake nur die Rechte an, die die Person braucht.","dc_access_2":"Verwaltung, Benutzer: Erstelle den Benutzer und weise die Rolle zu. Ein Benutzer ohne Rolle kann sich nicht anmelden.","dc_access_3":"Trage beim selben Benutzer den FiveM-Namen (fxname) mit seinem Identifier ein, zum Beispiel den Code unten. Ohne ihn zeigt das Menü im Spiel Denied.","dc_access_4":"Tippe im Spiel /admin bei FiveM oder /unladmin bei RedM.","dc_access_5":"Team-Mitglieder mit einer ACE-Gruppe (aus txAdmin oder add_principal) bekommen das Menü im Spiel auch ohne eigenen Panel-Benutzer. Lege fest, welche Panel-Rolle jede Gruppe bekommt; die Rolle mit diesem Namen bestimmt, was sie tun dürfen. Ein mit dem Spieler verknüpfter Panel-Benutzer hat immer Vorrang. Mit {} schaltest du es aus.","dc_access_6":"Was","dc_access_7":"So änderst du es","dc_access_8":"Menü-Befehl: /admin bei FiveM, /unladmin bei RedM","dc_access_9":"Einstellungen, Admin-Menü im Spiel, oder set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" in server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Melde-Befehl für Spieler: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Einstellungen, Melde-Befehl für Spieler, oder set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"RedM-Hotkey für das Menü (ein RDR-Control-Hash wie 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"Am selben Ort wie der Menü-Befehl. RedM hat keine Tastenbelegung für Scripts, daher ist er optional.","dc_access_14":"Wenn ein anderes Menü /admin schon belegt (zum Beispiel qbx_adminmenu), sagt das die Konsole beim Start: Nimm einen anderen Befehl. Bei ESX behält esx_adminmenu /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Aktion","dc_access_16":"Rollenrecht","dc_access_17":"Verwarnen, Nachricht senden","dc_access_18":"Spieler: verwarnen","dc_access_19":"Kicken","dc_access_20":"Spieler: kicken","dc_access_21":"Bannen","dc_access_22":"Spieler: bannen","dc_access_23":"Live View, zuschauen","dc_access_24":"Spieler: Bildschirm ansehen","dc_access_25":"Server-Konsole im Menü: lesen / Befehle ausführen","dc_access_26":"Einstellungen: lesen / ändern","dc_access_27":"Warteschlange: ansehen / durchlassen","dc_access_28":"Whitelist: lesen / ändern","dc_access_29":"Denied? Siehe die Lösung","dc_whitelist_1":"Zugriffsmodus","dc_whitelist_2":"Keine Prüfung.","dc_whitelist_3":"Eine Lizenz muss in der Datenbank auf der Whitelist stehen.","dc_whitelist_4":"Wird über Discord-Rollen auf deiner Guild entschieden.","dc_whitelist_5":"Erst die lokale Whitelist, dann Discord. Das ist der Standard.","dc_whitelist_6":"Öffne die Seite Whitelist und schalte die globale Durchsetzung ein, wenn du bereit bist.","dc_whitelist_7":"Wähle den Zugriffsmodus unter Zugriffskontrolle. Für Discord-Rollen gib die Guild-ID und das Bot-Token ein und gib dann jeder Rolle eine Priorität.","dc_whitelist_8":"Lege das Warteschlangen-Limit fest (Max players). Standard ist sv_maxclients, das nie überschritten wird. Spieler, die noch herunterladen oder laden, zählen als verbunden und verlieren ihren Platz nie.","dc_whitelist_9":"Nutze Platzgruppen, um Plätze zu reservieren, zum Beispiel für das Team. Team-Mitglieder in ACE-Gruppen (group.admin, group.moderator) bekommen immer Zugang.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: Der Wartungsmodus wird auch geprüft, wenn VORP über den Zugang entscheidet. RSG-Core: Läuft rsg-queue, ist es die Warteschlange, und das Menü im Spiel zeigt deren Liste nur lesend. ESX: Läuft esx_whitelist und ist dessen Whitelist an, entscheidet es, wer beitreten darf, und Unlimited betreibt nur die Warteschlange (Einstellungen, Whitelist-Quelle).","dc_security_1":"Gib niemals das Setup-Token, unlWeb/data.json, ein Discord-Bot-Token, eine Webhook-URL, das Cloudflare TURN API-Token oder ein TURN-Passwort weiter. Entferne sie, bevor du Konsolenausgaben oder config.json für den Support postest.","dc_security_2":"Setze das Panel mit einem Reverse Proxy hinter HTTPS, wenn es aus dem Internet erreichbar ist.","dc_security_3":"Gib jeder Rolle nur die Rechte, die sie braucht. Halte das Master-Konto für den Besitzer frei und prüfe die Rollen nach jedem Update.","dc_security_4":"Lege Geheimnisse mit set in server.cfg, nie mit setr. setr sendet den Wert an jeden Spieler.","dc_security_5":"Sag deinen Spielern in den Regeln, dass das Team mit der Live View die Sprache im Spiel mithören kann und dass ein Spieler einen Hinweis sieht, während er über einen screencapture-Stream beobachtet wird.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited ist ein Werkzeug zur Überwachung und Verwaltung, kein Anti-Cheat. Verlass dich nicht darauf, mit der Live View bezahlte Cheat-Menüs zu erwischen.","dc_liveview_1":"Option","dc_liveview_2":"Wann du sie nimmst","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture mit seinem Cloudflare-Stream","dc_liveview_4":"Am stabilsten und für viele Zuschauer. Wird automatisch genutzt, wenn eingerichtet, mit WebRTC als Ersatz.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (eingebaut)","dc_liveview_6":"Direkte Verbindungen schlagen fehl. Einfachste Lösung.","dc_liveview_7":"Dein eigener TURN-Server (zum Beispiel coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Du betreibst schon einen oder willst feste Zugangsdaten.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, Schritt für Schritt","dc_liveview_10":"Öffne im Cloudflare-Dashboard Realtime, dann TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Erstelle einen TURN-Key. Kopiere die Turn Token ID und das API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Trage sie mit set in server.cfg ein.","dc_liveview_13":"Starte neu. Bei aktivem Debug logging zeigt die Konsole die Zeile unten.","dc_liveview_14":"Dein eigener TURN-Server kommt in config.json. Behalte die STUN-Zeile.","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture-Stream: Richte den Live-Worker ein und füge dann die Zeilen unten hinzu. Die Resource screencapture muss vor Unlimited starten. Grenzen: 720p, 30 fps, kein Spiel-Audio, alle 30 Minuten ein neuer Stream. Setze unlLiveScreenEngine auf webrtc, wenn du ihn nie nutzen willst.","dc_liveview_16":"Meldung","dc_liveview_17":"Lösung","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"TURN hinzufügen (siehe oben).","dc_liveview_20":"Falsche Turn Token ID.","dc_liveview_21":"Falsches API-Token.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Installiere screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"Der Stream bricht immer wieder ab","dc_liveview_25":"Prüfe die Rate-Limit-Zeilen, wenn du die Adresse über den Game-Port nutzt.","dc_liveview_26":"Sprache: Die Live View spielt auch die Nahbereichs-Sprache des Spielers in deinem eigenen Spiel ab. Du musst im Spiel sein, den FiveM-Namen bei deinem Panel-Benutzer gesetzt haben, das Rollenrecht Sprache mithören besitzen und pma-voice oder mumble-voip nutzen. Im Spiel: /admin, Spieler, Live View; beenden mit /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Rate Limits","dc_logs_1":"Log","dc_logs_2":"Enthält","dc_logs_3":"Spieler","dc_logs_4":"Aktionen an Charakteren, Beitritte, Austritte, Kicks, Bans, Waffentreffer.","dc_logs_5":"Game","dc_logs_6":"Tode, Wiederbelebungen und alles, was andere Resources einsenden.","dc_logs_7":"Geld","dc_logs_8":"Jede Geldänderung mit Konto, Betrag und Grund.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Änderungen an Items, Jobs, Gangs und Fahrzeugen.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"Audit-Protokoll des Panels: Anmeldungen mit IP, wer was geändert hat.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Start-, System- und Fehlerzeilen.","dc_logs_15":"Skripte","dc_logs_16":"Zeilen, die andere Scripts einsenden. Neue Scripts erscheinen von selbst.","dc_logs_17":"Suche","dc_logs_18":"Findet","dc_logs_19":"Alles zu einem Spieler, per ID oder Identifier.","dc_logs_20":"Dasselbe, per Charaktername.","dc_logs_21":"Nur einen Log-Typ. Nimm ein Komma für mehrere: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Zeilen eines Scripts.","dc_logs_23":"Nur info-, warn- oder error-Zeilen.","dc_logs_24":"Zeilen, die diesen Text enthalten.","dc_logs_25":"Du kannst Operatoren kombinieren. Einfacher Text, der zu einem Spieler passt, zeigt alles zu diesem Spieler; sonst wird der Text gesucht.","dc_logs_26":"Script-Besitzer loggen mit einem Server-Aufruf in Unlimited. Der Tab Skripte filtert nach Script, Level, Kategorie, Spieler und Text und braucht das Rollenrecht logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Grenzen: 20 Zeilen pro Sekunde pro Script. Die Script-Logdatei rotiert bei 10 MB und behält 3 alte Dateien.","dc_discord_1":"In Discord: Kanaleinstellungen, Integrations, Webhooks, New Webhook. Kopiere die Webhook-URL.","dc_discord_2":"Trage sie in config.json unter dem Schlüssel für diesen Log-Typ ein oder in server.cfg mit set.","dc_discord_3":"Starte die Resource neu. Die Nachrichten kommen als farbcodierte Embeds an.","dc_discord_4":"Schlüssel / Convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (Panel-Audit)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (allgemein)","dc_discord_7":"Eine Webhook-URL ist wie ein Passwort: Jeder, der sie hat, kann in deinem Kanal posten. Waffen-Logs kannst du ausschalten (disableWeaponLogs) oder nur aus Discord heraushalten (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). Die Warteschlange hat in ihren Einstellungen einen eigenen, optionalen Webhook. Discord-Rollen für die Whitelist richtest du auf der Seite Whitelist ein.","dc_discord_8":"Whitelist und Warteschlange","dc_items_1":"Öffne Dev, dann Items, und öffne das Item.","dc_items_2":"Füge Effekte hinzu: Gesundheit und Rüstung, Hunger und Durst, Bildschirmeffekte, Animationen, Sounds, Items und Geld. Jeder Effekt kann eine Verzögerung und eine Dauer in Millisekunden haben (15 Sekunden sind 15000).","dc_items_3":"Speichere. Bei FiveM mit ox_inventory werden die Effekte als unlEffects am Item in deinen ox_inventory-Items gespeichert, wofür die Schreibrechte nötig sind.","dc_items_4":"Benutze das Item im Spiel, um es zu testen.","dc_items_5":"Speichern schlägt fehl? Siehe Schreibrechte","dc_items_6":"RedM mit VORP: Öffne das Item und nutze den Bereich Consumable. Die Effekte werden in der Tabelle unl_item_effects gespeichert und sofort in vorp_inventory registriert. Ein ganz neues Item braucht weiterhin einen Neustart von vorp_inventory.","dc_items_7":"Items, die in vorp_metabolism Config.ItemsToUse stehen, überlässt Unlimited vorp_metabolism, damit nichts doppelt läuft.","dc_items_8":"Wenn ein anderes Script das Item schon als benutzbar registriert, gib ihm hier keine Effekte. vorp_inventory hält pro Item einen Handler.","dc_items_9":"Sprint- und Schwimm-Multiplikatoren sind vom Spiel auf 1.49 begrenzt. Für sichtbar schnellere Bewegung nutze move rate override.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Suche in der Server-Konsole die Zeilen, die mit [Unlimited] beginnen, und öffne genau die Adressen, die sie ausgeben.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Suche nach Oppstart STOPPET (der Start ist fehlgeschlagen, der Grund folgt) oder der Zeile unten. Ändere den Port, wenn er belegt ist.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Wenn die Konsole Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra meldet, ist der eigene Port bei deinem Host nicht offen. Nimm die Adresse über den Game-Port, mit dem / am Ende.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Öffne das Panel bei aktivem Debug logging. Erscheinen keine HTTP GET-Zeilen, hat die Anfrage den Server nie erreicht: falsche Adresse oder falscher Port, oder eine Firewall.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Stelle bei einem Reverse Proxy sicher, dass er WebSocket-Upgrades erlaubt.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Adressen und Ports","dc_denied_1":"Verwaltung, Benutzer: Öffne deinen Benutzer.","dc_denied_2":"Setze den FiveM-Namen auf deinen eigenen Identifier, zum Beispiel die Zeile unten.","dc_denied_3":"Prüfe, ob die Rolle des Benutzers die erwarteten Rechte hat.","dc_denied_4":"Oder nutze eine ACE-Gruppe: Füge dich zu group.admin hinzu und setze unlAdminMenuAceRoles, siehe das Thema Zugriff.","dc_denied_5":"Öffnet /admin ein anderes Menü? Dann belegt ein anderes Script den Befehl. Wähle in den Einstellungen einen neuen.","dc_denied_6":"Team-Zugriff geben","dc_ratelimit_1":"Füge diese Zeilen in server.cfg ein, vor ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Starte den Server neu.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Oder öffne stattdessen den eigenen Panel-Port. Er ist von diesen Limits nicht betroffen.","dc_write_1":"Füge die add_filesystem_permission-Zeilen für dein Framework hinzu. Der Startbericht und die Editor-Seiten zeigen die genauen Zeilen, die dein Server braucht.","dc_write_2":"Setze sie vor ensure unlimited-reforge und starte den Server neu.","dc_write_3":"Klappt es immer noch nicht? Die Resource, in die Unlimited schreibt, muss oft denselben Autor in ihrer fxmanifest.lua haben wie Unlimited. Füge die Zeile unten in beiden ein und starte neu.","dc_write_4":"Die Rechte-Zeilen für alle Frameworks anzeigen","dc_console_1":"Konsolenmeldung","dc_console_2":"Bedeutung und Lösung","dc_console_3":"Start fehlgeschlagen; der Grund folgt. Das Panel startet nicht.","dc_console_4":"Die Resource kann ihre Daten nicht speichern. Prüfe die Dateirechte auf dem Host.","dc_console_5":"Dasselbe: Der Server-Prozess braucht Schreibzugriff auf den Resource-Ordner.","dc_console_6":"Der Panel-Port ist bei deinem Host nicht offen. Nimm die Adresse über den Game-Port.","dc_console_7":"Füge die Rate-Limit-Zeilen hinzu.","dc_console_8":"Das Panel hat die Verbindung verloren, oft wegen eines 429. Füge die Rate-Limit-Zeilen hinzu.","dc_console_9":"Die Live View kann zwischen Netzwerken fehlschlagen. Richte TURN ein.","dc_console_10":"Keine Verbindung zwischen Spieler und Zuschauer. Siehe Live View.","dc_console_11":"Fehler im Panel; die Zeilen darüber zeigen die Ursache.","dc_console_12":"Ändere den Port mit unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"Das Framework ist noch nicht gestartet oder heißt anders. Starte Unlimited danach.","dc_console_14":"Setup-Token funktioniert nicht: Es ändert sich bei jedem Neustart, nimm das vom letzten Start. Master-Passwort vergessen: Wenn du unlWeb/data.json löschst, startet der Assistent neu, aber alle Panel-Benutzer, Rollen, Notizen und Wegpunkte sind dann auch weg. Kopiere die Datei vorher an einen sicheren Ort."},"dk":{"dc_install_t":"Installation og første start","dc_install_h":"Mappe, server.cfg, opsætnings-token, første login","dc_install_s":"Læg mappen i resources/, tilføj ensure-linjen, start serveren og gennemfør opsætningsguiden i din browser. Der er ingen SQL-import og intet build-trin.","dc_hosting_t":"Spilhost eller egen server: adresser og porte","dc_hosting_h":"Hvilken adresse du skal bruge, firewall, domæne og HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"Panelet svarer på sin egen port (3000 som standard) og gennem spilporten. Brug den egne port, når den kan nås. På en spilhost, hvor kun spilporten er åben, bruger du adressen via spilporten.","dc_settings_t":"Find en indstilling","dc_settings_h":"Convars til server.cfg og nøgler til config.json","dc_settings_s":"De fleste indstillinger findes i panelet under Ledelse, så Konfiguration. Convars og config.json-nøgler nedenfor er til ting, der skal findes, før panelet er oppe, og til hemmeligheder. En convar overstyrer den samme nøgle i config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Sikkerhedskopi, opdatering og afinstallation","dc_backup_h":"Hvad du skal gemme, hvordan du opdaterer sikkert, hvordan du fjerner det","dc_backup_s":"Alt, hvad du har sat op, ligger i config.json og mappen unlWeb/. Gem de to, så kan du til enhver tid udskifte resten af resourcen.","dc_access_t":"Giv staben adgang (panel og i spillet)","dc_access_h":"Roller, brugere, FiveM-ID, /admin og ACE-grupper","dc_access_s":"Webpanelet og menuen i spillet er to adskilte adgange. Opret en rolle, opret brugeren, og kobl så brugeren til sin spilkonto.","dc_whitelist_t":"Sæt hvidliste og kø op","dc_whitelist_h":"Adgangstilstande, Discord-roller, køgrænse og prioritet","dc_whitelist_s":"Hvidlisten er slået fra som standard, så installationen låser ingen ude. Slå den til, når du er klar. Køen betyder kun noget, når serveren er fuld.","dc_security_t":"Sikkerhed: hvad der skal holdes privat","dc_security_h":"Hemmeligheder, HTTPS og mindst mulige rettigheder","dc_security_s":"Staben logger ind med adgangskoder, og panelet kan ændre din server. Behandl det som et admin-værktøj.","dc_liveview_t":"Sæt Live View op","dc_liveview_h":"Skærm og stemme, TURN til strenge netværk","dc_liveview_s":"Live View streamer en spillers skærm til din browser med WebRTC, direkte mellem spillet og browseren. Det virker ofte uden opsætning. Hvis spillerne sidder på mobilnet eller bag strenge routere, så tilføj en TURN-server. Kun FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Søg i og læs logs","dc_logs_h":"Log-typer, fanen Scripts og søgeoperatorer","dc_logs_s":"Siden Logs har én live-fane pr. log-type og en søgning, der kigger i dem alle. Historikken gemmes som standard i 90 dage (Konfiguration).","dc_discord_t":"Send logs til Discord","dc_discord_h":"Én webhook pr. log-type","dc_discord_s":"Hver log-type kan poste i sin egen Discord-kanal via en webhook. Penge har sin egen, fordi der er mange beskeder.","dc_items_t":"Få genstande til at gøre noget (effekter)","dc_items_h":"Helbred, sult, skærmeffekter, animationer, penge","dc_items_s":"Læg effekter på en genstand i panelet, så kører de, når en spiller bruger den. Ingen scripting. Brug editoren, og skriv ikke effekterne i hånden.","dc_panelclosed_t":"Panelet åbner ikke","dc_panelclosed_h":"Forkert adresse, lukket port, resourcen er ikke startet","dc_panelclosed_s":"Gå trinene igennem i rækkefølge. Slå først Debug logging til (Konfiguration): så vises hver web-forespørgsel i konsollen.","dc_denied_t":"\"Denied: admin access required\" i spillet","dc_denied_h":"Menuen i spillet åbner ikke","dc_denied_s":"Menuen i spillet bruger ikke ACE-rettigheder som standard. Den tjekker FiveM-navnet (fxname) på en panelbruger. Hvis det ikke passer til din identifier, står der Denied i menuen.","dc_ratelimit_t":"429-fejl, eller Live View bliver ved med at falde ud","dc_ratelimit_h":"FiveMs forespørgselsgrænser er for lave til panelet","dc_ratelimit_s":"Det sker, når panelet bruges gennem spilporten. FiveM begrænser forespørgsler pr. IP, og panelet har brug for flere. Startrapporten advarer om det.","dc_write_t":"Gem fejler: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"Editorerne til job, gang, genstande og køretøjer kræver tilladelse","dc_write_s":"Nyere server-artefakter lader kun Unlimited gemme i andre resources, når server.cfg tillader det. Editorerne har brug for det. Resten af panelet virker uden.","dc_console_t":"Hvad en konsolbesked betyder","dc_console_h":"Konsolbeskeder og hvad du skal gøre","dc_console_s":"Konsollen er stille som standard: den viser opstartsoversigten, advarsler og fejl. Alt andet (web-forespørgsler, sockets, Live View-sessioner) vises kun, mens Konfiguration, Debug logging er slået til. Slå det til, mens du fejlsøger, og fra igen, når det virker. Alt bliver altid skrevet til logfilen.","dc_g_install":"Installation og hosting","dc_g_access":"Adgang og stab","dc_g_features":"Funktioner","dc_g_problems":"Problemer","dc_nav":"Dokumentation","dc_title":"Dokumentation","dc_lead":"Korte guider til at drive Unlimited Reforged. Vælg det, du skal gøre, eller brug søgningen øverst.","dc_ask":"Hvad har du brug for hjælp til?","dc_back":"Tilbage til emnerne","dc_more":"Læs hele guiden","dc_gs":"Brug for mere hjælp til et trin?","q12":"Hvorfor står der \"Denied: admin access required\" i spillet?","a12":"Menuen i spillet tjekker FiveM-navnet (fxname) på din panelbruger. Sæt det til din egen identifier, eller brug en ACE-gruppe. Alle trin står i dokumentationen.","dc_install_1":"Pak zip-filen ud, og læg mappen i resources/. Mappenavnet er resourcens navn og en del af panel-adressen.","dc_install_2":"Tilføj linjerne til dit framework i server.cfg. Rækkefølgen er vigtig: oxmysql, framework, inventar, og Unlimited til sidst.","dc_install_3":"På nyere server-artefakter skal du også tilføje skrivetilladelses-linjerne til dit framework før ensure-linjen.","dc_install_4":"Vis skrivetilladelses-linjerne","dc_install_5":"Start serveren. Konsollen skriver et engangs-opsætnings-token og panel-adresserne ud (linjer, der starter med [Unlimited]).","dc_install_6":"Åbn panel-adressen, og følg guiden: sprog, hovedkonto (brugernavn og adgangskode), og indsæt så tokenet. Log ind.","dc_install_7":"Tokenet ændres ved hver genstart, så brug altid det nyeste fra konsollen. Unlimited finder selv framework, inventar og antal pladser og skriver én linje om det, for eksempel [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Tabeller i databasen oprettes automatisk.","dc_install_8":"Passer panel-adressen ikke? Se adresser og porte","dc_hosting_1":"Vej","dc_hosting_2":"Adresse","dc_hosting_3":"Egen panelport (hjemmeserver, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Spilport (spilhosts, hvor kun spilporten er åben)","dc_hosting_5":"Gennem spilporten skal du beholde / til sidst. Når resourcen starter, skriver konsollen de præcise adresser ud.","dc_hosting_6":"Åbn panelporten (TCP) i din firewall eller dit host-panel. På en spilhost beder du om en ekstra port og sætter den i server.cfg.","dc_hosting_7":"Hvis du bruger adressen via spilporten, så tilføj rate limit-linjerne nedenfor. FiveM begrænser som standard forespørgsler pr. IP, og det er for lavt til panelet.","dc_hosting_8":"Til et domæne med HTTPS sætter du en reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy eller Cloudflare) foran. Selve panelet leverer almindelig HTTP. Proxyen skal sende Host og X-Forwarded-Proto videre og tillade WebSocket-opgraderinger.","dc_hosting_9":"Kun hvis panelet hostes på et andet websted (unlDisableServe true): skriv det websteds adresse i unlPanelAllowedOrigins. Det er ikke nødvendigt, når panelet åbnes fra denne server.","dc_hosting_10":"Får du 429-fejl? Se rate limits","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Standard","dc_settings_3":"Hvad den gør","dc_settings_4":"Egen panelport.","dc_settings_5":"hostens port, ellers 30120","dc_settings_6":"Spilporten, der vises i startrapporten.","dc_settings_7":"Slå den offentlige IP op ved start.","dc_settings_8":"true = server ikke panelet fra denne resource (ekstern hosting).","dc_settings_9":"tom","dc_settings_10":"Ekstra webadresser, der må bruge panel-API'et fra et andet websted, adskilt med komma.","dc_settings_11":"Chat-kommando til menuen i spillet. Standard på RedM: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Spillernes rapportkommando. Den må ikke være den samme som menukommandoen.","dc_settings_13":"Hvilken panelrolle en ACE-gruppe får, som JSON.","dc_settings_14":"Live View-motor: auto, screencapture eller webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (brug set, aldrig setr).","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API-token (brug set, aldrig setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = ingen besked om ny version i konsollen og på Overblik.","dc_settings_18":"false = slå den levende serverkonsol i menuen i spillet fra.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Event fra dit tøjscript. Tom = find automatisk.","dc_settings_21":"config.json-nøgle","dc_settings_22":"afhænger af inventaret","dc_settings_23":"Hvor stashes, bagagerum og handskerum ligger. Skal passe til dit inventar, ellers ser stashes tomme ud.","dc_settings_24":"Som convaren. Tom = standard.","dc_settings_25":"Som convaren. Tom = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"STUN- og TURN-servere til Live View.","dc_settings_28":"Discord-webhook pr. log-type. De andre står i emnet om Discord.","dc_settings_29":"true = ingen våbenlogning overhovedet.","dc_settings_30":"true = våbenlogs holdes kun uden for Discord.","dc_settings_31":"config.json skal være gyldig JSON; // og /* */ som kommentarer er tilladt. Framework-navne, inventar og pladser registreres ud fra det, der kører, og en værdi, der ikke passer, ignoreres med en Warning:-linje i konsollen. En gammel config.json kan blive liggende.","dc_settings_32":"Discord-webhooks","dc_backup_1":"Sti","dc_backup_2":"Hvad der ligger i den","dc_backup_3":"Panelbrugere, roller, indstillinger, noter og waypoints.","dc_backup_4":"Logfilerne: player, game, money, dev, web og scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Dine egne indstillinger og webhooks.","dc_backup_6":"Sikkerhedskopi","dc_backup_7":"Kopiér config.json og mappen unlWeb/ til et sikkert sted.","dc_backup_8":"Opdatering","dc_backup_9":"Kopiér de nye filer oven på den gamle mappe. Slet ikke mappen først, og slet aldrig unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Behold din egen config.json. Sammenlign den med den nye for at finde nye muligheder.","dc_backup_11":"Genstart serveren. Tjek dine roller bagefter: en rolle, der mangler en ny rettighed, mister den knap.","dc_backup_12":"Afinstallation","dc_backup_13":"Fjern ensure-linjen og add_filesystem_permission-linjerne fra server.cfg, og stop serveren.","dc_backup_14":"Flyt resource-mappen væk. Gem en kopi af unlWeb/, hvis du måske vender tilbage.","dc_backup_15":"De tabeller, Unlimited har oprettet i databasen (navne, der starter med unl_), og to kolonner (bans.tokens og players.isWhitelisted) bliver liggende. De gør ingen skade. Fjern dem kun, hvis du er sikker.","dc_backup_16":"Hvis du sletter unlWeb/data.json, starter opsætningsguiden forfra, og alle panelbrugere, roller, noter og waypoints forsvinder.","dc_access_1":"Ledelse, Roller: opret en rolle, og sæt kun kryds ved de rettigheder, personen har brug for.","dc_access_2":"Ledelse, Brugere: opret brugeren, og tildel rollen. En bruger uden rolle kan ikke logge ind.","dc_access_3":"På den samme bruger udfylder du FiveM-navnet (fxname) med deres identifier, for eksempel koden nedenfor. Uden det står der Denied i menuen i spillet.","dc_access_4":"Skriv /admin på FiveM eller /unladmin på RedM i spillet.","dc_access_5":"Stab i en ACE-gruppe (fra txAdmin eller add_principal) får også menuen i spillet uden egen panelbruger. Angiv, hvilken panelrolle hver gruppe får; rollen med det navn bestemmer, hvad de må. En panelbruger, der er koblet til spilleren, går altid forrest. Brug {} for at slå det fra.","dc_access_6":"Hvad","dc_access_7":"Sådan ændrer du det","dc_access_8":"Menukommando: /admin på FiveM, /unladmin på RedM","dc_access_9":"Konfiguration, Admin-menu i spillet, eller set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" i server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Spillernes rapportkommando: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Konfiguration, Rapportkommando for spillere, eller set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"RedM-genvejstast til menuen (en RDR-control-hash som 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"Samme sted som menukommandoen. RedM har ingen tastebindinger til scripts, så den er valgfri.","dc_access_14":"Hvis en anden menu allerede bruger /admin (for eksempel qbx_adminmenu), siger konsollen det ved start: vælg en anden kommando. På ESX beholder esx_adminmenu /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Handling","dc_access_16":"Rolle-rettighed","dc_access_17":"Advar, send en besked","dc_access_18":"Spiller: advar","dc_access_19":"Kick","dc_access_20":"Spiller: kick","dc_access_21":"Ban","dc_access_22":"Spiller: ban","dc_access_23":"Live View, observér","dc_access_24":"Spiller: se skærm","dc_access_25":"Serverkonsol i menuen: læse / køre kommandoer","dc_access_26":"Konfiguration: læse / ændre","dc_access_27":"Kø: se / lukke ind","dc_access_28":"Hvidliste: læse / ændre","dc_access_29":"Får du Denied? Se løsningen","dc_whitelist_1":"Adgangstilstand","dc_whitelist_2":"Ingen kontrol.","dc_whitelist_3":"En licens skal være på hvidlisten i databasen.","dc_whitelist_4":"Afgøres af Discord-roller på din guild.","dc_whitelist_5":"Lokal hvidliste først, så Discord. Det er standard.","dc_whitelist_6":"Åbn siden Hvidliste, og slå den globale håndhævelse til, når du er klar.","dc_whitelist_7":"Vælg adgangstilstand under Adgangskontrol. Til Discord-roller indtaster du guild-ID og bot-token og giver derefter hver rolle en prioritet.","dc_whitelist_8":"Sæt køgrænsen (Max players). Den er som standard sv_maxclients, som aldrig overskrides. Spillere, der stadig downloader eller indlæser, tæller som forbundet og mister aldrig deres plads.","dc_whitelist_9":"Brug pladsgrupper til at reservere pladser, for eksempel til staben. Stab i ACE-grupper (group.admin, group.moderator) får altid adgang.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: vedligeholdelsestilstand tjekkes også, når VORP afgør adgang. RSG-Core: når rsg-queue kører, er det køen, og menuen i spillet viser dens liste skrivebeskyttet. ESX: når esx_whitelist kører, og dens hvidliste er slået til, afgør den, hvem der må komme ind, og Unlimited kører kun køen (Konfiguration, Whitelist-kilde).","dc_security_1":"Del aldrig opsætnings-tokenet, unlWeb/data.json, et Discord-bot-token, en webhook-URL, Cloudflare TURN API-tokenet eller en TURN-adgangskode. Fjern dem, før du poster konsoloutput eller config.json til support.","dc_security_2":"Sæt panelet bag HTTPS med en reverse proxy, når det kan nås fra internettet.","dc_security_3":"Giv hver rolle kun de rettigheder, den har brug for. Hold hovedkontoen til ejeren, og tjek rollerne efter hver opdatering.","dc_security_4":"Læg hemmeligheder i server.cfg med set, aldrig setr. setr sender værdien til alle spillere.","dc_security_5":"Fortæl dine spillere i reglerne, at staben kan lytte med på stemmen i spillet med Live View, og at en spiller ser en indikator, mens vedkommende bliver set via en screencapture-stream.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited er et værktøj til overvågning og administration, ikke en anti-cheat. Stol ikke på, at Live View fanger betalte cheat-menuer.","dc_liveview_1":"Valg","dc_liveview_2":"Hvornår du bruger det","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture med sin Cloudflare-stream","dc_liveview_4":"Mest stabil og til mange seere. Bruges automatisk, når den er sat op, med WebRTC som reserve.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (indbygget)","dc_liveview_6":"Direkte forbindelser fejler. Letteste løsning.","dc_liveview_7":"Din egen TURN-server (for eksempel coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Du kører allerede en, eller vil have faste loginoplysninger.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, trin for trin","dc_liveview_10":"Åbn Realtime i Cloudflare-dashboardet, så TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Opret en TURN-nøgle. Kopiér Turn Token ID og API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Læg dem i server.cfg med set.","dc_liveview_13":"Genstart. Med Debug logging slået til viser konsollen linjen nedenfor.","dc_liveview_14":"Din egen TURN-server lægges i config.json. Behold STUN-linjen.","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture-stream: sæt dens live-worker op, og tilføj så linjerne nedenfor. Resourcen screencapture skal starte før Unlimited. Begrænsninger: 720p, 30 fps, ingen spillyd, en ny stream hvert 30. minut. Sæt unlLiveScreenEngine til webrtc, hvis du aldrig vil bruge den.","dc_liveview_16":"Besked","dc_liveview_17":"Løsning","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"Tilføj TURN (ovenfor).","dc_liveview_20":"Forkert Turn Token ID.","dc_liveview_21":"Forkert API-token.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Installér screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"Streamen falder ud igen og igen","dc_liveview_25":"Tjek rate limit-linjerne, hvis du bruger adressen via spilporten.","dc_liveview_26":"Stemme: Live View afspiller også spillerens nærstemme i dit eget spil. Du skal være i spillet med FiveM-navnet sat på din panelbruger, have rolle-rettigheden Lyt til stemme og have pma-voice eller mumble-voip. I spillet: /admin, spiller, Live View; stop med /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Rate limits","dc_logs_1":"Log","dc_logs_2":"Indeholder","dc_logs_3":"Spiller","dc_logs_4":"Handlinger på karakterer, join, leave, kicks, bans, våbentræffere.","dc_logs_5":"Spil","dc_logs_6":"Dødsfald, genoplivninger og det, andre resources sender ind.","dc_logs_7":"Penge","dc_logs_8":"Hver ændring af penge med konto, beløb og årsag.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Ændringer af genstande, job, gangs og køretøjer.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"Revisionsspor for panelet: logins med IP, hvem der ændrede hvad.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Start-, system- og fejllinjer.","dc_logs_15":"Scripts","dc_logs_16":"Linjer, som andre scripts sender ind. Nye scripts dukker op af sig selv.","dc_logs_17":"Søg","dc_logs_18":"Finder","dc_logs_19":"Alt om én spiller, på id eller identifier.","dc_logs_20":"Det samme, på karakternavn.","dc_logs_21":"Kun én log-type. Brug komma til flere: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Linjer fra ét script.","dc_logs_23":"Kun info-, warn- eller error-linjer.","dc_logs_24":"Linjer, der indeholder denne tekst.","dc_logs_25":"Du kan kombinere operatorer. Almindelig tekst, der passer på en spiller, viser alt om den spiller; ellers søges der i teksten.","dc_logs_26":"Script-ejere logger ind i Unlimited med ét kald på serversiden. Fanen Scripts filtrerer på script, niveau, kategori, spiller og tekst og kræver rolle-rettigheden logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Begrænsninger: 20 linjer i sekundet pr. script. Script-logfilen roterer ved 10 MB og beholder 3 gamle filer.","dc_discord_1":"I Discord: kanalindstillinger, Integrations, Webhooks, New Webhook. Kopiér webhook-URL'en.","dc_discord_2":"Læg den i config.json under nøglen til den log-type, eller i server.cfg med set.","dc_discord_3":"Genstart resourcen. Beskederne kommer som farvekodede embeds.","dc_discord_4":"Nøgle / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (panelets revisionsspor)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (generelt)","dc_discord_7":"En webhook-URL er som en adgangskode: alle, der har den, kan poste i din kanal. Våbenlogs kan slås fra (disableWeaponLogs) eller kun holdes uden for Discord (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). Køen har sin egen valgfrie webhook i køindstillingerne. Discord-roller til hvidlisten sætter du op på siden Hvidliste.","dc_discord_8":"Hvidliste og kø","dc_items_1":"Åbn Dev, så Genstande, og åbn genstanden.","dc_items_2":"Tilføj effekter: helbred og rustning, sult og tørst, skærmeffekter, animationer, lyde, genstande og penge. Hver effekt kan have en forsinkelse og en varighed i millisekunder (15 sekunder er 15000).","dc_items_3":"Gem. På FiveM med ox_inventory gemmes effekterne på genstanden som unlEffects i dine ox_inventory-genstande, og det kræver skrivetilladelsen.","dc_items_4":"Brug genstanden i spillet for at teste den.","dc_items_5":"Fejler det at gemme? Se skrivetilladelse","dc_items_6":"RedM med VORP: åbn genstanden, og brug afsnittet Consumable. Effekterne gemmes i tabellen unl_item_effects og registreres med det samme i vorp_inventory. En helt ny genstand kræver stadig en genstart af vorp_inventory.","dc_items_7":"Genstande, der står i vorp_metabolism Config.ItemsToUse, overlades til vorp_metabolism, så intet kører to gange.","dc_items_8":"Hvis et andet script allerede registrerer genstanden som brugbar, så giv den ikke effekter her. vorp_inventory har én handler pr. genstand.","dc_items_9":"Sprint- og svømmemultiplikatorer er begrænset til 1.49 af spillet. Til synligt hurtigere bevægelse bruger du move rate override.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Find linjerne, der starter med [Unlimited], i serverkonsollen, og åbn præcis de adresser, de skriver ud.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Led efter Oppstart STOPPET (starten fejlede, årsagen følger) eller linjen nedenfor. Skift port, hvis den er optaget.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Hvis konsollen siger Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra, er den egne port ikke åben hos din host. Brug adressen via spilporten med / til sidst.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Åbn panelet med Debug logging slået til. Hvis der ikke dukker nogen HTTP GET-linjer op, nåede forespørgslen aldrig serveren: forkert adresse eller port, eller en firewall.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Bag en reverse proxy skal du sikre, at den tillader WebSocket-opgraderinger.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Adresser og porte","dc_denied_1":"Ledelse, Brugere: åbn din bruger.","dc_denied_2":"Sæt FiveM-navnet til din egen identifier, for eksempel linjen nedenfor.","dc_denied_3":"Tjek, at brugerens rolle har de rettigheder, du forventer.","dc_denied_4":"Eller brug en ACE-gruppe: føj dig selv til group.admin, og sæt unlAdminMenuAceRoles, se emnet om adgang.","dc_denied_5":"Åbner /admin en anden menu? Så bruger et andet script kommandoen. Vælg en ny i Konfiguration.","dc_denied_6":"Giv staben adgang","dc_ratelimit_1":"Tilføj disse linjer til server.cfg, før ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Genstart serveren.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Eller åbn den egne panelport i stedet. Den er ikke påvirket af disse grænser.","dc_write_1":"Tilføj add_filesystem_permission-linjerne til dit framework. Startrapporten og editor-siderne viser de præcise linjer, din server har brug for.","dc_write_2":"Sæt dem før ensure unlimited-reforge, og genstart serveren.","dc_write_3":"Fejler det stadig? Den resource, Unlimited skriver i, skal ofte have den samme forfatter i sin fxmanifest.lua som Unlimited. Tilføj linjen nedenfor i begge, og genstart.","dc_write_4":"Vis tilladelseslinjerne for alle frameworks","dc_console_1":"Konsolbesked","dc_console_2":"Betydning og løsning","dc_console_3":"Starten fejlede, årsagen følger. Panelet starter ikke.","dc_console_4":"Resourcen kan ikke gemme sine data. Tjek filrettighederne på hosten.","dc_console_5":"Det samme: serverprocessen skal have skriveadgang til resource-mappen.","dc_console_6":"Panelporten er ikke åben hos din host. Brug adressen via spilporten.","dc_console_7":"Tilføj rate limit-linjerne.","dc_console_8":"Panelet mistede forbindelsen, ofte på grund af en 429. Tilføj rate limit-linjerne.","dc_console_9":"Live View kan fejle mellem netværk. Sæt TURN op.","dc_console_10":"Ingen forbindelse mellem spiller og seer. Se Live View.","dc_console_11":"Fejl i panelet; linjerne ovenfor viser årsagen.","dc_console_12":"Skift port med unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"Frameworket er ikke startet endnu eller hedder noget andet. Start Unlimited efter det.","dc_console_14":"Opsætnings-tokenet virker ikke: det ændres ved hver genstart, så brug det fra den seneste start. Mistet hovedadgangskoden: hvis du sletter unlWeb/data.json, starter guiden forfra, men alle panelbrugere, roller, noter og waypoints forsvinder også. Kopiér filen et sikkert sted hen først."},"es":{"dc_install_t":"Instalación y primer arranque","dc_install_h":"Carpeta, server.cfg, token de configuración, primer inicio de sesión","dc_install_s":"Pon la carpeta en resources/, añade la línea ensure, inicia el servidor y termina el asistente de configuración en tu navegador. No hay importación SQL ni paso de compilación.","dc_hosting_t":"Host de juegos o servidor propio: direcciones y puertos","dc_hosting_h":"Qué dirección usar, firewall, dominio y HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"El panel responde en su propio puerto (3000 por defecto) y también a través del puerto del juego. Usa el puerto propio si es accesible. En un host de juegos donde solo está abierto el puerto del juego, usa la dirección del puerto del juego.","dc_settings_t":"Buscar un ajuste","dc_settings_h":"Convars para server.cfg y claves para config.json","dc_settings_s":"La mayoría de los ajustes están en el panel, en Gestión, Configuración. Los convars y las claves de config.json de abajo son para lo que debe existir antes de que el panel esté activo y para los secretos. Un convar tiene prioridad sobre la misma clave en config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Copia de seguridad, actualización y desinstalación","dc_backup_h":"Qué guardar, cómo actualizar sin riesgo, cómo quitarlo","dc_backup_s":"Todo lo que configuras está en config.json y en la carpeta unlWeb/. Guarda esos dos y podrás reemplazar el resto del recurso cuando quieras.","dc_access_t":"Dar acceso al staff (panel y en el juego)","dc_access_h":"Roles, usuarios, FiveM ID, /admin y grupos ACE","dc_access_s":"El panel web y el menú en el juego son dos accesos distintos. Crea un rol, crea el usuario y vincula al usuario con su cuenta del juego.","dc_whitelist_t":"Configurar la whitelist y la cola","dc_whitelist_h":"Modos de acceso, roles de Discord, límite de la cola y prioridad","dc_whitelist_s":"La whitelist está desactivada por defecto, así que instalar nunca deja a nadie fuera. Actívala cuando estés listo. La cola solo importa cuando el servidor está lleno.","dc_security_t":"Seguridad: qué mantener en privado","dc_security_h":"Secretos, HTTPS y mínimo privilegio","dc_security_s":"El staff inicia sesión con contraseñas y el panel puede cambiar tu servidor, así que trátalo como una herramienta de administración.","dc_liveview_t":"Configurar Live View","dc_liveview_h":"Pantalla y voz, TURN para redes estrictas","dc_liveview_s":"Live View transmite la pantalla de un jugador a tu navegador con WebRTC, directamente entre el juego y el navegador. Suele funcionar sin configurar nada. Si los jugadores usan redes móviles o routers estrictos, añade un servidor TURN. Solo FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Buscar y leer registros","dc_logs_h":"Tipos de registro, la pestaña Scripts y operadores de búsqueda","dc_logs_s":"La página Registros tiene una pestaña en vivo por cada tipo de registro y una búsqueda que mira en todos. El historial se guarda 90 días por defecto (Configuración).","dc_discord_t":"Enviar registros a Discord","dc_discord_h":"Un webhook por tipo de registro","dc_discord_s":"Cada tipo de registro puede publicar en su propio canal de Discord mediante un webhook. Dinero tiene el suyo porque genera mucho volumen.","dc_items_t":"Hacer que los ítems hagan cosas (efectos)","dc_items_h":"Salud, hambre, efectos de pantalla, animaciones, dinero","dc_items_s":"Añade efectos a un ítem en el panel y se ejecutan cuando un jugador lo usa. Sin programar. Usa el editor; no escribas los efectos a mano.","dc_panelclosed_t":"El panel no se abre","dc_panelclosed_h":"Dirección incorrecta, puerto cerrado, recurso sin iniciar","dc_panelclosed_s":"Sigue los pasos en orden. Activa primero Registro de depuración (Configuración): así cada petición web aparece en la consola.","dc_denied_t":"\"Denied: admin access required\" en el juego","dc_denied_h":"El menú en el juego no se abre","dc_denied_s":"Por defecto, el menú en el juego no usa permisos ACE. Comprueba el nombre de FiveM (fxname) de un usuario del panel. Si no coincide con tu identificador, el menú dice Denied.","dc_ratelimit_t":"Errores 429 o Live View se corta continuamente","dc_ratelimit_h":"Los límites de peticiones de FiveM son demasiado bajos para el panel","dc_ratelimit_s":"Pasa cuando el panel se usa a través del puerto del juego. FiveM limita las peticiones por IP y el panel necesita más. El informe de arranque avisa de ello.","dc_write_t":"Falla al guardar: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"Los editores de trabajos, bandas, ítems y vehículos necesitan permiso","dc_write_s":"Los artifacts de servidor más nuevos solo dejan a Unlimited guardar en otros recursos si server.cfg lo permite. Los editores lo necesitan; el resto del panel funciona sin ello.","dc_console_t":"Qué significa un mensaje de la consola","dc_console_h":"Mensajes de la consola y qué hacer","dc_console_s":"La consola es silenciosa por defecto: muestra el resumen de arranque, avisos y errores. Todo lo demás (peticiones web, sockets, sesiones de Live View) solo aparece mientras Configuración, Registro de depuración esté activado. Actívalo mientras resuelves problemas y desactívalo cuando funcione. Todo se escribe siempre en el archivo de registro.","dc_g_install":"Instalar y alojar","dc_g_access":"Acceso y staff","dc_g_features":"Funciones","dc_g_problems":"Problemas","dc_nav":"Docs","dc_title":"Documentación","dc_lead":"Guías cortas para usar Unlimited Reforged. Elige lo que necesitas hacer o usa la búsqueda de arriba.","dc_ask":"¿Con qué necesitas ayuda?","dc_back":"Volver a los temas","dc_more":"Leer la guía completa","dc_gs":"¿Necesitas más ayuda con un paso?","q12":"¿Por qué el juego dice \"Denied: admin access required\"?","a12":"El menú en el juego comprueba el nombre de FiveM (fxname) de tu usuario del panel. Ponlo con tu propio identificador o usa un grupo ACE. Los pasos completos están en la documentación.","dc_install_1":"Descomprime el zip y pon la carpeta en resources/. El nombre de la carpeta es el nombre del recurso y forma parte de la dirección del panel.","dc_install_2":"Añade a server.cfg las líneas de tu framework. El orden importa: oxmysql, framework, inventario y Unlimited al final.","dc_install_3":"En artifacts de servidor más nuevos, añade también las líneas de permiso de escritura de tu framework antes de la línea ensure.","dc_install_4":"Mostrar las líneas de permiso de escritura","dc_install_5":"Inicia el servidor. La consola muestra un token de configuración de un solo uso y las direcciones del panel (líneas que empiezan por [Unlimited]).","dc_install_6":"Abre la dirección del panel y sigue el asistente: idioma, cuenta maestra (usuario y contraseña) y pega el token. Inicia sesión.","dc_install_7":"El token cambia en cada reinicio, así que usa siempre el más reciente de la consola. Unlimited detecta por sí solo tu framework, inventario y número de slots, y muestra una línea sobre ello, por ejemplo [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Las tablas de la base de datos se crean automáticamente.","dc_install_8":"¿La dirección del panel no coincide? Mira direcciones y puertos","dc_hosting_1":"Ruta","dc_hosting_2":"Dirección","dc_hosting_3":"Puerto propio del panel (servidor doméstico, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Puerto del juego (hosts de juegos con solo el puerto del juego abierto)","dc_hosting_5":"Por el puerto del juego, mantén la / del final. Cuando el recurso arranca, la consola muestra las direcciones exactas.","dc_hosting_6":"Abre el puerto del panel (TCP) en tu firewall o en el panel del host. En un host de juegos, pide un puerto extra y configúralo en server.cfg.","dc_hosting_7":"Si usas la dirección del puerto del juego, añade las líneas de límite de peticiones de abajo. FiveM limita las peticiones por IP por defecto, y eso es demasiado poco para el panel.","dc_hosting_8":"Para un dominio con HTTPS, pon un proxy inverso (nginx, Caddy o Cloudflare) delante. El panel en sí sirve HTTP simple. El proxy debe reenviar Host y X-Forwarded-Proto y permitir actualizaciones a WebSocket.","dc_hosting_9":"Solo si el panel está alojado en otro sitio (unlDisableServe true): pon la dirección de ese sitio en unlPanelAllowedOrigins. No hace falta si el panel se abre desde este servidor.","dc_hosting_10":"¿Errores 429? Mira límites de peticiones","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Por defecto","dc_settings_3":"Qué hace","dc_settings_4":"Puerto propio del panel.","dc_settings_5":"puerto del host, si no 30120","dc_settings_6":"Puerto del juego que se muestra en el informe de arranque.","dc_settings_7":"Consultar la IP pública al arrancar.","dc_settings_8":"true = no servir el panel desde este recurso (alojamiento externo).","dc_settings_9":"vacío","dc_settings_10":"Direcciones web extra que pueden usar la API del panel desde otro sitio, separadas por comas.","dc_settings_11":"Comando de chat del menú en el juego. Por defecto en RedM: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Comando de reporte de los jugadores. No puede ser el mismo que el del menú.","dc_settings_13":"Qué rol del panel recibe un grupo ACE, en JSON.","dc_settings_14":"Motor de Live View: auto, screencapture o webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (usa set, nunca setr).","dc_settings_16":"Token de API de Cloudflare TURN (usa set, nunca setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = sin aviso de nueva versión en la consola ni en el Dashboard.","dc_settings_18":"false = desactivar la consola del servidor en vivo en el menú en el juego.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Evento de tu script de ropa; vacío = detección automática.","dc_settings_21":"Clave de config.json","dc_settings_22":"depende del inventario","dc_settings_23":"Dónde están los stashes, maleteros y guanteras. Debe coincidir con tu inventario, o los stashes se verán vacíos.","dc_settings_24":"Igual que el convar. Vacío = por defecto.","dc_settings_25":"Igual que el convar. Vacío = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"Servidores STUN y TURN para Live View.","dc_settings_28":"Webhook de Discord por tipo de registro. Los demás están en el tema de Discord.","dc_settings_29":"true = sin ningún registro de armas.","dc_settings_30":"true = los registros de armas no se envían a Discord (siguen en los registros).","dc_settings_31":"config.json debe ser JSON válido; se permiten comentarios // y /* */. Los nombres del framework, el inventario y los slots se detectan según lo que se ejecuta, y un valor que no encaja se ignora con una línea Warning: en la consola. Un config.json antiguo puede quedarse.","dc_settings_32":"Webhooks de Discord","dc_backup_1":"Ruta","dc_backup_2":"Qué contiene","dc_backup_3":"Usuarios del panel, roles, ajustes, notas y waypoints.","dc_backup_4":"Los archivos de registro: player, game, money, dev, web y scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Tus propios ajustes y webhooks.","dc_backup_6":"Copia de seguridad","dc_backup_7":"Copia config.json y la carpeta unlWeb/ a un lugar seguro.","dc_backup_8":"Actualizar","dc_backup_9":"Copia los archivos nuevos encima de la carpeta antigua. No borres la carpeta antes y nunca borres unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Conserva tu config.json. Compáralo con el nuevo para ver las opciones nuevas.","dc_backup_11":"Reinicia el servidor. Después revisa tus roles: un rol al que le falte un permiso nuevo pierde ese botón.","dc_backup_12":"Desinstalar","dc_backup_13":"Quita la línea ensure y las líneas add_filesystem_permission de server.cfg y detén el servidor.","dc_backup_14":"Mueve la carpeta del recurso a otro sitio. Guarda una copia de unlWeb/ por si vuelves.","dc_backup_15":"Las tablas que Unlimited creó en la base de datos (nombres que empiezan por unl_) y dos columnas (bans.tokens y players.isWhitelisted) se quedan. No hacen daño; bórralas solo si estás seguro.","dc_backup_16":"Borrar unlWeb/data.json vuelve a iniciar el asistente de configuración y elimina todos los usuarios del panel, roles, notas y waypoints.","dc_access_1":"Gestión, Roles: crea un rol y marca solo los permisos que esa persona necesita.","dc_access_2":"Gestión, Usuarios: crea el usuario y asígnale el rol. Un usuario sin rol no puede iniciar sesión.","dc_access_3":"En ese mismo usuario, rellena el nombre de FiveM (fxname) con su identificador, por ejemplo el código de abajo. Sin eso, el menú en el juego dice Denied.","dc_access_4":"En el juego, escribe /admin en FiveM o /unladmin en RedM.","dc_access_5":"El staff con un grupo ACE (de txAdmin o add_principal) también recibe el menú en el juego sin tener su propio usuario del panel. Indica qué rol del panel recibe cada grupo; el rol con ese nombre decide lo que pueden hacer. Un usuario del panel vinculado al jugador siempre tiene prioridad. Usa {} para desactivarlo.","dc_access_6":"Qué","dc_access_7":"Cómo cambiarlo","dc_access_8":"Comando del menú: /admin en FiveM, /unladmin en RedM","dc_access_9":"Configuración, Menú de administración en el juego, o set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" en server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Comando de reporte de los jugadores: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Configuración, Comando de reportes para jugadores, o set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"Tecla rápida del menú en RedM (un hash de control RDR como 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"En el mismo sitio que el comando del menú. RedM no tiene atajos de teclado para scripts, así que es opcional.","dc_access_14":"Si otro menú ya usa /admin (por ejemplo qbx_adminmenu), la consola lo indica al arrancar: elige otro comando. En ESX, esx_adminmenu conserva /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Acción","dc_access_16":"Permiso del rol","dc_access_17":"Advertir, enviar un mensaje","dc_access_18":"Jugador: advertir","dc_access_19":"Kick","dc_access_20":"Jugador: kick","dc_access_21":"Ban","dc_access_22":"Jugador: ban","dc_access_23":"Live View, espectar","dc_access_24":"Jugador: pantalla de vista","dc_access_25":"Consola del servidor en el menú: leer / ejecutar comandos","dc_access_26":"Configuración: leer / modificar","dc_access_27":"Cola: ver / dejar entrar","dc_access_28":"Lista blanca: leer / modificar","dc_access_29":"¿Te sale Denied? Mira la solución","dc_whitelist_1":"Modo de acceso","dc_whitelist_2":"Sin comprobación.","dc_whitelist_3":"Una licencia debe estar en la whitelist de la base de datos.","dc_whitelist_4":"Lo deciden los roles de Discord de tu servidor.","dc_whitelist_5":"Primero la whitelist local, luego Discord. Es el modo por defecto.","dc_whitelist_6":"Abre la página Lista blanca y activa la aplicación global cuando estés listo.","dc_whitelist_7":"Elige el modo de acceso en Control de acceso. Para roles de Discord, introduce el ID del servidor y el token del bot, y da una prioridad a cada rol.","dc_whitelist_8":"Fija el límite de la cola (Máx. jugadores). Por defecto es sv_maxclients, que nunca se supera. Los jugadores que aún están descargando o cargando cuentan como conectados y nunca pierden su plaza.","dc_whitelist_9":"Usa grupos de slots para reservar plazas, por ejemplo para el staff. El staff en grupos ACE (group.admin, group.moderator) siempre tiene acceso.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: el modo mantenimiento también se comprueba cuando VORP decide el acceso. RSG-Core: cuando rsg-queue está en marcha, es la cola, y el menú en el juego muestra su lista en solo lectura. ESX: cuando esx_whitelist está en marcha y su whitelist está activada, decide quién puede entrar y Unlimited solo gestiona la cola (Configuración, Origen de la whitelist).","dc_security_1":"Nunca compartas el token de configuración, unlWeb/data.json, el token de un bot de Discord, la URL de un webhook, el token de API de Cloudflare TURN ni una contraseña TURN. Quítalos antes de publicar la salida de la consola o config.json para pedir soporte.","dc_security_2":"Pon el panel detrás de HTTPS con un proxy inverso si es accesible desde internet.","dc_security_3":"Da a cada rol solo los permisos que necesita. Reserva la cuenta maestra para el dueño y revisa los roles después de cada actualización.","dc_security_4":"Pon los secretos en server.cfg con set, nunca con setr. setr envía el valor a todos los jugadores.","dc_security_5":"Avisa a tus jugadores en las normas de que el staff puede escuchar la voz del juego con Live View, y de que el jugador ve un indicador mientras lo observan con un stream de screencapture.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited es una herramienta de monitorización y administración, no un anti-cheat. No confíes en Live View para pillar menús de cheats de pago.","dc_liveview_1":"Opción","dc_liveview_2":"Cuándo usarla","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture con su stream de Cloudflare","dc_liveview_4":"Lo más estable y para muchos espectadores. Se usa automáticamente si está configurado, con WebRTC como alternativa.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (integrado)","dc_liveview_6":"Las conexiones directas fallan. Es la solución más fácil.","dc_liveview_7":"Tu propio servidor TURN (por ejemplo coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Ya tienes uno o quieres credenciales fijas.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, paso a paso","dc_liveview_10":"En el panel de Cloudflare abre Realtime, luego TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Crea una clave TURN. Copia el Turn Token ID y el API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Ponlos en server.cfg con set.","dc_liveview_13":"Reinicia. Con Registro de depuración activado, la consola muestra la línea de abajo.","dc_liveview_14":"Tu propio servidor TURN va en config.json. Mantén la línea de STUN.","dc_liveview_15":"Stream de screencapture: configura su worker en vivo y añade las líneas de abajo. El recurso screencapture debe iniciarse antes que Unlimited. Límites: 720p, 30 fps, sin audio del juego, un stream nuevo cada 30 minutos. Para no usarlo nunca, pon unlLiveScreenEngine en webrtc.","dc_liveview_16":"Mensaje","dc_liveview_17":"Solución","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"Añade TURN (arriba).","dc_liveview_20":"Turn Token ID incorrecto.","dc_liveview_21":"Token de API incorrecto.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Instala screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"El stream se corta una y otra vez","dc_liveview_25":"Revisa las líneas de límite de peticiones si usas la dirección del puerto del juego.","dc_liveview_26":"Voz: Live View también reproduce la voz de proximidad del jugador en tu propio juego. Debes estar en el juego con tu nombre de FiveM puesto en tu usuario del panel, el permiso de rol Escuchar la voz, y pma-voice o mumble-voip. En el juego: /admin, jugador, Live View; para parar usa /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Límites de peticiones","dc_logs_1":"Registro","dc_logs_2":"Contiene","dc_logs_3":"Player","dc_logs_4":"Acciones sobre personajes, entradas, salidas, kicks, bans, impactos de armas.","dc_logs_5":"Game","dc_logs_6":"Muertes, revives y lo que envían otros recursos.","dc_logs_7":"Dinero","dc_logs_8":"Cada cambio de dinero con cuenta, cantidad y motivo.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Cambios en ítems, trabajos, bandas y vehículos.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"Auditoría del panel: inicios de sesión con IP, quién cambió qué.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Líneas de arranque, del sistema y de error.","dc_logs_15":"Scripts","dc_logs_16":"Líneas que envían otros scripts. Los scripts nuevos aparecen solos.","dc_logs_17":"Búsqueda","dc_logs_18":"Encuentra","dc_logs_19":"Todo sobre un jugador, por id o identificador.","dc_logs_20":"Lo mismo, por nombre de personaje.","dc_logs_21":"Solo un tipo de registro. Usa una coma para varios: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Líneas de un script.","dc_logs_23":"Solo líneas info, warn o error.","dc_logs_24":"Líneas que contienen este texto.","dc_logs_25":"Puedes combinar operadores. El texto simple que coincide con un jugador muestra todo sobre ese jugador; si no, busca el texto.","dc_logs_26":"Los autores de scripts envían registros a Unlimited con una sola llamada del lado del servidor. La pestaña Scripts filtra por script, nivel, categoría, jugador y texto, y necesita el permiso de rol logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Límites: 20 líneas por segundo por script. El archivo de registro de scripts rota a los 10 MB y conserva 3 archivos antiguos.","dc_discord_1":"En Discord: ajustes del canal, Integraciones, Webhooks, Nuevo webhook. Copia la URL del webhook.","dc_discord_2":"Ponla en config.json bajo la clave de ese tipo de registro, o en server.cfg con set.","dc_discord_3":"Reinicia el recurso. Los mensajes llegan como embeds con colores.","dc_discord_4":"Clave / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (auditoría del panel)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (general)","dc_discord_7":"La URL de un webhook es una contraseña: cualquiera que la tenga puede publicar en tu canal. Los registros de armas se pueden desactivar (disableWeaponLogs) o excluir solo de Discord (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). La cola tiene su propio webhook opcional en los ajustes de la cola. Los roles de Discord para la whitelist se configuran en la página Lista blanca.","dc_discord_8":"Whitelist y cola","dc_items_1":"Abre Dev, luego Elementos, y abre el ítem.","dc_items_2":"Añade efectos: salud y armadura, hambre y sed, efectos de pantalla, animaciones, sonidos, ítems y dinero. Cada efecto puede tener un retraso y una duración en milisegundos (15 segundos son 15000).","dc_items_3":"Guarda. En FiveM con ox_inventory, los efectos se guardan en el ítem como unlEffects en tus ítems de ox_inventory, lo que necesita el permiso de escritura.","dc_items_4":"Usa el ítem en el juego para probarlo.","dc_items_5":"¿Falla al guardar? Mira el permiso de escritura","dc_items_6":"RedM con VORP: abre el ítem y usa la sección Consumible. Los efectos se guardan en la tabla unl_item_effects y se registran en vorp_inventory al instante. Un ítem recién creado aún necesita reiniciar vorp_inventory.","dc_items_7":"Los ítems de la lista Config.ItemsToUse de vorp_metabolism se dejan en manos de vorp_metabolism, para que nada se ejecute dos veces.","dc_items_8":"Si otro script ya registra el ítem como usable, no le pongas efectos aquí. vorp_inventory mantiene un solo handler por ítem.","dc_items_9":"Los multiplicadores de sprint y natación están limitados a 1.49 por el juego. Para un movimiento claramente más rápido usa el override de move rate.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Busca las líneas que empiezan por [Unlimited] en la consola del servidor y abre exactamente las direcciones que muestran.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Busca Oppstart STOPPET (el arranque falló, sigue el motivo) o la línea de abajo. Cambia el puerto si está ocupado.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Si la consola dice Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra, el puerto propio no está abierto en tu host. Usa la dirección del puerto del juego, con la / del final.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Abre el panel con Registro de depuración activado. Si no aparecen líneas HTTP GET, la petición nunca llegó al servidor: dirección o puerto incorrectos, o un firewall.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Detrás de un proxy inverso, asegúrate de que permite actualizaciones a WebSocket.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Direcciones y puertos","dc_denied_1":"Gestión, Usuarios: abre tu usuario.","dc_denied_2":"Pon el nombre de FiveM con tu propio identificador, por ejemplo la línea de abajo.","dc_denied_3":"Comprueba que el rol del usuario tiene los permisos que esperas.","dc_denied_4":"O usa un grupo ACE: añádete a group.admin y configura unlAdminMenuAceRoles, mira el tema de Acceso.","dc_denied_5":"¿/admin abre otro menú? Otro script usa ese comando. Elige uno nuevo en Configuración.","dc_denied_6":"Dar acceso al staff","dc_ratelimit_1":"Añade estas líneas a server.cfg, antes de ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Reinicia el servidor.","dc_ratelimit_3":"O abre el puerto propio del panel. No le afectan estos límites.","dc_write_1":"Añade las líneas add_filesystem_permission de tu framework. El informe de arranque y las páginas de los editores muestran las líneas exactas que necesita tu servidor.","dc_write_2":"Ponlas antes de ensure unlimited-reforge y reinicia el servidor.","dc_write_3":"¿Sigue fallando? El recurso en el que escribe Unlimited suele necesitar el mismo autor en su fxmanifest.lua que Unlimited. Añade la línea de abajo en ambos y reinicia.","dc_write_4":"Mostrar las líneas de permiso de todos los frameworks","dc_console_1":"Mensaje de la consola","dc_console_2":"Significado y solución","dc_console_3":"El arranque falló; sigue el motivo. El panel no se iniciará.","dc_console_4":"El recurso no puede guardar sus datos. Revisa los permisos de archivos en el host.","dc_console_5":"Lo mismo: el proceso del servidor necesita permiso de escritura en la carpeta del recurso.","dc_console_6":"El puerto del panel no está abierto en tu host. Usa la dirección del puerto del juego.","dc_console_7":"Añade las líneas de límite de peticiones.","dc_console_8":"El panel perdió su conexión, a menudo por un 429. Añade las líneas de límite de peticiones.","dc_console_9":"Live View puede fallar entre redes. Configura TURN.","dc_console_10":"No hay conexión entre el jugador y el espectador. Mira Live View.","dc_console_11":"Error en el panel; las líneas de arriba muestran la causa.","dc_console_12":"Cambia el puerto con unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"El framework aún no se ha iniciado o tiene otro nombre. Inicia Unlimited después.","dc_console_14":"El token de configuración no funciona: cambia en cada reinicio, usa el del último arranque. ¿Perdiste la contraseña maestra? Borrar unlWeb/data.json vuelve a iniciar el asistente, pero también elimina todos los usuarios del panel, roles, notas y waypoints. Copia antes el archivo a un lugar seguro."},"et":{"dc_install_t":"Paigaldus ja esimene käivitus","dc_install_h":"Kaust, server.cfg, seadistuse token, esimene sisselogimine","dc_install_s":"Pane kaust kausta resources/, lisa ensure rida, käivita server ja lõpeta seadistusviisard brauseris. SQL-i importi ega ehitamist pole.","dc_hosting_t":"Mängu hosting või oma server: aadressid ja pordid","dc_hosting_h":"Millist aadressi kasutada, tulemüür, domeen ja HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"Paneel vastab oma pordil (vaikimisi 3000) ja mänguporti kaudu. Kui oma port on ligipääsetav, kasuta seda. Mängu hostil, kus on avatud ainult mänguport, kasuta mänguporti aadressi.","dc_settings_t":"Leia säte","dc_settings_h":"Convarid faili server.cfg jaoks ja võtmed faili config.json jaoks","dc_settings_s":"Enamik sätteid on paneelis: Juhtkond, siis Configuratisoon. Allpool olevad convarid ja config.json võtmed on asjade jaoks, mis peavad olemas olema enne paneeli käivitumist, ning saladuste jaoks. Convar kirjutab üle sama võtme failis config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Varundamine, uuendamine ja eemaldamine","dc_backup_h":"Mida alles hoida, kuidas turvaliselt uuendada, kuidas eemaldada","dc_backup_s":"Kõik, mille oled seadistanud, asub failis config.json ja kaustas unlWeb/. Hoia need kaks alles, siis saad resource'i ülejäänud osa igal ajal välja vahetada.","dc_access_t":"Anna töötajatele ligipääs (paneel ja mängus)","dc_access_h":"Rollid, kasutajad, FiveM ID, /admin ja ACE grupid","dc_access_s":"Veebipaneel ja mängusisene menüü on kaks eraldi ligipääsu. Tee roll, tee kasutaja, seo kasutaja siis tema mängukontoga.","dc_whitelist_t":"Seadista whitelist ja järjekord","dc_whitelist_h":"Ligipääsurežiimid, Discordi rollid, järjekorra piir ja prioriteet","dc_whitelist_s":"Whitelist on vaikimisi välja lülitatud, nii et paigaldus ei lukusta kedagi välja. Lülita see sisse, kui oled valmis. Järjekord loeb ainult siis, kui server on täis.","dc_security_t":"Turvalisus: mida hoida privaatsena","dc_security_h":"Saladused, HTTPS ja vähim õigus","dc_security_s":"Töötajad logivad sisse paroolidega ja paneel saab sinu serverit muuta, nii et kohtle seda nagu admini tööriista.","dc_liveview_t":"Seadista Live View","dc_liveview_h":"Ekraan ja hääl, TURN rangete võrkude jaoks","dc_liveview_s":"Live View voogedastab mängija ekraani sinu brauserisse WebRTC abil, otse mängu ja brauseri vahel. Sageli töötab see ilma seadistamata. Kui mängijad on mobiilivõrkudes või range ruuteri taga, lisa TURN-server. Ainult FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Otsi ja loe logisid","dc_logs_h":"Logitüübid, Scripts-vaheleht ja otsingu operaatorid","dc_logs_s":"Logide lehel on iga logitüübi jaoks üks reaalajas vaheleht ja otsing, mis otsib kõigist korraga. Ajalugu hoitakse vaikimisi 90 päeva (Configuratisoon).","dc_discord_t":"Saada logid Discordi","dc_discord_h":"Üks webhook logitüübi kohta","dc_discord_s":"Iga logitüüp saab webhooki kaudu postitada oma Discordi kanalisse. Rahal on oma kanal, sest seda on palju.","dc_items_t":"Pane esemed midagi tegema (efektid)","dc_items_h":"Tervis, nälg, ekraaniefektid, animatsioonid, raha","dc_items_s":"Lisa esemele paneelis efektid ja need käivituvad, kui mängija eset kasutab. Skriptimist pole vaja. Kasuta redaktorit; ära kirjuta efekte käsitsi.","dc_panelclosed_t":"Paneel ei avane","dc_panelclosed_h":"Vale aadress, suletud port, resource pole käivitunud","dc_panelclosed_s":"Käi sammud järjest läbi. Lülita kõigepealt sisse Silumislogi (Configuratisoon): siis ilmub iga veebipäring konsooli.","dc_denied_t":"\"Denied: admin access required\" mängus","dc_denied_h":"Mängusisene menüü ei avane","dc_denied_s":"Mängusisene menüü ei kasuta vaikimisi ACE õigusi. See kontrollib paneeli kasutaja FiveM nime (fxname). Kui see ei vasta sinu identifier'ile, ütleb menüü Denied.","dc_ratelimit_t":"429 vead või Live View katkeb pidevalt","dc_ratelimit_h":"FiveM päringupiirangud on paneelile liiga madalad","dc_ratelimit_s":"See juhtub, kui paneeli kasutatakse mängupordi kaudu. FiveM piirab päringuid IP kohta ja paneel vajab rohkem. Käivitusraport hoiatab selle eest.","dc_write_t":"Salvestamine ebaõnnestub: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"Töö-, jõugu-, eseme- ja sõidukiredaktorid vajavad luba","dc_write_s":"Uuemad serveri artefaktid lubavad Unlimitedil salvestada teistesse resource'itesse ainult siis, kui server.cfg seda lubab. Redaktorid vajavad seda; ülejäänud paneel töötab ilma.","dc_console_t":"Mida konsoolisõnum tähendab","dc_console_h":"Konsoolisõnumid ja mida teha","dc_console_s":"Konsool on vaikimisi vaikne: see näitab käivituse kokkuvõtet, hoiatusi ja vigu. Kõik muu (veebipäringud, socketid, Live View sessioonid) on näha ainult siis, kui Configuratisoon on Silumislogi sisse lülitatud. Lülita see sisse tõrkeotsingu ajaks ja välja, kui kõik töötab. Kõik kirjutatakse alati logifaili.","dc_g_install":"Paigaldus ja hosting","dc_g_access":"Ligipääs ja töötajad","dc_g_features":"Funktsioonid","dc_g_problems":"Probleemid","dc_nav":"Dokumentatsioon","dc_title":"Dokumentatsioon","dc_lead":"Lühijuhendid Unlimited Reforgedi käitamiseks. Vali, mida vaja teha, või kasuta ülal olevat otsingut.","dc_ask":"Millega vajad abi?","dc_back":"Tagasi teemade juurde","dc_more":"Loe täisjuhendit","dc_gs":"Vajad sammuga rohkem abi?","q12":"Miks mäng ütleb \"Denied: admin access required\"?","a12":"Mängusisene menüü kontrollib sinu paneeli kasutaja FiveM nime (fxname). Sea see oma identifier'iks või kasuta ACE gruppi. Täielikud sammud on dokumentatsioonis.","dc_install_1":"Paki zip lahti ja pane kaust kausta resources/. Kausta nimi on resource'i nimi ja osa paneeli aadressist.","dc_install_2":"Lisa oma frameworki read faili server.cfg. Järjekord on oluline: oxmysql, framework, inventory ja Unlimited viimasena.","dc_install_3":"Uuematel serveri artefaktidel lisa enne ensure rida ka oma frameworki kirjutusloa read.","dc_install_4":"Näita kirjutusloa ridu","dc_install_5":"Käivita server. Konsool prindib ühekordse seadistuse tokeni ja paneeli aadressid ([Unlimited] algusega read).","dc_install_6":"Ava paneeli aadress ja järgi viisardit: keel, peakonto (kasutajanimi ja parool), siis kleebi token. Logi sisse.","dc_install_7":"Token muutub igal taaskäivitusel, nii et kasuta alati konsoolist uusimat. Unlimited tuvastab frameworki, inventory ja slottide arvu ise ja prindib selle kohta ühe rea, näiteks [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Andmebaasi tabelid luuakse automaatselt.","dc_install_8":"Paneeli aadress ei klapi? Vaata aadresse ja porte","dc_hosting_1":"Tee","dc_hosting_2":"Aadress","dc_hosting_3":"Oma paneeli port (kodune server, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Mänguport (mängu hostid, kus on avatud ainult mänguport)","dc_hosting_5":"Mängupordi kaudu hoia lõpus olev /. Kui resource käivitub, prindib konsool täpsed aadressid.","dc_hosting_6":"Ava paneeli port (TCP) tulemüüris või hosti paneelis. Mängu hostil küsi lisaport ja sea see faili server.cfg.","dc_hosting_7":"Kui kasutad mängupordi aadressi, lisa allolevad päringupiirangu read. FiveM piirab päringuid vaikimisi IP kohta, mis on paneelile liiga vähe.","dc_hosting_8":"HTTPS-iga domeeni jaoks pane ette reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy või Cloudflare). Paneel ise serveerib tavalist HTTP-d. Proxy peab edastama Host ja X-Forwarded-Proto ning lubama WebSocketi uuendusi.","dc_hosting_9":"Ainult kui paneeli hostitakse teisel saidil (unlDisableServe true): kirjuta selle saidi aadress parameetrisse unlPanelAllowedOrigins. Seda pole vaja, kui paneel avatakse sellest serverist.","dc_hosting_10":"Saad 429 vigu? Vaata päringupiiranguid","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Vaikeväärtus","dc_settings_3":"Mida teeb","dc_settings_4":"Oma paneeli port.","dc_settings_5":"hosti port, muidu 30120","dc_settings_6":"Mänguport, mida käivitusraportis näidatakse.","dc_settings_7":"Otsi käivitusel avalik IP.","dc_settings_8":"true = ära serveeri paneeli sellest resource'ist (välisel hostingul).","dc_settings_9":"tühi","dc_settings_10":"Täiendavad veebiaadressid, mis tohivad kasutada paneeli API-d teiselt saidilt, komadega eraldatud.","dc_settings_11":"Vestluskäsk mängusisese menüü jaoks. RedM vaikimisi: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Mängijate raportikäsk. See ei tohi olla sama mis menüükäsk.","dc_settings_13":"Millise paneeli rolli ACE grupp saab, JSON-ina.","dc_settings_14":"Live View mootor: auto, screencapture või webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (kasuta set, mitte kunagi setr).","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API token (kasuta set, mitte kunagi setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = uue versiooni teadet pole konsoolis ega Dashboardil.","dc_settings_18":"false = lülita mängusisese menüü reaalajas serverikonsool välja.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Sinu riiete skripti event; tühi = tuvasta automaatselt.","dc_settings_21":"config.json võti","dc_settings_22":"sõltub inventory'st","dc_settings_23":"Kus asuvad hoidlad, pagasnikud ja kindalaekad. Peab vastama sinu inventory'le, muidu paistavad hoidlad tühjad.","dc_settings_24":"Sama mis convar. Tühi = vaikeväärtus.","dc_settings_25":"Sama mis convar. Tühi = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"STUN- ja TURN-serverid Live View jaoks.","dc_settings_28":"Discordi webhook logitüübi kohta. Teised on loetletud Discordi teemas.","dc_settings_29":"true = relvalogisid ei tehta üldse.","dc_settings_30":"true = relvalogid jäävad ainult Discordist välja.","dc_settings_31":"config.json peab olema korrektne JSON; kommentaarid // ja /* */ on lubatud. Frameworkide nimed, inventory ja slotid tuvastatakse sellest, mis töötab, ja sobimatu väärtus jäetakse konsoolis Warning: reaga arvestamata. Vana config.json võib alles jääda.","dc_settings_32":"Discordi webhookid","dc_backup_1":"Tee","dc_backup_2":"Mis seal on","dc_backup_3":"Paneeli kasutajad, rollid, sätted, märkmed ja waypointid.","dc_backup_4":"Logifailid: player, game, money, dev, web ja scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Sinu enda sätted ja webhookid.","dc_backup_6":"Varunda","dc_backup_7":"Kopeeri config.json ja kaust unlWeb/ turvalisse kohta.","dc_backup_8":"Uuenda","dc_backup_9":"Kopeeri uued failid vana kausta peale. Ära kustuta kausta enne ja ära kunagi kustuta unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Hoia oma config.json alles. Võrdle seda uuega, et leida uued valikud.","dc_backup_11":"Taaskäivita server. Kontrolli pärast oma rolle: roll, millel uut luba pole, kaotab selle nupu.","dc_backup_12":"Eemalda","dc_backup_13":"Eemalda ensure rida ja add_filesystem_permission read failist server.cfg ja peata server.","dc_backup_14":"Tõsta resource'i kaust ära. Hoia unlWeb/ koopia alles, kui võid tagasi tulla.","dc_backup_15":"Tabelid, mille Unlimited andmebaasi lõi (nimed algavad unl_), ja kaks veergu (bans.tokens ja players.isWhitelisted) jäävad alles. Need ei tee kahju; eemalda need ainult siis, kui oled kindel.","dc_backup_16":"Faili unlWeb/data.json kustutamine käivitab seadistusviisardi uuesti ja kustutab kõik paneeli kasutajad, rollid, märkmed ja waypointid.","dc_access_1":"Juhtkond, Rollid: tee roll ja märgi ainult need load, mida see inimene vajab.","dc_access_2":"Juhtkond, Liikmed: tee kasutaja ja määra roll. Rollita kasutaja ei saa sisse logida.","dc_access_3":"Sama kasutaja juures täida FiveM nimi (fxname) tema identifier'iga, näiteks allolev kood. Ilma selleta ütleb mängusisene menüü Denied.","dc_access_4":"Mängus kirjuta FiveMis /admin või RedMis /unladmin.","dc_access_5":"ACE grupiga töötajad (txAdminist või add_principal kaudu) saavad mängusisese menüü ka ilma oma paneeli kasutajata. Ütle, millise paneeli rolli iga grupp saab; selle nimega roll otsustab, mida nad teha saavad. Mängijaga seotud paneeli kasutaja on alati ees. Väljalülitamiseks kasuta {}.","dc_access_6":"Mis","dc_access_7":"Kuidas muuta","dc_access_8":"Menüükäsk: /admin FiveMis, /unladmin RedMis","dc_access_9":"Configuratisoon, Mängusisene adminimenüü, või set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" failis server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Mängijate raportikäsk: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Configuratisoon, Mängijate raportikäsk, või set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"RedMi kiirklahv menüü jaoks (RDR kontrolli hash, näiteks 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"Sama koht mis menüükäsk. RedMis pole skriptidele klahvisidumisi, seega on see valikuline.","dc_access_14":"Kui mõni muu menüü juba kasutab käsku /admin (näiteks qbx_adminmenu), ütleb konsool seda käivitusel: vali teine käsk. ESX-is jätab esx_adminmenu endale käsu /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Tegevus","dc_access_16":"Rolli luba","dc_access_17":"Hoiata, saada sõnum","dc_access_18":"Mängija: hoiata","dc_access_19":"Kick","dc_access_20":"Mängija: kick","dc_access_21":"Keelusta","dc_access_22":"Mängija: keelusta","dc_access_23":"Live View, jälgimine","dc_access_24":"Mängija: vaata ekraani","dc_access_25":"Serverikonsool menüüs: lugemine / käskude käivitamine","dc_access_26":"Configuratisoon: lugemine / muutmine","dc_access_27":"Järjekord: vaatamine / sisse laskmine","dc_access_28":"Whitelist: lugemine / muutmine","dc_access_29":"Saad Denied? Vaata lahendust","dc_whitelist_1":"Ligipääsurežiim","dc_whitelist_2":"Kontrolli pole.","dc_whitelist_3":"Litsents peab olema andmebaasis whitelistis.","dc_whitelist_4":"Otsustavad Discordi rollid sinu serveris.","dc_whitelist_5":"Kõigepealt kohalik whitelist, siis Discord. See on vaikeväärtus.","dc_whitelist_6":"Ava Whitelisti leht ja lülita üldine jõustamine sisse, kui oled valmis.","dc_whitelist_7":"Vali ligipääsurežiim jaotises Juurdepääsu kontroll. Discordi rollide jaoks sisesta serveri (guild) ID ja boti token, siis anna igale rollile prioriteet.","dc_whitelist_8":"Sea järjekorra piir (Maks mängijaid). Vaikimisi on see sv_maxclients, mida ei ületata kunagi. Mängijad, kes alles laadivad või allalaadivad, loetakse ühendatuks ja nad ei kaota kunagi oma kohta.","dc_whitelist_9":"Kasuta slotigruppe kohtade reserveerimiseks, näiteks töötajatele. ACE gruppide töötajad (group.admin, group.moderator) pääsevad alati sisse.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: hooldusrežiimi kontrollitakse ka siis, kui VORP otsustab ligipääsu üle. RSG-Core: kui rsg-queue töötab, on see järjekord ja mängusisene menüü näitab selle nimekirja ainult lugemiseks. ESX: kui esx_whitelist töötab ja selle whitelist on sees, otsustab see, kes sisse saab, ja Unlimited haldab ainult järjekorda (Configuratisoon, Valge nimekirja allikas).","dc_security_1":"Ära jaga kunagi seadistuse tokenit, faili unlWeb/data.json, Discordi boti tokenit, webhooki URL-i, Cloudflare TURN API tokenit ega TURN parooli. Eemalda need, enne kui postitad tugiteenusele konsooli väljundi või faili config.json.","dc_security_2":"Pane paneel HTTPS-i taha reverse proxy abil, kui see on internetist ligipääsetav.","dc_security_3":"Anna igale rollile ainult vajalikud load. Hoia peakonto omaniku jaoks ja kontrolli rolle pärast iga uuendust.","dc_security_4":"Pane saladused faili server.cfg käsuga set, mitte kunagi setr. setr saadab väärtuse igale mängijale.","dc_security_5":"Ütle mängijatele reeglites, et töötajad saavad Live View abil mängusisest häält kuulata ja et mängija näeb indikaatorit, kui teda vaadatakse screencapture voo kaudu.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited on jälgimis- ja haldustööriist, mitte anti-cheat. Ära looda, et Live View püüab kinni tasulised cheat-menüüd.","dc_liveview_1":"Valik","dc_liveview_2":"Millal kasutada","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture oma Cloudflare vooga","dc_liveview_4":"Kõige stabiilsem ja sobib paljudele vaatajatele. Kasutatakse automaatselt, kui see on seadistatud; varuna on WebRTC.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (sisseehitatud)","dc_liveview_6":"Otseühendused ebaõnnestuvad. Lihtsaim lahendus.","dc_liveview_7":"Sinu enda TURN-server (näiteks coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Sul on see juba olemas või soovid püsivaid andmeid.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN samm-sammult","dc_liveview_10":"Ava Cloudflare'i paneelis Realtime ja siis TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Loo TURN-võti. Kopeeri Turn Token ID ja API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Pane need faili server.cfg käsuga set.","dc_liveview_13":"Taaskäivita. Kui Silumislogi on sees, näitab konsool allolevat rida.","dc_liveview_14":"Sinu enda TURN-server läheb faili config.json. Jäta STUN-rida alles.","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture voog: seadista selle live worker, siis lisa allolevad read. Resource screencapture peab käivituma enne Unlimitedit. Piirangud: 720p, 30 fps, mängu heli pole, uus voog iga 30 minuti järel. Et seda mitte kunagi kasutada, sea unlLiveScreenEngine väärtuseks webrtc.","dc_liveview_16":"Sõnum","dc_liveview_17":"Lahendus","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"Lisa TURN (ülal).","dc_liveview_20":"Vale Turn Token ID.","dc_liveview_21":"Vale API token.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Paigalda screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"Voog katkeb korduvalt","dc_liveview_25":"Kontrolli päringupiirangu ridu, kui kasutad mängupordi aadressi.","dc_liveview_26":"Hääl: Live View mängib sinu enda mängus ka mängija lähedal kostvat häält. Sa pead olema mängus, sinu paneeli kasutajal peab olema FiveM nimi seatud, rollil peab olema luba Kuula häält ning vaja on pma-voice või mumble-voip. Mängus: /admin, mängija, Live View; peata käsuga /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Päringupiirangud","dc_logs_1":"Logi","dc_logs_2":"Sisaldab","dc_logs_3":"Mängija","dc_logs_4":"Tegevused tegelastega, liitumised, lahkumised, kickid, keelustamised, relvatabamused.","dc_logs_5":"Mäng","dc_logs_6":"Surmad, elustamised ja see, mida teised resource'id saadavad.","dc_logs_7":"Raha","dc_logs_8":"Iga rahamuutus koos konto, summa ja põhjusega.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Muudatused esemetes, töödes, jõukudes ja sõidukites.","dc_logs_11":"Veebileht","dc_logs_12":"Paneeli auditijälg: sisselogimised IP-ga, kes mida muutis.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Käivituse, süsteemi ja vigade read.","dc_logs_15":"Skriptid","dc_logs_16":"Read, mida teised skriptid saadavad. Uued skriptid ilmuvad ise.","dc_logs_17":"Otsing","dc_logs_18":"Leiab","dc_logs_19":"Kõik ühe mängija kohta, id või identifier'i järgi.","dc_logs_20":"Sama, tegelase nime järgi.","dc_logs_21":"Ainult üks logitüüp. Mitme jaoks kasuta koma: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Ühe skripti read.","dc_logs_23":"Ainult info, warn või error read.","dc_logs_24":"Read, mis sisaldavad seda teksti.","dc_logs_25":"Operaatoreid võib kombineerida. Tavaline tekst, mis vastab mängijale, näitab kõike selle mängija kohta; muidu otsitakse teksti.","dc_logs_26":"Skriptide omanikud logivad Unlimitedi ühe serveripoolse kutsega. Skriptide vaheleht filtreerib skripti, taseme, kategooria, mängija ja teksti järgi ning vajab rolli luba logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Piirangud: 20 rida sekundis skripti kohta. Skriptide logifail roteeritakse 10 MB juures ja hoitakse 3 vana faili.","dc_discord_1":"Discordis: kanali sätted, Integrations, Webhooks, New Webhook. Kopeeri webhooki URL.","dc_discord_2":"Pane see faili config.json selle logitüübi võtme alla või faili server.cfg käsuga set.","dc_discord_3":"Taaskäivita resource. Sõnumid tulevad värvikoodiga embedidena.","dc_discord_4":"Võti / convar","dc_discord_5":"Veebileht (paneeli audit)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (üldine)","dc_discord_7":"Webhooki URL on nagu parool: igaüks, kellel see on, saab sinu kanalisse postitada. Relvalogid saab välja lülitada (disableWeaponLogs) või jätta ainult Discordist välja (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). Järjekorral on oma valikuline webhook järjekorra sätetes. Whitelisti Discordi rollid seadistatakse Whitelisti lehel.","dc_discord_8":"Whitelist ja järjekord","dc_items_1":"Ava Dev, siis Esemed, ja ava ese.","dc_items_2":"Lisa efektid: tervis ja soomus, nälg ja janu, ekraaniefektid, animatsioonid, helid, esemed ja raha. Igal efektil võib olla viivitus ja kestus millisekundites (15 sekundit on 15000).","dc_items_3":"Salvesta. FiveMis koos ox_inventoryga salvestatakse efektid esemele nimega unlEffects sinu ox_inventory esemete hulka, mis vajab kirjutusluba.","dc_items_4":"Testi eset mängus kasutades.","dc_items_5":"Salvestamine ebaõnnestub? Vaata kirjutusluba","dc_items_6":"RedM koos VORP-iga: ava ese ja kasuta jaotist Consumable. Efektid salvestatakse tabelisse unl_item_effects ja registreeritakse kohe vorp_inventorys. Täiesti uus ese vajab siiski vorp_inventory taaskäivitamist.","dc_items_7":"Esemed, mis on loetletud vorp_metabolism Config.ItemsToUse all, jäetakse vorp_metabolismile, nii et miski ei käivitu kaks korda.","dc_items_8":"Kui mõni teine skript juba registreerib eseme kasutatavaks, ära anna sellele siin efekte. vorp_inventory hoiab ühe handleri eseme kohta.","dc_items_9":"Spordi- ja ujumiskordajad on mängu poolt piiratud väärtusega 1.49. Märgatavalt kiirema liikumise jaoks kasuta liikumiskiiruse ülekirjutust.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Leia serverikonsoolist read, mis algavad [Unlimited], ja ava täpselt need aadressid, mida nad prindivad.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Otsi Oppstart STOPPET (käivitus ebaõnnestus, põhjus tuleb järgmisena) või allolevat rida. Muuda porti, kui see on hõivatud.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Kui konsool ütleb Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra, pole sinu oma port hostis avatud. Kasuta mängupordi aadressi koos lõpus oleva /-ga.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Ava paneel Silumislogi sees. Kui HTTP GET ridu ei ilmu, ei jõudnud päring serverini: vale aadress või port või tulemüür.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Reverse proxy taga veendu, et see lubab WebSocketi uuendusi.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Aadressid ja pordid","dc_denied_1":"Juhtkond, Liikmed: ava oma kasutaja.","dc_denied_2":"Sea FiveM nimi oma identifier'iks, näiteks allolev rida.","dc_denied_3":"Kontrolli, et kasutaja rollil on oodatud load.","dc_denied_4":"Või kasuta ACE gruppi: lisa end gruppi group.admin ja sea unlAdminMenuAceRoles, vaata teemat Ligipääs.","dc_denied_5":"Kas /admin avab mõne teise menüü? Käsk kuulub teisele skriptile. Vali Configuratisoonis uus.","dc_denied_6":"Anna töötajatele ligipääs","dc_ratelimit_1":"Lisa need read faili server.cfg, enne rida ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Taaskäivita server.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Või ava hoopis oma paneeli port. Need piirangud seda ei mõjuta.","dc_write_1":"Lisa oma frameworki add_filesystem_permission read. Käivitusraport ja redaktorite lehed näitavad täpseid ridu, mida sinu server vajab.","dc_write_2":"Pane need enne rida ensure unlimited-reforge ja taaskäivita server.","dc_write_3":"Ikka ei tööta? Resource'il, kuhu Unlimited kirjutab, peab sageli olema failis fxmanifest.lua sama autor mis Unlimitedil. Lisa allolev rida mõlemasse ja taaskäivita.","dc_write_4":"Näita kõigi frameworkide lubade ridu","dc_console_1":"Konsoolisõnum","dc_console_2":"Tähendus ja lahendus","dc_console_3":"Käivitus ebaõnnestus; põhjus tuleb järgmisena. Paneel ei käivitu.","dc_console_4":"Resource ei saa oma andmeid salvestada. Kontrolli hosti failiõigusi.","dc_console_5":"Sama: serveri protsess vajab resource'i kausta kirjutusõigust.","dc_console_6":"Paneeli port pole sinu hostis avatud. Kasuta mängupordi aadressi.","dc_console_7":"Lisa päringupiirangu read.","dc_console_8":"Paneel kaotas ühenduse, sageli 429 tõttu. Lisa päringupiirangu read.","dc_console_9":"Live View võib võrkude vahel ebaõnnestuda. Seadista TURN.","dc_console_10":"Mängija ja vaataja vahel pole ühendust. Vaata Live View.","dc_console_11":"Viga paneelis; ülaltoodud read näitavad põhjust.","dc_console_12":"Muuda porti parameetriga unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"Framework pole veel käivitunud või on teise nimega. Käivita Unlimited pärast seda.","dc_console_14":"Seadistuse token ei tööta: see muutub igal taaskäivitusel, kasuta viimasest käivitusest. Peakonto parool kadunud: faili unlWeb/data.json kustutamine käivitab viisardi uuesti, kuid kustutab ka kõik paneeli kasutajad, rollid, märkmed ja waypointid. Kopeeri fail enne turvalisse kohta."},"nl":{"dc_install_t":"Installeren en eerste start","dc_install_h":"Map, server.cfg, setup-token, eerste login","dc_install_s":"Zet de map in resources/, voeg de ensure-regel toe, start de server en rond de installatiewizard af in je browser. Er is geen SQL-import en geen buildstap.","dc_hosting_t":"Gamehost of eigen server: adressen en poorten","dc_hosting_h":"Welk adres je gebruikt, firewall, domein en HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"Het paneel luistert op een eigen poort (standaard 3000) en ook via de gamepoort. Gebruik de eigen poort als die bereikbaar is. Op een gamehost waar alleen de gamepoort open is, gebruik je het adres van de gamepoort.","dc_settings_t":"Een instelling vinden","dc_settings_h":"Convars voor server.cfg en sleutels voor config.json","dc_settings_s":"De meeste instellingen staan in het paneel onder Management, Configuratie. De convars en config.json-sleutels hieronder zijn voor dingen die bestaan moeten voordat het paneel draait, en voor geheimen. Een convar gaat voor op dezelfde sleutel in config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Back-up, bijwerken en verwijderen","dc_backup_h":"Wat je bewaart, hoe je veilig bijwerkt, hoe je het weghaalt","dc_backup_s":"Alles wat je instelt staat in config.json en de map unlWeb/. Bewaar die twee en je kunt de rest van de resource altijd vervangen.","dc_access_t":"Staff toegang geven (paneel en in het spel)","dc_access_h":"Rollen, gebruikers, FiveM ID, /admin en ACE-groepen","dc_access_s":"Het webpaneel en het menu in het spel zijn twee aparte toegangen. Maak een rol, maak de gebruiker en koppel de gebruiker aan zijn of haar spelaccount.","dc_whitelist_t":"Whitelist en wachtrij instellen","dc_whitelist_h":"Toegangsmodi, Discord-rollen, wachtrijlimiet en prioriteit","dc_whitelist_s":"De whitelist staat standaard uit, dus installeren sluit niemand buiten. Zet hem aan als je klaar bent. De wachtrij doet alleen iets als de server vol zit.","dc_security_t":"Beveiliging: wat je privé houdt","dc_security_h":"Geheimen, HTTPS en minimale rechten","dc_security_s":"Staff logt in met wachtwoorden en het paneel kan je server aanpassen, dus behandel het als een beheertool.","dc_liveview_t":"Live View instellen","dc_liveview_h":"Scherm en stem, TURN voor strikte netwerken","dc_liveview_s":"Live View streamt het scherm van een speler naar je browser met WebRTC, rechtstreeks tussen het spel en de browser. Het werkt vaak zonder instellen. Zitten spelers op mobiele netwerken of achter strikte routers, voeg dan een TURN-server toe. Alleen FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Logs zoeken en lezen","dc_logs_h":"Logtypes, het tabblad Scripts en zoekoperatoren","dc_logs_s":"De pagina Logs heeft per logtype een live tabblad en een zoekfunctie die in alle logs zoekt. De geschiedenis wordt standaard 90 dagen bewaard (Configuratie).","dc_discord_t":"Logs naar Discord sturen","dc_discord_h":"Eén webhook per logtype","dc_discord_s":"Elk logtype kan via een webhook in een eigen Discord-kanaal posten. Geld heeft een eigen kanaal omdat het veel volume is.","dc_items_t":"Items iets laten doen (effecten)","dc_items_h":"Gezondheid, honger, schermeffecten, animaties, geld","dc_items_s":"Koppel effecten aan een item in het paneel en ze draaien zodra een speler het gebruikt. Geen scripting nodig. Gebruik de editor; schrijf de effecten niet met de hand.","dc_panelclosed_t":"Het paneel gaat niet open","dc_panelclosed_h":"Verkeerd adres, gesloten poort, resource niet gestart","dc_panelclosed_s":"Werk de stappen op volgorde af. Zet eerst Debug-logging aan (Configuratie): dan verschijnt elk webverzoek in de console.","dc_denied_t":"\"Denied: admin access required\" in het spel","dc_denied_h":"Het menu in het spel gaat niet open","dc_denied_s":"Het menu in het spel gebruikt standaard geen ACE-rechten. Het controleert de FiveM-naam (fxname) bij een paneelgebruiker. Komt die niet overeen met je identifier, dan zegt het menu Denied.","dc_ratelimit_t":"429-fouten of Live View valt steeds weg","dc_ratelimit_h":"De verzoeklimieten van FiveM zijn te laag voor het paneel","dc_ratelimit_s":"Dit gebeurt als het paneel via de gamepoort wordt gebruikt. FiveM beperkt verzoeken per IP en het paneel heeft er meer nodig. Het opstartrapport waarschuwt hiervoor.","dc_write_t":"Opslaan mislukt: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"De editors voor jobs, gangs, items en voertuigen hebben toestemming nodig","dc_write_s":"Nieuwere server-artifacts laten Unlimited alleen in andere resources opslaan als server.cfg dat toestaat. De editors hebben dat nodig; de rest van het paneel werkt zonder.","dc_console_t":"Wat een consolebericht betekent","dc_console_h":"Consoleberichten en wat je ermee doet","dc_console_s":"De console is standaard stil: hij toont het opstartoverzicht, waarschuwingen en fouten. Al het andere (webverzoeken, sockets, Live View-sessies) verschijnt alleen als Configuratie, Debug-logging aanstaat. Zet het aan tijdens het zoeken naar een probleem en weer uit als het werkt. Alles wordt altijd naar het logbestand geschreven.","dc_g_install":"Installeren en hosten","dc_g_access":"Toegang en staff","dc_g_features":"Functies","dc_g_problems":"Problemen","dc_nav":"Docs","dc_title":"Documentatie","dc_lead":"Korte handleidingen voor het gebruik van Unlimited Reforged. Kies wat je wilt doen, of gebruik de zoekbalk bovenaan.","dc_ask":"Waarmee kunnen we je helpen?","dc_back":"Terug naar onderwerpen","dc_more":"Lees de volledige handleiding","dc_gs":"Meer hulp nodig bij een stap?","q12":"Waarom zegt het spel \"Denied: admin access required\"?","a12":"Het menu in het spel controleert de FiveM-naam (fxname) bij je paneelgebruiker. Vul je eigen identifier in of gebruik een ACE-groep. De volledige stappen staan in de documentatie.","dc_install_1":"Pak de zip uit en zet de map in resources/. De mapnaam is de resourcenaam en maakt deel uit van het paneeladres.","dc_install_2":"Voeg de regels voor je framework toe aan server.cfg. De volgorde is belangrijk: oxmysql, framework, inventory en Unlimited als laatste.","dc_install_3":"Voeg bij nieuwere server-artifacts ook de schrijfrechtregels voor je framework toe, vóór de ensure-regel.","dc_install_4":"Toon de schrijfrechtregels","dc_install_5":"Start de server. De console toont een eenmalig setup-token en de paneeladressen (regels die met [Unlimited] beginnen).","dc_install_6":"Open het paneeladres en volg de wizard: taal, hoofdaccount (gebruikersnaam en wachtwoord), plak dan het token. Log in.","dc_install_7":"Het token verandert bij elke herstart, gebruik dus altijd het nieuwste uit de console. Unlimited herkent zelf je framework, inventory en aantal slots en toont daar één regel over, bijvoorbeeld [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Tabellen in de database worden automatisch aangemaakt.","dc_install_8":"Klopt het paneeladres niet? Zie adressen en poorten","dc_hosting_1":"Route","dc_hosting_2":"Adres","dc_hosting_3":"Eigen paneelpoort (thuisserver, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Gamepoort (gamehosts waar alleen de gamepoort open is)","dc_hosting_5":"Houd bij de gamepoort de / aan het eind. Zodra de resource start, toont de console de exacte adressen.","dc_hosting_6":"Open de paneelpoort (TCP) in je firewall of hostpaneel. Vraag bij een gamehost om een extra poort en stel die in in server.cfg.","dc_hosting_7":"Gebruik je het adres van de gamepoort, voeg dan de rate-limitregels hieronder toe. FiveM beperkt standaard verzoeken per IP, en dat is te weinig voor het paneel.","dc_hosting_8":"Zet voor een domein met HTTPS een reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy of Cloudflare) ervoor. Het paneel zelf serveert gewoon HTTP. De proxy moet Host en X-Forwarded-Proto doorgeven en WebSocket-upgrades toestaan.","dc_hosting_9":"Alleen als het paneel op een andere site wordt gehost (unlDisableServe true): zet het adres van die site in unlPanelAllowedOrigins. Niet nodig als het paneel vanaf deze server wordt geopend.","dc_hosting_10":"429-fouten? Zie rate limits","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Standaard","dc_settings_3":"Wat het doet","dc_settings_4":"Eigen paneelpoort.","dc_settings_5":"hostpoort, anders 30120","dc_settings_6":"Gamepoort die in het opstartrapport staat.","dc_settings_7":"Zoek bij het opstarten het publieke IP op.","dc_settings_8":"true = serveer het paneel niet vanuit deze resource (externe hosting).","dc_settings_9":"leeg","dc_settings_10":"Extra webadressen die de paneel-API vanaf een andere site mogen gebruiken, gescheiden door komma's.","dc_settings_11":"Chatcommando voor het menu in het spel. Standaard op RedM: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Meldcommando voor spelers. Mag niet hetzelfde zijn als het menucommando.","dc_settings_13":"Welke paneelrol een ACE-groep krijgt, als JSON.","dc_settings_14":"Live View-engine: auto, screencapture of webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (gebruik set, nooit setr).","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API-token (gebruik set, nooit setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = geen melding van een nieuwe versie in de console en op het Dashboard.","dc_settings_18":"false = zet de live serverconsole in het menu in het spel uit.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Event van je kledingscript; leeg = automatisch detecteren.","dc_settings_21":"config.json-sleutel","dc_settings_22":"hangt af van inventory","dc_settings_23":"Waar stashes, kofferbakken en dashboardkastjes staan. Moet bij je inventory passen, anders lijken stashes leeg.","dc_settings_24":"Hetzelfde als de convar. Leeg = standaard.","dc_settings_25":"Hetzelfde als de convar. Leeg = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"STUN- en TURN-servers voor Live View.","dc_settings_28":"Discord-webhook per logtype. De andere staan in het onderwerp Discord.","dc_settings_29":"true = helemaal geen wapenlogs.","dc_settings_30":"true = wapenlogs blijven alleen buiten Discord.","dc_settings_31":"config.json moet geldige JSON zijn; // en /* */ als commentaar mag. Frameworknamen, inventory en slots worden herkend aan wat er draait, en een waarde die niet past wordt genegeerd met een Warning:-regel in de console. Een oude config.json mag blijven staan.","dc_settings_32":"Discord-webhooks","dc_backup_1":"Pad","dc_backup_2":"Wat erin zit","dc_backup_3":"Paneelgebruikers, rollen, instellingen, notities en waypoints.","dc_backup_4":"De logbestanden: player, game, money, dev, web en scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Je eigen instellingen en webhooks.","dc_backup_6":"Back-up maken","dc_backup_7":"Kopieer config.json en de map unlWeb/ naar een veilige plek.","dc_backup_8":"Bijwerken","dc_backup_9":"Kopieer de nieuwe bestanden over de oude map. Verwijder de map niet eerst en verwijder nooit unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Bewaar je eigen config.json. Vergelijk hem met de nieuwe voor nieuwe opties.","dc_backup_11":"Herstart de server. Controleer daarna je rollen: een rol zonder een nieuw recht mist die knop.","dc_backup_12":"Verwijderen","dc_backup_13":"Haal de ensure-regel en de add_filesystem_permission-regels uit server.cfg en stop de server.","dc_backup_14":"Verplaats de resourcemap. Bewaar een kopie van unlWeb/ als je misschien terugkomt.","dc_backup_15":"De tabellen die Unlimited in de database aanmaakte (namen die met unl_ beginnen) en twee kolommen (bans.tokens en players.isWhitelisted) blijven staan. Ze doen geen kwaad; verwijder ze alleen als je zeker bent.","dc_backup_16":"Als je unlWeb/data.json verwijdert, start de installatiewizard opnieuw en verdwijnen alle paneelgebruikers, rollen, notities en waypoints.","dc_access_1":"Management, Rollen: maak een rol en vink alleen de rechten aan die die persoon nodig heeft.","dc_access_2":"Management, Gebruikers: maak de gebruiker en wijs de rol toe. Een gebruiker zonder rol kan niet inloggen.","dc_access_3":"Vul bij dezelfde gebruiker de FiveM-naam (fxname) in met zijn of haar identifier, bijvoorbeeld de code hieronder. Zonder dit zegt het menu in het spel Denied.","dc_access_4":"Typ in het spel /admin op FiveM of /unladmin op RedM.","dc_access_5":"Staff met een ACE-groep (van txAdmin of add_principal) krijgt het menu in het spel ook zonder eigen paneelgebruiker. Geef aan welke paneelrol elke groep krijgt; de rol met die naam bepaalt wat ze mogen. Een paneelgebruiker die aan de speler gekoppeld is, gaat altijd voor. Gebruik {} om het uit te zetten.","dc_access_6":"Wat","dc_access_7":"Hoe je het wijzigt","dc_access_8":"Menucommando: /admin op FiveM, /unladmin op RedM","dc_access_9":"Configuratie, Adminmenu in het spel, of set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" in server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Meldcommando voor spelers: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Configuratie, Rapportcommando voor spelers, of set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"RedM-sneltoets voor het menu (een RDR-control-hash zoals 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"Op dezelfde plek als het menucommando. RedM heeft geen toetsbindingen voor scripts, dus het is optioneel.","dc_access_14":"Als een ander menu al /admin gebruikt (bijvoorbeeld qbx_adminmenu), meldt de console dat bij het opstarten: kies een ander commando. Op ESX houdt esx_adminmenu /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Actie","dc_access_16":"Rolrecht","dc_access_17":"Waarschuwen, een bericht sturen","dc_access_18":"Speler: waarschuwen","dc_access_19":"Kick","dc_access_20":"Speler: kick","dc_access_21":"Ban","dc_access_22":"Speler: ban","dc_access_23":"Live View, meekijken","dc_access_24":"Speler: neem screenshot","dc_access_25":"Serverconsole in het menu: lezen / commando's uitvoeren","dc_access_26":"Configuratie: lezen / bewerken","dc_access_27":"Wachtrij: bekijken / binnenlaten","dc_access_28":"Whitelist: lezen / bewerken","dc_access_29":"Krijg je Denied? Zie de oplossing","dc_whitelist_1":"Toegangsmodus","dc_whitelist_2":"Geen controle.","dc_whitelist_3":"Een licentie moet in de database op de whitelist staan.","dc_whitelist_4":"Bepaald door Discord-rollen op je guild.","dc_whitelist_5":"Eerst de lokale whitelist, dan Discord. Dit is de standaard.","dc_whitelist_6":"Open de pagina Whitelist en zet de globale handhaving aan als je klaar bent.","dc_whitelist_7":"Kies de toegangsmodus onder Toegangsbeheer. Voer voor Discord-rollen de guild-ID en het bot-token in en geef elke rol een prioriteit.","dc_whitelist_8":"Stel de wachtrijlimiet in (Max. spelers). Standaard is dat sv_maxclients, die nooit wordt overschreden. Spelers die nog downloaden of laden tellen als verbonden en raken hun plek nooit kwijt.","dc_whitelist_9":"Gebruik slotgroepen om plekken te reserveren, bijvoorbeeld voor staff. Staff in ACE-groepen (group.admin, group.moderator) krijgt altijd toegang.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: de onderhoudsmodus wordt ook gecontroleerd als VORP over toegang beslist. RSG-Core: als rsg-queue draait, is dat de wachtrij en toont het menu in het spel de lijst alleen-lezen. ESX: als esx_whitelist draait en de whitelist aanstaat, bepaalt die wie mag joinen en draait Unlimited alleen de wachtrij (Configuratie, Whitelist-bron).","dc_security_1":"Deel nooit het setup-token, unlWeb/data.json, een Discord-bottoken, een webhook-URL, het Cloudflare TURN API-token of een TURN-wachtwoord. Haal ze weg voordat je console-uitvoer of config.json voor support plaatst.","dc_security_2":"Zet het paneel achter HTTPS met een reverse proxy als het vanaf internet bereikbaar is.","dc_security_3":"Geef elke rol alleen de rechten die nodig zijn. Bewaar het hoofdaccount voor de eigenaar en controleer de rollen na elke update.","dc_security_4":"Zet geheimen in server.cfg met set, nooit met setr. setr stuurt de waarde naar elke speler.","dc_security_5":"Vermeld in je regels dat staff met Live View de stem in het spel kan afluisteren, en dat een speler een indicator ziet zolang hij via een screencapture-stream wordt bekeken.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited is een monitoring- en beheertool, geen anti-cheat. Reken er niet op dat Live View betaalde cheatmenu's vangt.","dc_liveview_1":"Optie","dc_liveview_2":"Wanneer gebruiken","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture met zijn Cloudflare-stream","dc_liveview_4":"Meest stabiel en geschikt voor veel kijkers. Wordt automatisch gebruikt als het is ingesteld, met WebRTC als terugval.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (ingebouwd)","dc_liveview_6":"Directe verbindingen mislukken. Eenvoudigste oplossing.","dc_liveview_7":"Je eigen TURN-server (bijvoorbeeld coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Je draait er al een, of wilt vaste inloggegevens.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, stap voor stap","dc_liveview_10":"Open in het Cloudflare-dashboard Realtime en dan TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Maak een TURN-sleutel. Kopieer de Turn Token ID en het API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Zet ze met set in server.cfg.","dc_liveview_13":"Herstart. Met Debug-logging aan toont de console de regel hieronder.","dc_liveview_14":"Je eigen TURN-server komt in config.json. Houd de STUN-regel.","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture-stream: stel de live worker in en voeg dan de regels hieronder toe. De resource screencapture moet vóór Unlimited starten. Limieten: 720p, 30 fps, geen game-audio, elke 30 minuten een nieuwe stream. Wil je het nooit gebruiken, zet unlLiveScreenEngine dan op webrtc.","dc_liveview_16":"Bericht","dc_liveview_17":"Oplossing","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"Voeg TURN toe (zie boven).","dc_liveview_20":"Verkeerde Turn Token ID.","dc_liveview_21":"Verkeerd API-token.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Installeer screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"De stream valt steeds weg","dc_liveview_25":"Controleer de rate-limitregels als je het adres van de gamepoort gebruikt.","dc_liveview_26":"Stem: Live View speelt ook de nabijheidsstem van de speler af in je eigen spel. Je moet in het spel zijn met je FiveM-naam ingesteld bij je paneelgebruiker, het rolrecht Naar stem luisteren, en pma-voice of mumble-voip. In het spel: /admin, speler, Live View; stoppen met /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Rate limits","dc_logs_1":"Log","dc_logs_2":"Bevat","dc_logs_3":"Player","dc_logs_4":"Acties op karakters, joins, leaves, kicks, bans, wapentreffers.","dc_logs_5":"Game","dc_logs_6":"Doden, revives en wat andere resources doorsturen.","dc_logs_7":"Geld","dc_logs_8":"Elke geldwijziging met rekening, bedrag en reden.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Wijzigingen aan items, jobs, gangs en voertuigen.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"Auditlog van het paneel: logins met IP, wie wat heeft gewijzigd.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Opstart-, systeem- en foutregels.","dc_logs_15":"Scripts","dc_logs_16":"Regels die andere scripts doorsturen. Nieuwe scripts verschijnen vanzelf.","dc_logs_17":"Zoeken","dc_logs_18":"Vindt","dc_logs_19":"Alles over één speler, op id of identifier.","dc_logs_20":"Hetzelfde, op karakternaam.","dc_logs_21":"Slechts één logtype. Gebruik een komma voor meer: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Regels van één script.","dc_logs_23":"Alleen info-, warn- of error-regels.","dc_logs_24":"Regels die deze tekst bevatten.","dc_logs_25":"Je kunt operatoren combineren. Gewone tekst die bij een speler past, toont alles over die speler; anders wordt de tekst doorzocht.","dc_logs_26":"Scriptmakers loggen met één serveraanroep in Unlimited. Het tabblad Scripts filtert op script, niveau, categorie, speler en tekst, en vereist het rolrecht logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Limieten: 20 regels per seconde per script. Het scriptlogbestand roteert bij 10 MB en bewaart 3 oude bestanden.","dc_discord_1":"In Discord: kanaalinstellingen, Integraties, Webhooks, Nieuwe webhook. Kopieer de webhook-URL.","dc_discord_2":"Zet hem in config.json onder de sleutel van dat logtype, of in server.cfg met set.","dc_discord_3":"Herstart de resource. Berichten komen binnen als embeds met kleurcodes.","dc_discord_4":"Sleutel / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (audit van het paneel)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (algemeen)","dc_discord_7":"Een webhook-URL is een wachtwoord: iedereen die hem heeft kan in je kanaal posten. Wapenlogs kun je uitzetten (disableWeaponLogs) of alleen buiten Discord houden (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). De wachtrij heeft een eigen optionele webhook in de wachtrij-instellingen. Discord-rollen voor de whitelist stel je in op de pagina Whitelist.","dc_discord_8":"Whitelist en wachtrij","dc_items_1":"Open Dev, dan Items, en open het item.","dc_items_2":"Voeg effecten toe: gezondheid en armor, honger en dorst, schermeffecten, animaties, geluiden, items en geld. Elk effect kan een vertraging en een duur in milliseconden hebben (15 seconden is 15000).","dc_items_3":"Sla op. Op FiveM met ox_inventory worden de effecten als unlEffects op het item opgeslagen in je ox_inventory-items, wat het schrijfrecht nodig heeft.","dc_items_4":"Gebruik het item in het spel om het te testen.","dc_items_5":"Opslaan mislukt? Zie schrijfrecht","dc_items_6":"RedM met VORP: open het item en gebruik de sectie Verbruiksitem. De effecten worden opgeslagen in de tabel unl_item_effects en meteen geregistreerd in vorp_inventory. Een gloednieuw item heeft nog steeds een herstart van vorp_inventory nodig.","dc_items_7":"Items in vorp_metabolism Config.ItemsToUse worden aan vorp_metabolism overgelaten, zodat niets dubbel draait.","dc_items_8":"Als een ander script het item al als bruikbaar registreert, geef het hier dan geen effecten. vorp_inventory houdt één handler per item.","dc_items_9":"Sprint- en zwemvermenigvuldigers worden door het spel op 1.49 begrensd. Gebruik voor merkbaar sneller bewegen de move rate override.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Zoek de regels die met [Unlimited] beginnen in de serverconsole en open precies de adressen die daar staan.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Zoek naar Oppstart STOPPET (opstarten mislukt, de reden volgt) of de regel hieronder. Wijzig de poort als die bezet is.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Staat er in de console Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra, dan is de eigen poort niet open bij je host. Gebruik het adres van de gamepoort, met de / aan het eind.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Open het paneel met Debug-logging aan. Verschijnen er geen HTTP GET-regels, dan kwam het verzoek nooit bij de server: verkeerd adres of poort, of een firewall.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Zorg achter een reverse proxy dat WebSocket-upgrades zijn toegestaan.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Adressen en poorten","dc_denied_1":"Management, Gebruikers: open je gebruiker.","dc_denied_2":"Zet de FiveM-naam op je eigen identifier, bijvoorbeeld de regel hieronder.","dc_denied_3":"Controleer of de rol van de gebruiker de verwachte rechten heeft.","dc_denied_4":"Of gebruik een ACE-groep: voeg jezelf toe aan group.admin en stel unlAdminMenuAceRoles in, zie het onderwerp Toegang.","dc_denied_5":"Opent /admin een ander menu? Een ander script gebruikt het commando. Kies een nieuw commando in Configuratie.","dc_denied_6":"Staff toegang geven","dc_ratelimit_1":"Voeg deze regels toe aan server.cfg, vóór ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Herstart de server.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Of open in plaats daarvan de eigen paneelpoort. Die heeft geen last van deze limieten.","dc_write_1":"Voeg de add_filesystem_permission-regels voor je framework toe. Het opstartrapport en de editorpagina's tonen de exacte regels die je server nodig heeft.","dc_write_2":"Zet ze vóór ensure unlimited-reforge en herstart de server.","dc_write_3":"Lukt het nog niet? De resource waarin Unlimited schrijft, moet vaak in zijn fxmanifest.lua dezelfde auteur hebben als Unlimited. Voeg de regel hieronder in beide toe en herstart.","dc_write_4":"Toon de rechtregels voor elk framework","dc_console_1":"Consolebericht","dc_console_2":"Betekenis en oplossing","dc_console_3":"Opstarten mislukt; de reden volgt. Het paneel start niet.","dc_console_4":"De resource kan zijn gegevens niet opslaan. Controleer de bestandsrechten op de host.","dc_console_5":"Hetzelfde: het serverproces heeft schrijftoegang tot de resourcemap nodig.","dc_console_6":"De paneelpoort is niet open bij je host. Gebruik het adres van de gamepoort.","dc_console_7":"Voeg de rate-limitregels toe.","dc_console_8":"Het paneel verloor de verbinding, vaak door een 429. Voeg de rate-limitregels toe.","dc_console_9":"Live View kan tussen netwerken mislukken. Stel TURN in.","dc_console_10":"Geen verbinding tussen speler en kijker. Zie Live View.","dc_console_11":"Fout in het paneel; de regels erboven tonen de oorzaak.","dc_console_12":"Wijzig de poort met unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"Het framework is nog niet gestart of heeft een andere naam. Start Unlimited erna.","dc_console_14":"Setup-token werkt niet: het verandert bij elke herstart, gebruik het token van de laatste start. Hoofdwachtwoord kwijt? Als je unlWeb/data.json verwijdert, start de wizard opnieuw, maar verdwijnen ook alle paneelgebruikers, rollen, notities en waypoints. Kopieer het bestand eerst naar een veilige plek."},"pl":{"dc_install_t":"Instalacja i pierwsze uruchomienie","dc_install_h":"Folder, server.cfg, token konfiguracji, pierwsze logowanie","dc_install_s":"Wrzuć folder do resources/, dodaj linię ensure, uruchom serwer i dokończ kreator konfiguracji w przeglądarce. Nie ma importu SQL ani budowania.","dc_hosting_t":"Hosting gier lub własny serwer: adresy i porty","dc_hosting_h":"Jakiego adresu użyć, zapora, domena i HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"Panel działa na własnym porcie (domyślnie 3000) oraz przez port gry. Gdy własny port jest osiągalny, używaj jego. Na hostingu gier, gdzie otwarty jest tylko port gry, użyj adresu przez port gry.","dc_settings_t":"Znajdź ustawienie","dc_settings_h":"Convary do server.cfg i klucze do config.json","dc_settings_s":"Większość ustawień jest w panelu: Zarządzanie, potem Konfiguracja. Convary i klucze config.json poniżej służą do rzeczy, które muszą istnieć, zanim panel wystartuje, oraz do sekretów. Convar nadpisuje ten sam klucz w config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Kopia zapasowa, aktualizacja i odinstalowanie","dc_backup_h":"Co zachować, jak bezpiecznie zaktualizować, jak usunąć","dc_backup_s":"Wszystko, co ustawisz, jest w config.json i folderze unlWeb/. Zachowaj te dwie rzeczy, a resztę resource możesz w każdej chwili wymienić.","dc_access_t":"Nadaj dostęp personelowi (panel i w grze)","dc_access_h":"Role, użytkownicy, FiveM ID, /admin i grupy ACE","dc_access_s":"Panel WWW i menu w grze to dwa osobne dostępy. Utwórz rolę, utwórz użytkownika, potem połącz go z jego kontem w grze.","dc_whitelist_t":"Skonfiguruj białą listę i kolejkę","dc_whitelist_h":"Tryby dostępu, role Discord, limit kolejki i priorytet","dc_whitelist_s":"Biała lista jest domyślnie wyłączona, więc instalacja nikogo nie zablokuje. Włącz ją, gdy będziesz gotów. Kolejka ma znaczenie tylko wtedy, gdy serwer jest pełny.","dc_security_t":"Bezpieczeństwo: co trzymać w tajemnicy","dc_security_h":"Sekrety, HTTPS i najmniejsze uprawnienia","dc_security_s":"Personel loguje się hasłami, a panel może zmieniać Twój serwer, więc traktuj go jak narzędzie administratora.","dc_liveview_t":"Skonfiguruj Live View","dc_liveview_h":"Ekran i głos, TURN dla restrykcyjnych sieci","dc_liveview_s":"Live View przesyła ekran gracza do Twojej przeglądarki przez WebRTC, bezpośrednio między grą a przeglądarką. Często działa bez konfiguracji. Jeśli gracze korzystają z sieci komórkowych lub restrykcyjnych routerów, dodaj serwer TURN. Tylko FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Szukaj w logach i czytaj je","dc_logs_h":"Typy logów, zakładka Scripts i operatory wyszukiwania","dc_logs_s":"Strona Logi ma jedną zakładkę na żywo dla każdego typu logu oraz wyszukiwarkę, która przeszukuje wszystkie naraz. Historia jest domyślnie przechowywana przez 90 dni (Konfiguracja).","dc_discord_t":"Wysyłaj logi na Discord","dc_discord_h":"Jeden webhook na typ logu","dc_discord_s":"Każdy typ logu może pisać na osobny kanał Discord przez webhook. Pieniądze mają własny, bo generują dużo wpisów.","dc_items_t":"Spraw, by przedmioty coś robiły (efekty)","dc_items_h":"Zdrowie, głód, efekty ekranu, animacje, pieniądze","dc_items_s":"Dodaj efekty do przedmiotu w panelu, a uruchomią się, gdy gracz go użyje. Bez skryptowania. Używaj edytora; nie pisz efektów ręcznie.","dc_panelclosed_t":"Panel się nie otwiera","dc_panelclosed_h":"Zły adres, zamknięty port, resource niewystartowany","dc_panelclosed_s":"Przejdź kroki po kolei. Najpierw włącz Logi debugowania (Konfiguracja): wtedy każde żądanie WWW pojawi się w konsoli.","dc_denied_t":"\"Denied: admin access required\" w grze","dc_denied_h":"Menu w grze się nie otwiera","dc_denied_s":"Menu w grze domyślnie nie używa uprawnień ACE. Sprawdza nazwę FiveM (fxname) przy użytkowniku panelu. Jeśli nie pasuje do Twojego identyfikatora, menu pokazuje Denied.","dc_ratelimit_t":"Błędy 429 lub Live View ciągle się rozłącza","dc_ratelimit_h":"Limity żądań FiveM są za niskie dla panelu","dc_ratelimit_s":"Dzieje się tak, gdy panel jest używany przez port gry. FiveM ogranicza liczbę żądań na IP, a panel potrzebuje więcej. Raport startowy ostrzega o tym.","dc_write_t":"Zapis nie działa: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"Edytory prac, gangów, przedmiotów i pojazdów wymagają uprawnienia","dc_write_s":"Nowsze artefakty serwera pozwalają Unlimited zapisywać w innych resource tylko wtedy, gdy server.cfg na to pozwala. Edytory tego potrzebują; reszta panelu działa bez tego.","dc_console_t":"Co znaczy komunikat w konsoli","dc_console_h":"Komunikaty konsoli i co robić","dc_console_s":"Konsola jest domyślnie cicha: pokazuje podsumowanie startu, ostrzeżenia i błędy. Reszta (żądania WWW, sockety, sesje Live View) pojawia się tylko, gdy włączone są Konfiguracja, Logi debugowania. Włącz to na czas szukania problemu i wyłącz, gdy zadziała. Wszystko jest zawsze zapisywane do pliku logu.","dc_g_install":"Instalacja i hosting","dc_g_access":"Dostęp i personel","dc_g_features":"Funkcje","dc_g_problems":"Problemy","dc_nav":"Dokumentacja","dc_title":"Dokumentacja","dc_lead":"Krótkie poradniki do prowadzenia Unlimited Reforged. Wybierz, co chcesz zrobić, albo użyj wyszukiwarki u góry.","dc_ask":"W czym potrzebujesz pomocy?","dc_back":"Wróć do tematów","dc_more":"Czytaj pełny poradnik","dc_gs":"Potrzebujesz więcej pomocy z krokiem?","q12":"Dlaczego gra pokazuje \"Denied: admin access required\"?","a12":"Menu w grze sprawdza nazwę FiveM (fxname) przy Twoim użytkowniku panelu. Ustaw tam własny identyfikator albo użyj grupy ACE. Pełne kroki są w dokumentacji.","dc_install_1":"Rozpakuj zip i wrzuć folder do resources/. Nazwa folderu to nazwa resource i część adresu panelu.","dc_install_2":"Dodaj do server.cfg linie dla swojego frameworka. Kolejność ma znaczenie: oxmysql, framework, inventory, a Unlimited na końcu.","dc_install_3":"Na nowszych artefaktach serwera dodaj też linie uprawnień zapisu dla swojego frameworka przed linią ensure.","dc_install_4":"Pokaż linie uprawnień zapisu","dc_install_5":"Uruchom serwer. Konsola wypisze jednorazowy token konfiguracji i adresy panelu (linie zaczynające się od [Unlimited]).","dc_install_6":"Otwórz adres panelu i przejdź kreator: język, konto główne (nazwa użytkownika i hasło), potem wklej token. Zaloguj się.","dc_install_7":"Token zmienia się przy każdym restarcie, więc zawsze używaj najnowszego z konsoli. Unlimited sam wykrywa framework, inventory i liczbę slotów i wypisuje o tym jedną linię, na przykład [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Tabele w bazie danych tworzą się automatycznie.","dc_install_8":"Adres panelu się nie zgadza? Zobacz adresy i porty","dc_hosting_1":"Droga","dc_hosting_2":"Adres","dc_hosting_3":"Własny port panelu (serwer domowy, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Port gry (hosting gier, gdzie otwarty jest tylko port gry)","dc_hosting_5":"Przez port gry zachowaj / na końcu. Po starcie resource konsola wypisuje dokładne adresy.","dc_hosting_6":"Otwórz port panelu (TCP) w zaporze lub panelu hostingu. Na hostingu gier poproś o dodatkowy port i ustaw go w server.cfg.","dc_hosting_7":"Jeśli używasz adresu przez port gry, dodaj poniższe linie limitów żądań. FiveM domyślnie ogranicza żądania na IP, co jest za mało dla panelu.","dc_hosting_8":"Dla domeny z HTTPS postaw przed panelem reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy lub Cloudflare). Sam panel serwuje zwykły HTTP. Proxy musi przekazywać Host i X-Forwarded-Proto oraz zezwalać na upgrade do WebSocket.","dc_hosting_9":"Tylko gdy panel jest hostowany na innej stronie (unlDisableServe true): wpisz adres tej strony w unlPanelAllowedOrigins. Nie jest to potrzebne, gdy panel otwierasz z tego serwera.","dc_hosting_10":"Dostajesz błędy 429? Zobacz limity żądań","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Domyślnie","dc_settings_3":"Co robi","dc_settings_4":"Własny port panelu.","dc_settings_5":"port hosta, inaczej 30120","dc_settings_6":"Port gry pokazywany w raporcie startowym.","dc_settings_7":"Sprawdź publiczne IP przy starcie.","dc_settings_8":"true = nie serwuj panelu z tego resource (hosting zewnętrzny).","dc_settings_9":"puste","dc_settings_10":"Dodatkowe adresy WWW, które mogą używać API panelu z innej strony, rozdzielone przecinkami.","dc_settings_11":"Komenda czatu dla menu w grze. Domyślnie na RedM: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Komenda zgłoszeń dla graczy. Nie może być taka sama jak komenda menu.","dc_settings_13":"Jaką rolę panelu dostaje grupa ACE, jako JSON.","dc_settings_14":"Silnik Live View: auto, screencapture lub webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (użyj set, nigdy setr).","dc_settings_16":"Token API Cloudflare TURN (użyj set, nigdy setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = brak powiadomienia o nowej wersji w konsoli i na Dashboard.","dc_settings_18":"false = wyłącz konsolę serwera na żywo w menu w grze.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Event Twojego skryptu ubrań; puste = wykryj automatycznie.","dc_settings_21":"Klucz config.json","dc_settings_22":"zależy od inventory","dc_settings_23":"Gdzie są schowki, bagażniki i schowki w pojazdach. Musi pasować do Twojego inventory, inaczej schowki wyglądają na puste.","dc_settings_24":"To samo co convar. Puste = domyślnie.","dc_settings_25":"To samo co convar. Puste = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"Serwery STUN i TURN dla Live View.","dc_settings_28":"Webhook Discord na typ logu. Pozostałe są wymienione w temacie o Discord.","dc_settings_29":"true = żadnych logów broni.","dc_settings_30":"true = logi broni nie trafiają tylko na Discord.","dc_settings_31":"config.json musi być poprawnym JSON; dozwolone są komentarze // i /* */. Nazwy frameworków, inventory i sloty są wykrywane z tego, co działa, a wartość, która nie pasuje, jest ignorowana z linią Warning: w konsoli. Stary config.json może zostać.","dc_settings_32":"Webhooki Discord","dc_backup_1":"Ścieżka","dc_backup_2":"Co zawiera","dc_backup_3":"Użytkownicy panelu, role, ustawienia, notatki i waypointy.","dc_backup_4":"Pliki logów: player, game, money, dev, web i scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Twoje ustawienia i webhooki.","dc_backup_6":"Kopia zapasowa","dc_backup_7":"Skopiuj config.json i folder unlWeb/ w bezpieczne miejsce.","dc_backup_8":"Aktualizacja","dc_backup_9":"Skopiuj nowe pliki na stary folder. Nie usuwaj wcześniej folderu i nigdy nie usuwaj unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Zachowaj swój config.json. Porównaj go z nowym, żeby znaleźć nowe opcje.","dc_backup_11":"Zrestartuj serwer. Potem sprawdź swoje role: rola bez nowego uprawnienia traci ten przycisk.","dc_backup_12":"Odinstalowanie","dc_backup_13":"Usuń linię ensure i linie add_filesystem_permission z server.cfg i zatrzymaj serwer.","dc_backup_14":"Przenieś folder resource gdzieś indziej. Zachowaj kopię unlWeb/, jeśli możesz wrócić.","dc_backup_15":"Tabele utworzone przez Unlimited w bazie danych (nazwy zaczynające się od unl_) oraz dwie kolumny (bans.tokens i players.isWhitelisted) zostają. Nie szkodzą; usuwaj je tylko, jeśli jesteś pewien.","dc_backup_16":"Usunięcie unlWeb/data.json uruchamia kreator od nowa i kasuje wszystkich użytkowników panelu, role, notatki i waypointy.","dc_access_1":"Zarządzanie, Role: utwórz rolę i zaznacz tylko uprawnienia, których ta osoba potrzebuje.","dc_access_2":"Zarządzanie, Użytkownicy: utwórz użytkownika i przypisz rolę. Użytkownik bez roli nie może się zalogować.","dc_access_3":"Przy tym samym użytkowniku wpisz nazwę FiveM (fxname) z jego identyfikatorem, na przykład kod poniżej. Bez tego menu w grze pokazuje Denied.","dc_access_4":"W grze wpisz /admin na FiveM lub /unladmin na RedM.","dc_access_5":"Personel z grupą ACE (z txAdmin lub add_principal) dostaje menu w grze także bez własnego użytkownika panelu. Podaj, jaką rolę panelu dostaje każda grupa; rola o tej nazwie decyduje, co mogą robić. Użytkownik panelu połączony z graczem zawsze ma pierwszeństwo. Użyj {}, aby to wyłączyć.","dc_access_6":"Co","dc_access_7":"Jak zmienić","dc_access_8":"Komenda menu: /admin na FiveM, /unladmin na RedM","dc_access_9":"Konfiguracja, Menu admina w grze, albo set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" w server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Komenda zgłoszeń dla graczy: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Konfiguracja, Komenda zgłoszeń dla graczy, albo set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"Skrót klawiszowy menu na RedM (hash kontrolki RDR, np. 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"To samo miejsce co komenda menu. RedM nie ma przypisań klawiszy dla skryptów, więc jest opcjonalny.","dc_access_14":"Jeśli inne menu już używa /admin (na przykład qbx_adminmenu), konsola powie o tym przy starcie: wybierz inną komendę. Na ESX esx_adminmenu zachowuje /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Akcja","dc_access_16":"Uprawnienie roli","dc_access_17":"Ostrzeżenie, wysłanie wiadomości","dc_access_18":"Gracz: ostrzeżenie","dc_access_19":"Wyrzucenie","dc_access_20":"Gracz: wyrzuć","dc_access_21":"Ban","dc_access_22":"Gracz: ban","dc_access_23":"Live View, obserwowanie","dc_access_24":"Gracz: widok ekranu","dc_access_25":"Konsola serwera w menu: odczyt / uruchamianie komend","dc_access_26":"Konfiguracja: odczyt / zmiana","dc_access_27":"Kolejka: podgląd / wpuszczanie","dc_access_28":"Biała lista: odczyt / zmiana","dc_access_29":"Dostajesz Denied? Zobacz rozwiązanie","dc_whitelist_1":"Tryb dostępu","dc_whitelist_2":"Bez sprawdzania.","dc_whitelist_3":"Licencja musi być na białej liście w bazie danych.","dc_whitelist_4":"Decydują role Discord na Twoim serwerze.","dc_whitelist_5":"Najpierw lokalna biała lista, potem Discord. To jest ustawienie domyślne.","dc_whitelist_6":"Otwórz stronę Biała lista i włącz globalne egzekwowanie, gdy będziesz gotów.","dc_whitelist_7":"Wybierz tryb dostępu w sekcji Kontrola dostępu. Dla ról Discord wpisz ID serwera (guild) i token bota, potem nadaj każdej roli priorytet.","dc_whitelist_8":"Ustaw limit kolejki (Maks. graczy). Domyślnie to sv_maxclients, którego nigdy się nie przekracza. Gracze, którzy jeszcze pobierają lub się ładują, liczą się jako połączeni i nigdy nie tracą miejsca.","dc_whitelist_9":"Użyj grup slotów, aby zarezerwować miejsca, na przykład dla personelu. Personel w grupach ACE (group.admin, group.moderator) zawsze ma dostęp.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: tryb konserwacji jest sprawdzany także wtedy, gdy VORP decyduje o dostępie. RSG-Core: gdy działa rsg-queue, to on jest kolejką, a menu w grze pokazuje jego listę tylko do odczytu. ESX: gdy działa esx_whitelist i jego biała lista jest włączona, on decyduje, kto może wejść, a Unlimited obsługuje tylko kolejkę (Konfiguracja, Źródło whitelisty).","dc_security_1":"Nigdy nie udostępniaj tokenu konfiguracji, unlWeb/data.json, tokenu bota Discord, adresu webhooka, tokenu API Cloudflare TURN ani hasła TURN. Usuń je, zanim wkleisz wyjście konsoli lub config.json do wsparcia.","dc_security_2":"Postaw panel za HTTPS z reverse proxy, gdy jest dostępny z internetu.","dc_security_3":"Dawaj każdej roli tylko potrzebne uprawnienia. Konto główne zachowaj dla właściciela i sprawdzaj role po każdej aktualizacji.","dc_security_4":"Sekrety wpisuj w server.cfg przez set, nigdy setr. setr wysyła wartość do każdego gracza.","dc_security_5":"Napisz w regulaminie, że personel może podsłuchiwać głos w grze przez Live View oraz że gracz widzi wskaźnik, gdy jest oglądany przez strumień screencapture.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited to narzędzie do monitoringu i administracji, nie anti-cheat. Nie licz na to, że Live View złapie płatne cheat menu.","dc_liveview_1":"Opcja","dc_liveview_2":"Kiedy użyć","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture ze strumieniem Cloudflare","dc_liveview_4":"Najstabilniejsze i dla wielu widzów. Używane automatycznie po konfiguracji, z WebRTC jako rozwiązaniem zapasowym.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (wbudowany)","dc_liveview_6":"Połączenia bezpośrednie zawodzą. Najprostsze rozwiązanie.","dc_liveview_7":"Własny serwer TURN (na przykład coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Już go masz albo chcesz stałych danych logowania.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN krok po kroku","dc_liveview_10":"W panelu Cloudflare otwórz Realtime, potem TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Utwórz klucz TURN. Skopiuj Turn Token ID i API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Wpisz je w server.cfg przez set.","dc_liveview_13":"Zrestartuj. Gdy Logi debugowania są włączone, konsola pokaże poniższą linię.","dc_liveview_14":"Własny serwer TURN wpisujesz w config.json. Zostaw linię STUN.","dc_liveview_15":"Strumień screencapture: skonfiguruj jego live worker, potem dodaj poniższe linie. Resource screencapture musi wystartować przed Unlimited. Limity: 720p, 30 fps, bez dźwięku z gry, nowy strumień co 30 minut. Aby nigdy go nie używać, ustaw unlLiveScreenEngine na webrtc.","dc_liveview_16":"Komunikat","dc_liveview_17":"Rozwiązanie","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"Dodaj TURN (wyżej).","dc_liveview_20":"Zły Turn Token ID.","dc_liveview_21":"Zły token API.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Zainstaluj screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"Strumień ciągle się urywa","dc_liveview_25":"Sprawdź linie limitów żądań, jeśli używasz adresu przez port gry.","dc_liveview_26":"Głos: Live View odtwarza też głos gracza w pobliżu w Twojej własnej grze. Musisz być w grze z ustawioną nazwą FiveM przy swoim użytkowniku panelu, mieć uprawnienie roli Podsłuchaj głos oraz pma-voice lub mumble-voip. W grze: /admin, gracz, Live View; zatrzymanie przez /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Limity żądań","dc_logs_1":"Log","dc_logs_2":"Zawiera","dc_logs_3":"Gracz","dc_logs_4":"Akcje na postaciach, wejścia, wyjścia, wyrzucenia, bany, trafienia z broni.","dc_logs_5":"Gra","dc_logs_6":"Śmierci, wskrzeszenia i to, co wysyłają inne resource.","dc_logs_7":"Pieniądze","dc_logs_8":"Każda zmiana pieniędzy z kontem, kwotą i powodem.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Zmiany przedmiotów, prac, gangów i pojazdów.","dc_logs_11":"Strona","dc_logs_12":"Ślad audytu panelu: logowania z IP, kto co zmienił.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Linie startu, systemu i błędów.","dc_logs_15":"Skrypty","dc_logs_16":"Linie wysyłane przez inne skrypty. Nowe skrypty pojawiają się same.","dc_logs_17":"Szukaj","dc_logs_18":"Znajduje","dc_logs_19":"Wszystko o jednym graczu, po id lub identyfikatorze.","dc_logs_20":"To samo, po nazwie postaci.","dc_logs_21":"Tylko jeden typ logu. Kilka rozdziel przecinkiem: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Linie z jednego skryptu.","dc_logs_23":"Tylko linie info, warn lub error.","dc_logs_24":"Linie zawierające ten tekst.","dc_logs_25":"Możesz łączyć operatory. Zwykły tekst pasujący do gracza pokazuje wszystko o tym graczu; w przeciwnym razie szuka tekstu.","dc_logs_26":"Autorzy skryptów logują się do Unlimited jednym wywołaniem po stronie serwera. Zakładka Skrypty filtruje po skrypcie, poziomie, kategorii, graczu i tekście i wymaga uprawnienia roli logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Limity: 20 linii na sekundę na skrypt. Plik logu skryptów jest rotowany przy 10 MB i zachowuje 3 stare pliki.","dc_discord_1":"Na Discord: ustawienia kanału, Integracje, Webhooki, Nowy webhook. Skopiuj adres webhooka.","dc_discord_2":"Wpisz go w config.json pod kluczem dla danego typu logu albo w server.cfg przez set.","dc_discord_3":"Zrestartuj resource. Wiadomości przychodzą jako embedy oznaczone kolorami.","dc_discord_4":"Klucz / convar","dc_discord_5":"Strona (audyt panelu)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (ogólny)","dc_discord_7":"Adres webhooka to hasło: każdy, kto go ma, może pisać na Twoim kanale. Logi broni można wyłączyć (disableWeaponLogs) lub wykluczyć tylko z Discorda (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). Kolejka ma własny, opcjonalny webhook w ustawieniach kolejki. Role Discord dla białej listy ustawia się na stronie Biała lista.","dc_discord_8":"Biała lista i kolejka","dc_items_1":"Otwórz Dev, potem Przedmioty, i otwórz przedmiot.","dc_items_2":"Dodaj efekty: zdrowie i pancerz, głód i pragnienie, efekty ekranu, animacje, dźwięki, przedmioty i pieniądze. Każdy efekt może mieć opóźnienie i czas trwania w milisekundach (15 sekund to 15000).","dc_items_3":"Zapisz. Na FiveM z ox_inventory efekty są zapisywane przy przedmiocie jako unlEffects w przedmiotach ox_inventory, co wymaga uprawnienia zapisu.","dc_items_4":"Użyj przedmiotu w grze, żeby to sprawdzić.","dc_items_5":"Zapis nie działa? Zobacz uprawnienie zapisu","dc_items_6":"RedM z VORP: otwórz przedmiot i użyj sekcji Consumable. Efekty są zapisywane w tabeli unl_item_effects i od razu rejestrowane w vorp_inventory. Zupełnie nowy przedmiot nadal wymaga restartu vorp_inventory.","dc_items_7":"Przedmioty z listy Config.ItemsToUse w vorp_metabolism zostają obsłużone przez vorp_metabolism, więc nic nie działa dwa razy.","dc_items_8":"Jeśli inny skrypt już rejestruje przedmiot jako używalny, nie dawaj mu tu efektów. vorp_inventory trzyma jeden handler na przedmiot.","dc_items_9":"Mnożniki sprintu i pływania są ograniczone przez grę do 1.49. Dla wyraźnie szybszego ruchu użyj nadpisania tempa ruchu.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Znajdź w konsoli serwera linie zaczynające się od [Unlimited] i otwórz dokładnie te adresy, które wypisują.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Szukaj Oppstart STOPPET (start nie powiódł się, po nim podany jest powód) lub linii poniżej. Zmień port, jeśli jest zajęty.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Jeśli konsola pisze Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra, własny port nie jest otwarty u Twojego hosta. Użyj adresu przez port gry, z / na końcu.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Otwórz panel z włączonymi Logami debugowania. Jeśli nie pojawiają się linie HTTP GET, żądanie nie dotarło do serwera: zły adres lub port albo zapora.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Za reverse proxy upewnij się, że zezwala na upgrade do WebSocket.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Adresy i porty","dc_denied_1":"Zarządzanie, Użytkownicy: otwórz swojego użytkownika.","dc_denied_2":"Ustaw nazwę FiveM na własny identyfikator, na przykład linię poniżej.","dc_denied_3":"Sprawdź, czy rola użytkownika ma oczekiwane uprawnienia.","dc_denied_4":"Albo użyj grupy ACE: dodaj siebie do group.admin i ustaw unlAdminMenuAceRoles, zobacz temat Dostęp.","dc_denied_5":"/admin otwiera inne menu? Komendę ma inny skrypt. Wybierz nową w Konfiguracji.","dc_denied_6":"Nadaj dostęp personelowi","dc_ratelimit_1":"Dodaj te linie do server.cfg, przed ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Zrestartuj serwer.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Albo otwórz zamiast tego własny port panelu. Te limity go nie dotyczą.","dc_write_1":"Dodaj linie add_filesystem_permission dla swojego frameworka. Raport startowy i strony edytorów pokazują dokładne linie potrzebne Twojemu serwerowi.","dc_write_2":"Wpisz je przed ensure unlimited-reforge, potem zrestartuj serwer.","dc_write_3":"Nadal nie działa? Resource, do którego zapisuje Unlimited, często musi mieć w fxmanifest.lua tego samego autora co Unlimited. Dodaj poniższą linię w obu i zrestartuj.","dc_write_4":"Pokaż linie uprawnień dla każdego frameworka","dc_console_1":"Komunikat konsoli","dc_console_2":"Znaczenie i rozwiązanie","dc_console_3":"Start nie powiódł się; po komunikacie podany jest powód. Panel nie wystartuje.","dc_console_4":"Resource nie może zapisać swoich danych. Sprawdź uprawnienia do plików na hoście.","dc_console_5":"To samo: proces serwera potrzebuje dostępu do zapisu w folderze resource.","dc_console_6":"Port panelu nie jest otwarty u Twojego hosta. Użyj adresu przez port gry.","dc_console_7":"Dodaj linie limitów żądań.","dc_console_8":"Panel stracił połączenie, często przez 429. Dodaj linie limitów żądań.","dc_console_9":"Live View może nie działać między sieciami. Skonfiguruj TURN.","dc_console_10":"Brak połączenia między graczem a oglądającym. Zobacz Live View.","dc_console_11":"Błąd w panelu; linie powyżej pokazują przyczynę.","dc_console_12":"Zmień port przez unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"Framework jeszcze nie wystartował albo ma inną nazwę. Uruchom Unlimited po nim.","dc_console_14":"Token konfiguracji nie działa: zmienia się przy każdym restarcie, użyj tego z ostatniego startu. Utracone hasło konta głównego: usunięcie unlWeb/data.json uruchamia kreator od nowa, ale kasuje też wszystkich użytkowników panelu, role, notatki i waypointy. Najpierw skopiuj plik w bezpieczne miejsce."},"pt":{"dc_install_t":"Instalação e primeiro arranque","dc_install_h":"Pasta, server.cfg, token de configuração, primeiro login","dc_install_s":"Põe a pasta em resources/, adiciona a linha ensure, inicia o servidor e termina o assistente de configuração no navegador. Não há importação SQL nem passo de compilação.","dc_hosting_t":"Host de jogos ou servidor próprio: endereços e portas","dc_hosting_h":"Que endereço usar, firewall, domínio e HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"O painel responde na sua própria porta (3000 por padrão) e também através da porta do jogo. Usa a porta própria quando estiver acessível. Num host de jogos onde só a porta do jogo está aberta, usa o endereço da porta do jogo.","dc_settings_t":"Encontrar uma definição","dc_settings_h":"Convars para o server.cfg e chaves para o config.json","dc_settings_s":"A maioria das definições está no painel, em Gerenciamento, Configuração. Os convars e as chaves do config.json abaixo servem para o que tem de existir antes de o painel estar ativo e para segredos. Um convar tem prioridade sobre a mesma chave no config.json.","dc_backup_t":"Backup, atualização e desinstalação","dc_backup_h":"O que guardar, como atualizar com segurança, como remover","dc_backup_s":"Tudo o que configuras está no config.json e na pasta unlWeb/. Guarda esses dois e podes substituir o resto do recurso a qualquer momento.","dc_access_t":"Dar acesso à equipa (painel e no jogo)","dc_access_h":"Cargos, usuários, FiveM ID, /admin e grupos ACE","dc_access_s":"O painel web e o menu no jogo são dois acessos separados. Cria um cargo, cria o usuário e liga o usuário à sua conta do jogo.","dc_whitelist_t":"Configurar a whitelist e a fila","dc_whitelist_h":"Modos de acesso, cargos do Discord, limite da fila e prioridade","dc_whitelist_s":"A whitelist vem desligada por padrão, por isso instalar nunca deixa ninguém de fora. Liga-a quando estiveres pronto. A fila só importa quando o servidor está cheio.","dc_security_t":"Segurança: o que manter privado","dc_security_h":"Segredos, HTTPS e privilégio mínimo","dc_security_s":"A equipa entra com palavras-passe e o painel pode alterar o teu servidor, por isso trata-o como uma ferramenta de administração.","dc_liveview_t":"Configurar o Live View","dc_liveview_h":"Ecrã e voz, TURN para redes restritas","dc_liveview_s":"O Live View transmite o ecrã de um jogador para o teu navegador com WebRTC, diretamente entre o jogo e o navegador. Muitas vezes funciona sem configuração. Se os jogadores usam redes móveis ou routers restritos, adiciona um servidor TURN. Só FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Pesquisar e ler logs","dc_logs_h":"Tipos de log, o separador Scripts e operadores de pesquisa","dc_logs_s":"A página Logs tem um separador em direto por tipo de log e uma pesquisa que olha para todos. O histórico é guardado 90 dias por padrão (Configuração).","dc_discord_t":"Enviar logs para o Discord","dc_discord_h":"Um webhook por tipo de log","dc_discord_s":"Cada tipo de log pode publicar no seu próprio canal do Discord através de um webhook. O dinheiro tem o seu porque gera muito volume.","dc_items_t":"Fazer os items terem efeitos","dc_items_h":"Vida, fome, efeitos de ecrã, animações, dinheiro","dc_items_s":"Junta efeitos a um item no painel e eles correm quando um jogador o usa. Sem programar. Usa o editor; não escrevas os efeitos à mão.","dc_panelclosed_t":"O painel não abre","dc_panelclosed_h":"Endereço errado, porta fechada, recurso não iniciado","dc_panelclosed_s":"Segue os passos por ordem. Liga primeiro o Registo de depuração (Configuração): assim cada pedido web aparece na consola.","dc_denied_t":"\"Denied: admin access required\" no jogo","dc_denied_h":"O menu no jogo não abre","dc_denied_s":"Por padrão, o menu no jogo não usa permissões ACE. Verifica o nome FiveM (fxname) de um usuário do painel. Se não coincidir com o teu identificador, o menu diz Denied.","dc_ratelimit_t":"Erros 429 ou o Live View continua a cair","dc_ratelimit_h":"Os limites de pedidos do FiveM são demasiado baixos para o painel","dc_ratelimit_s":"Acontece quando o painel é usado através da porta do jogo. O FiveM limita os pedidos por IP e o painel precisa de mais. O relatório de arranque avisa disso.","dc_write_t":"Falha ao guardar: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"Os editores de empregos, gangues, items e veículos precisam de permissão","dc_write_s":"Os artifacts de servidor mais recentes só deixam o Unlimited guardar noutros recursos se o server.cfg o permitir. Os editores precisam disso; o resto do painel funciona sem isso.","dc_console_t":"O que significa uma mensagem da consola","dc_console_h":"Mensagens da consola e o que fazer","dc_console_s":"A consola é silenciosa por padrão: mostra o resumo de arranque, avisos e erros. Tudo o resto (pedidos web, sockets, sessões de Live View) só aparece enquanto Configuração, Registo de depuração estiver ligado. Liga-o enquanto resolves problemas e desliga-o quando funcionar. Tudo é sempre escrito no ficheiro de log.","dc_g_install":"Instalar e alojar","dc_g_access":"Acesso e equipa","dc_g_features":"Funcionalidades","dc_g_problems":"Problemas","dc_nav":"Docs","dc_title":"Documentação","dc_lead":"Guias curtos para usar o Unlimited Reforged. Escolhe o que precisas de fazer ou usa a pesquisa no topo.","dc_ask":"Com o que precisas de ajuda?","dc_back":"Voltar aos temas","dc_more":"Ler o guia completo","dc_gs":"Precisas de mais ajuda num passo?","q12":"Porque é que o jogo diz \"Denied: admin access required\"?","a12":"O menu no jogo verifica o nome FiveM (fxname) do teu usuário do painel. Define-o com o teu próprio identificador ou usa um grupo ACE. Os passos completos estão na documentação.","dc_install_1":"Descompacta o zip e põe a pasta em resources/. O nome da pasta é o nome do recurso e faz parte do endereço do painel.","dc_install_2":"Adiciona ao server.cfg as linhas do teu framework. A ordem importa: oxmysql, framework, inventário e Unlimited no fim.","dc_install_3":"Em artifacts de servidor mais recentes, adiciona também as linhas de permissão de escrita do teu framework antes da linha ensure.","dc_install_4":"Mostrar as linhas de permissão de escrita","dc_install_5":"Inicia o servidor. A consola mostra um token de configuração de uso único e os endereços do painel (linhas que começam por [Unlimited]).","dc_install_6":"Abre o endereço do painel e segue o assistente: idioma, conta mestre (usuário e palavra-passe) e cola o token. Entra.","dc_install_7":"O token muda a cada reinício, por isso usa sempre o mais recente da consola. O Unlimited deteta sozinho o teu framework, inventário e número de slots e mostra uma linha sobre isso, por exemplo [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. As tabelas da base de dados são criadas automaticamente.","dc_install_8":"O endereço do painel não coincide? Vê endereços e portas","dc_hosting_1":"Via","dc_hosting_2":"Endereço","dc_hosting_3":"Porta própria do painel (servidor doméstico, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Porta do jogo (hosts de jogos com só a porta do jogo aberta)","dc_hosting_5":"Pela porta do jogo, mantém a / no fim. Quando o recurso arranca, a consola mostra os endereços exatos.","dc_hosting_6":"Abre a porta do painel (TCP) na tua firewall ou no painel do host. Num host de jogos, pede uma porta extra e define-a no server.cfg.","dc_hosting_7":"Se usas o endereço da porta do jogo, adiciona as linhas de limite de pedidos abaixo. O FiveM limita os pedidos por IP por padrão, o que é pouco para o painel.","dc_hosting_8":"Para um domínio com HTTPS, põe um proxy reverso (nginx, Caddy ou Cloudflare) à frente. O painel em si serve HTTP simples. O proxy tem de reencaminhar Host e X-Forwarded-Proto e permitir upgrades para WebSocket.","dc_hosting_9":"Só se o painel estiver alojado noutro site (unlDisableServe true): indica o endereço desse site em unlPanelAllowedOrigins. Não é preciso quando o painel é aberto a partir deste servidor.","dc_hosting_10":"Erros 429? Vê limites de pedidos","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Padrão","dc_settings_3":"O que faz","dc_settings_4":"Porta própria do painel.","dc_settings_5":"porta do host, senão 30120","dc_settings_6":"Porta do jogo mostrada no relatório de arranque.","dc_settings_7":"Consultar o IP público no arranque.","dc_settings_8":"true = não servir o painel a partir deste recurso (alojamento externo).","dc_settings_9":"vazio","dc_settings_10":"Endereços web extra autorizados a usar a API do painel a partir de outro site, separados por vírgulas.","dc_settings_11":"Comando de chat do menu no jogo. Padrão no RedM: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Comando de denúncia dos jogadores. Não pode ser igual ao comando do menu.","dc_settings_13":"Que cargo do painel um grupo ACE recebe, em JSON.","dc_settings_14":"Motor do Live View: auto, screencapture ou webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (usa set, nunca setr).","dc_settings_16":"Token de API do Cloudflare TURN (usa set, nunca setr).","dc_settings_17":"false = sem aviso de nova versão na consola e no Dashboard.","dc_settings_18":"false = desligar a consola do servidor em direto no menu no jogo.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Evento do teu script de roupa; vazio = deteção automática.","dc_settings_21":"Chave do config.json","dc_settings_22":"depende do inventário","dc_settings_23":"Onde ficam os stashes, porta-bagagens e porta-luvas. Tem de coincidir com o teu inventário, senão os stashes aparecem vazios.","dc_settings_24":"Igual ao convar. Vazio = padrão.","dc_settings_25":"Igual ao convar. Vazio = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"Servidores STUN e TURN para o Live View.","dc_settings_28":"Webhook do Discord por tipo de log. Os outros estão no tema do Discord.","dc_settings_29":"true = sem nenhum log de armas.","dc_settings_30":"true = os logs de armas não vão para o Discord (ficam nos logs).","dc_settings_31":"O config.json tem de ser JSON válido; os comentários // e /* */ são permitidos. Nomes de framework, inventário e slots são detetados pelo que está a correr, e um valor que não encaixe é ignorado com uma linha Warning: na consola. Um config.json antigo pode ficar.","dc_settings_32":"Webhooks do Discord","dc_backup_1":"Caminho","dc_backup_2":"O que contém","dc_backup_3":"Usuários do painel, cargos, definições, notas e waypoints.","dc_backup_4":"Os ficheiros de log: player, game, money, dev, web e scripts.","dc_backup_5":"As tuas definições e webhooks.","dc_backup_6":"Backup","dc_backup_7":"Copia o config.json e a pasta unlWeb/ para um local seguro.","dc_backup_8":"Atualizar","dc_backup_9":"Copia os ficheiros novos por cima da pasta antiga. Não apagues a pasta primeiro e nunca apagues unlWeb/.","dc_backup_10":"Guarda o teu config.json. Compara-o com o novo para ver opções novas.","dc_backup_11":"Reinicia o servidor. Depois verifica os teus cargos: um cargo sem uma permissão nova perde esse botão.","dc_backup_12":"Desinstalar","dc_backup_13":"Remove a linha ensure e as linhas add_filesystem_permission do server.cfg e pára o servidor.","dc_backup_14":"Move a pasta do recurso para outro local. Guarda uma cópia de unlWeb/ se puderes voltar.","dc_backup_15":"As tabelas que o Unlimited criou na base de dados (nomes que começam por unl_) e duas colunas (bans.tokens e players.isWhitelisted) ficam. Não fazem mal; remove-as só se tiveres a certeza.","dc_backup_16":"Apagar unlWeb/data.json volta a iniciar o assistente de configuração e remove todos os usuários do painel, cargos, notas e waypoints.","dc_access_1":"Gerenciamento, Cargos: cria um cargo e marca só as permissões de que essa pessoa precisa.","dc_access_2":"Gerenciamento, Usuários: cria o usuário e atribui o cargo. Um usuário sem cargo não consegue entrar.","dc_access_3":"No mesmo usuário, preenche o nome FiveM (fxname) com o identificador dele, por exemplo o código abaixo. Sem isso, o menu no jogo diz Denied.","dc_access_4":"No jogo, escreve /admin no FiveM ou /unladmin no RedM.","dc_access_5":"A equipa com um grupo ACE (do txAdmin ou add_principal) também recebe o menu no jogo sem ter um usuário do painel próprio. Indica que cargo do painel cada grupo recebe; o cargo com esse nome decide o que podem fazer. Um usuário do painel ligado ao jogador tem sempre prioridade. Usa {} para desligar.","dc_access_6":"O quê","dc_access_7":"Como alterar","dc_access_8":"Comando do menu: /admin no FiveM, /unladmin no RedM","dc_access_9":"Configuração, Menu de administração no jogo, ou set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\" no server.cfg.","dc_access_10":"Comando de denúncia dos jogadores: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Configuração, Comando de relatórios para jogadores, ou set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"Tecla de atalho do menu no RedM (um hash de controlo RDR como 0x3C0A40F2)","dc_access_13":"No mesmo sítio que o comando do menu. O RedM não tem atalhos de teclado para scripts, por isso é opcional.","dc_access_14":"Se outro menu já usa o /admin (por exemplo qbx_adminmenu), a consola avisa no arranque: escolhe outro comando. No ESX, o esx_adminmenu mantém o /adminmenu.","dc_access_15":"Ação","dc_access_16":"Permissão do cargo","dc_access_17":"Avisar, enviar uma mensagem","dc_access_18":"Jogador: aviso","dc_access_19":"Expulsar","dc_access_20":"Jogador: expulsar","dc_access_21":"Banir","dc_access_22":"Jogador: banir","dc_access_23":"Live View, espiar","dc_access_24":"Jogador: ver tela","dc_access_25":"Consola do servidor no menu: ler / executar comandos","dc_access_26":"Configuração: ler / modificar","dc_access_27":"Fila: ver / deixar entrar","dc_access_28":"Lista branca: ler / modificar","dc_access_29":"Está a aparecer Denied? Vê a solução","dc_whitelist_1":"Modo de acesso","dc_whitelist_2":"Sem verificação.","dc_whitelist_3":"Uma licença tem de estar na whitelist da base de dados.","dc_whitelist_4":"Decidido pelos cargos do Discord no teu servidor.","dc_whitelist_5":"Primeiro a whitelist local, depois o Discord. É o padrão.","dc_whitelist_6":"Abre a página Lista branca e liga a aplicação global quando estiveres pronto.","dc_whitelist_7":"Escolhe o modo de acesso em Controlo de acesso. Para cargos do Discord, indica o ID do servidor e o token do bot e dá uma prioridade a cada cargo.","dc_whitelist_8":"Define o limite da fila (Máx. de jogadores). Por padrão é o sv_maxclients, que nunca é ultrapassado. Jogadores que ainda estão a descarregar ou a carregar contam como ligados e nunca perdem o lugar.","dc_whitelist_9":"Usa grupos de slots para reservar lugares, por exemplo para a equipa. A equipa em grupos ACE (group.admin, group.moderator) tem sempre acesso.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: o modo de manutenção também é verificado quando o VORP decide o acesso. RSG-Core: quando o rsg-queue está a correr, é ele a fila, e o menu no jogo mostra a lista dele só para leitura. ESX: quando o esx_whitelist está a correr e a sua whitelist está ligada, decide quem pode entrar e o Unlimited só gere a fila (Configuração, Origem da whitelist).","dc_security_1":"Nunca partilhes o token de configuração, unlWeb/data.json, o token de um bot do Discord, o URL de um webhook, o token de API do Cloudflare TURN nem uma palavra-passe TURN. Remove-os antes de publicar a saída da consola ou o config.json para pedir suporte.","dc_security_2":"Põe o painel atrás de HTTPS com um proxy reverso quando for acessível pela internet.","dc_security_3":"Dá a cada cargo só as permissões de que precisa. Reserva a conta mestre para o dono e verifica os cargos depois de cada atualização.","dc_security_4":"Põe os segredos no server.cfg com set, nunca com setr. O setr envia o valor a todos os jogadores.","dc_security_5":"Diz aos teus jogadores nas regras que a equipa pode ouvir a voz do jogo com o Live View e que o jogador vê um indicador enquanto é observado por um stream de screencapture.","dc_security_6":"O Unlimited é uma ferramenta de monitorização e administração, não um anti-cheat. Não contes com o Live View para apanhar menus de cheats pagos.","dc_liveview_1":"Opção","dc_liveview_2":"Quando usar","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture com o seu stream Cloudflare","dc_liveview_4":"O mais estável e para muitos espectadores. Usado automaticamente quando configurado, com WebRTC como alternativa.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (integrado)","dc_liveview_6":"As ligações diretas falham. A solução mais fácil.","dc_liveview_7":"O teu próprio servidor TURN (por exemplo coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Já tens um ou queres credenciais fixas.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, passo a passo","dc_liveview_10":"No painel do Cloudflare abre Realtime e depois TURN Server.","dc_liveview_11":"Cria uma chave TURN. Copia o Turn Token ID e o API Token.","dc_liveview_12":"Põe-nos no server.cfg com set.","dc_liveview_13":"Reinicia. Com o Registo de depuração ligado, a consola mostra a linha abaixo.","dc_liveview_14":"O teu próprio servidor TURN vai no config.json. Mantém a linha STUN.","dc_liveview_15":"Stream screencapture: configura o seu worker em direto e depois adiciona as linhas abaixo. O recurso screencapture tem de arrancar antes do Unlimited. Limites: 720p, 30 fps, sem áudio do jogo, um novo stream a cada 30 minutos. Para nunca o usar, define unlLiveScreenEngine como webrtc.","dc_liveview_16":"Mensagem","dc_liveview_17":"Solução","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"Adiciona TURN (acima).","dc_liveview_20":"Turn Token ID errado.","dc_liveview_21":"Token de API errado.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"Instala o screencapture.","dc_liveview_24":"O stream cai uma e outra vez","dc_liveview_25":"Verifica as linhas de limite de pedidos se usas o endereço da porta do jogo.","dc_liveview_26":"Voz: o Live View também reproduz a voz de proximidade do jogador no teu próprio jogo. Precisas de estar no jogo com o teu nome FiveM definido no teu usuário do painel, a permissão de cargo Ouvir a voz, e pma-voice ou mumble-voip. No jogo: /admin, jogador, Live View; para parar usa /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Limites de pedidos","dc_logs_1":"Log","dc_logs_2":"Contém","dc_logs_3":"Player","dc_logs_4":"Ações em personagens, entradas, saídas, expulsões, banimentos, acertos de armas.","dc_logs_5":"Game","dc_logs_6":"Mortes, revives e o que outros recursos enviam.","dc_logs_7":"Dinheiro","dc_logs_8":"Cada alteração de dinheiro com conta, valor e motivo.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Alterações a items, empregos, gangues e veículos.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"Auditoria do painel: logins com IP, quem alterou o quê.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Linhas de arranque, do sistema e de erro.","dc_logs_15":"Scripts","dc_logs_16":"Linhas que outros scripts enviam. Scripts novos aparecem sozinhos.","dc_logs_17":"Pesquisa","dc_logs_18":"Encontra","dc_logs_19":"Tudo sobre um jogador, por id ou identificador.","dc_logs_20":"O mesmo, pelo nome da personagem.","dc_logs_21":"Só um tipo de log. Usa vírgula para vários: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Linhas de um script.","dc_logs_23":"Só linhas info, warn ou error.","dc_logs_24":"Linhas que contêm este texto.","dc_logs_25":"Podes combinar operadores. Texto simples que corresponde a um jogador mostra tudo sobre esse jogador; caso contrário, procura o texto.","dc_logs_26":"Os autores de scripts enviam logs para o Unlimited com uma só chamada do lado do servidor. O separador Scripts filtra por script, nível, categoria, jogador e texto, e precisa da permissão de cargo logs:script.","dc_logs_27":"Limites: 20 linhas por segundo por script. O ficheiro de log de scripts roda aos 10 MB e guarda 3 ficheiros antigos.","dc_discord_1":"No Discord: definições do canal, Integrações, Webhooks, Novo Webhook. Copia o URL do webhook.","dc_discord_2":"Põe-no no config.json sob a chave desse tipo de log, ou no server.cfg com set.","dc_discord_3":"Reinicia o recurso. As mensagens chegam como embeds com cores.","dc_discord_4":"Chave / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (auditoria do painel)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (geral)","dc_discord_7":"O URL de um webhook é uma palavra-passe: quem o tiver pode publicar no teu canal. Os logs de armas podem ser desligados (disableWeaponLogs) ou deixados fora só do Discord (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). A fila tem o seu próprio webhook opcional nas definições da fila. Os cargos do Discord para a whitelist são configurados na página Lista branca.","dc_discord_8":"Whitelist e fila","dc_items_1":"Abre Dev, depois Items, e abre o item.","dc_items_2":"Adiciona efeitos: vida e colete, fome e sede, efeitos de ecrã, animações, sons, items e dinheiro. Cada efeito pode ter um atraso e uma duração em milissegundos (15 segundos são 15000).","dc_items_3":"Guarda. No FiveM com ox_inventory, os efeitos são guardados no item como unlEffects nos teus items do ox_inventory, o que precisa da permissão de escrita.","dc_items_4":"Usa o item no jogo para testar.","dc_items_5":"Falha ao guardar? Vê a permissão de escrita","dc_items_6":"RedM com VORP: abre o item e usa a secção Consumível. Os efeitos são guardados na tabela unl_item_effects e registados no vorp_inventory logo. Um item novinho ainda precisa de reiniciar o vorp_inventory.","dc_items_7":"Os items listados em Config.ItemsToUse do vorp_metabolism ficam a cargo do vorp_metabolism, para nada correr duas vezes.","dc_items_8":"Se outro script já regista o item como utilizável, não lhe dês efeitos aqui. O vorp_inventory mantém um só handler por item.","dc_items_9":"Os multiplicadores de corrida e natação são limitados a 1.49 pelo jogo. Para um movimento claramente mais rápido usa o override de move rate.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Procura as linhas que começam por [Unlimited] na consola do servidor e abre exatamente os endereços que mostram.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Procura Oppstart STOPPET (o arranque falhou, o motivo segue) ou a linha abaixo. Muda a porta se estiver ocupada.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Se a consola diz Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra, a porta própria não está aberta no teu host. Usa o endereço da porta do jogo, com a / no fim.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Abre o painel com o Registo de depuração ligado. Se não aparecerem linhas HTTP GET, o pedido nunca chegou ao servidor: endereço ou porta errados, ou uma firewall.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Atrás de um proxy reverso, garante que ele permite upgrades para WebSocket.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Endereços e portas","dc_denied_1":"Gerenciamento, Usuários: abre o teu usuário.","dc_denied_2":"Define o nome FiveM com o teu próprio identificador, por exemplo a linha abaixo.","dc_denied_3":"Verifica se o cargo do usuário tem as permissões que esperas.","dc_denied_4":"Ou usa um grupo ACE: adiciona-te a group.admin e define unlAdminMenuAceRoles, vê o tema Acesso.","dc_denied_5":"O /admin abre outro menu? Outro script usa o comando. Escolhe um novo em Configuração.","dc_denied_6":"Dar acesso à equipa","dc_ratelimit_1":"Adiciona estas linhas ao server.cfg, antes de ensure unlimited-reforge.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Reinicia o servidor.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Ou abre antes a porta própria do painel. Não é afetada por estes limites.","dc_write_1":"Adiciona as linhas add_filesystem_permission do teu framework. O relatório de arranque e as páginas dos editores mostram as linhas exatas de que o teu servidor precisa.","dc_write_2":"Põe-nas antes de ensure unlimited-reforge e reinicia o servidor.","dc_write_3":"Ainda falha? O recurso onde o Unlimited escreve muitas vezes tem de ter o mesmo autor no fxmanifest.lua que o Unlimited. Adiciona a linha abaixo nos dois e reinicia.","dc_write_4":"Mostrar as linhas de permissão de todos os frameworks","dc_console_1":"Mensagem da consola","dc_console_2":"Significado e solução","dc_console_3":"O arranque falhou; o motivo segue. O painel não vai arrancar.","dc_console_4":"O recurso não consegue guardar os seus dados. Verifica as permissões de ficheiros no host.","dc_console_5":"O mesmo: o processo do servidor precisa de acesso de escrita à pasta do recurso.","dc_console_6":"A porta do painel não está aberta no teu host. Usa o endereço da porta do jogo.","dc_console_7":"Adiciona as linhas de limite de pedidos.","dc_console_8":"O painel perdeu a ligação, muitas vezes por um 429. Adiciona as linhas de limite de pedidos.","dc_console_9":"O Live View pode falhar entre redes. Configura o TURN.","dc_console_10":"Sem ligação entre o jogador e o espectador. Vê Live View.","dc_console_11":"Erro no painel; as linhas acima mostram a causa.","dc_console_12":"Muda a porta com unlWebPort.","dc_console_13":"O framework ainda não arrancou ou tem outro nome. Inicia o Unlimited depois dele.","dc_console_14":"O token de configuração não funciona: muda a cada reinício, usa o do último arranque. Perdeste a palavra-passe mestre? Apagar unlWeb/data.json volta a iniciar o assistente, mas também remove todos os usuários do painel, cargos, notas e waypoints. Copia primeiro o ficheiro para um local seguro."},"tr":{"dc_install_t":"Kurulum ve ilk başlatma","dc_install_h":"Klasör, server.cfg, kurulum tokenı, ilk giriş","dc_install_s":"Klasörü resources/ içine koy, ensure satırını ekle, sunucuyu başlat ve kurulum sihirbazını tarayıcında bitir. SQL içe aktarma ve derleme adımı yok.","dc_hosting_t":"Oyun hosting veya kendi sunucun: adresler ve portlar","dc_hosting_h":"Hangi adres kullanılır, güvenlik duvarı, alan adı ve HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"Panel kendi portunda (varsayılan 3000) ve oyun portu üzerinden yanıt verir. Kendi porta erişilebiliyorsa onu kullan. Yalnızca oyun portunun açık olduğu bir oyun hostunda oyun portu adresini kullan.","dc_settings_t":"Bir ayarı bul","dc_settings_h":"server.cfg için convar'lar ve config.json için anahtarlar","dc_settings_s":"Ayarların çoğu panelde, Yönetim altında Yapılandırma sayfasındadır. Aşağıdaki convar'lar ve config.json anahtarları, panel açılmadan önce var olması gereken şeyler ve gizli bilgiler içindir. Bir convar, config.json içindeki aynı anahtarın üzerine yazar.","dc_backup_t":"Yedekleme, güncelleme ve kaldırma","dc_backup_h":"Neyi saklamalı, güvenli güncelleme, nasıl kaldırılır","dc_backup_s":"Kurduğun her şey config.json ve unlWeb/ klasöründe durur. Bu ikisini sakla, resource'un geri kalanını istediğin zaman değiştirebilirsin.","dc_access_t":"Yetkililere erişim ver (panel ve oyun içi)","dc_access_h":"Roller, kullanıcılar, FiveM ID, /admin ve ACE grupları","dc_access_s":"Web paneli ve oyun içi menü iki ayrı erişimdir. Bir rol oluştur, kullanıcıyı oluştur, sonra kullanıcıyı oyun hesabına bağla.","dc_whitelist_t":"Whitelist ve sırayı kur","dc_whitelist_h":"Erişim modları, Discord rolleri, sıra sınırı ve öncelik","dc_whitelist_s":"Whitelist varsayılan olarak kapalıdır, yani kurulum kimseyi dışarıda bırakmaz. Hazır olduğunda aç. Sıra yalnızca sunucu doluyken önemlidir.","dc_security_t":"Güvenlik: neleri gizli tutmalı","dc_security_h":"Gizli bilgiler, HTTPS ve en az yetki","dc_security_s":"Yetkililer parolayla giriş yapar ve panel sunucunu değiştirebilir. Bu yüzden onu bir yönetici aracı gibi koru.","dc_liveview_t":"Live View kurulumu","dc_liveview_h":"Ekran ve ses, kısıtlı ağlar için TURN","dc_liveview_s":"Live View, bir oyuncunun ekranını WebRTC ile tarayıcına aktarır; bağlantı doğrudan oyun ile tarayıcı arasında kurulur. Çoğu zaman kurulum gerektirmez. Oyuncular mobil ağlarda veya kısıtlı router'lardaysa bir TURN sunucusu ekle. Yalnızca FiveM.","dc_logs_t":"Logları ara ve oku","dc_logs_h":"Log türleri, Scripts sekmesi ve arama operatörleri","dc_logs_s":"Loglar sayfasında her log türü için canlı bir sekme ve hepsinde birden arayan bir arama vardır. Geçmiş varsayılan olarak 90 gün saklanır (Yapılandırma).","dc_discord_t":"Logları Discord'a gönder","dc_discord_h":"Her log türü için bir webhook","dc_discord_s":"Her log türü, bir webhook ile kendi Discord kanalına yazabilir. Para logunun kendi kanalı vardır, çünkü çok yoğundur.","dc_items_t":"Eşyalara işlev kazandır (efektler)","dc_items_h":"Sağlık, açlık, ekran efektleri, animasyonlar, para","dc_items_s":"Panelde bir eşyaya efekt ekle, oyuncu kullandığında çalışsın. Kod yazmak gerekmez. Editörü kullan; efektleri elle yazma.","dc_panelclosed_t":"Panel açılmıyor","dc_panelclosed_h":"Yanlış adres, kapalı port, resource başlamamış","dc_panelclosed_s":"Adımları sırayla izle. Önce Hata Ayıklama Günlüğü'nü aç (Yapılandırma): böylece her web isteği konsolda görünür.","dc_denied_t":"Oyunda \"Denied: admin access required\"","dc_denied_h":"Oyun içi menü açılmıyor","dc_denied_s":"Oyun içi menü varsayılan olarak ACE izinlerini kullanmaz. Panel kullanıcısındaki FiveM adını (fxname) kontrol eder. Bu, senin identifier'ınla eşleşmezse menü Denied der.","dc_ratelimit_t":"429 hataları veya Live View sürekli kopuyor","dc_ratelimit_h":"FiveM istek sınırları panel için çok düşük","dc_ratelimit_s":"Bu, panel oyun portu üzerinden kullanıldığında olur. FiveM istekleri IP başına sınırlar ve panelin daha fazlasına ihtiyacı vardır. Başlangıç raporu bunu uyarır.","dc_write_t":"Kaydetme başarısız: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"Meslek, çete, eşya ve araç editörleri izin ister","dc_write_s":"Yeni sunucu artifact'ları, Unlimited'ın başka resource'lara kaydetmesine yalnızca server.cfg izin verirse izin verir. Editörler buna ihtiyaç duyar; panelin geri kalanı onsuz çalışır.","dc_console_t":"Bir konsol mesajı ne anlama gelir","dc_console_h":"Konsol mesajları ve ne yapmalı","dc_console_s":"Konsol varsayılan olarak sessizdir: başlangıç özetini, uyarıları ve hataları gösterir. Geri kalan her şey (web istekleri, soketler, Live View oturumları) yalnızca Yapılandırma'da Hata Ayıklama Günlüğü açıkken görünür. Sorun giderirken aç, çalışınca tekrar kapat. Her şey her zaman log dosyasına yazılır.","dc_g_install":"Kurulum ve host","dc_g_access":"Erişim ve yetkililer","dc_g_features":"Özellikler","dc_g_problems":"Sorunlar","dc_nav":"Dökümantasyon","dc_title":"Dökümantasyon","dc_lead":"Unlimited Reforged'ı çalıştırmak için kısa rehberler. Ne yapman gerektiğini seç ya da üstteki aramayı kullan.","dc_ask":"Neyle ilgili yardıma ihtiyacın var?","dc_back":"Konulara dön","dc_more":"Tam rehberi oku","dc_gs":"Bir adımda daha fazla yardım mı lazım?","q12":"Oyun neden \"Denied: admin access required\" diyor?","a12":"Oyun içi menü, panel kullanıcındaki FiveM adını (fxname) kontrol eder. Onu kendi identifier'ına ayarla ya da bir ACE grubu kullan. Tüm adımlar dökümantasyonda.","dc_install_1":"Zip'i aç ve klasörü resources/ içine koy. Klasör adı resource adıdır ve panel adresinin bir parçasıdır.","dc_install_2":"Framework'ünün satırlarını server.cfg'ye ekle. Sıra önemlidir: oxmysql, framework, inventory, en sonda Unlimited.","dc_install_3":"Yeni sunucu artifact'larında ensure satırından önce framework'ün için yazma izni satırlarını da ekle.","dc_install_4":"Yazma izni satırlarını göster","dc_install_5":"Sunucuyu başlat. Konsol, tek seferlik bir kurulum tokenı ve panel adreslerini yazdırır ([Unlimited] ile başlayan satırlar).","dc_install_6":"Panel adresini aç ve sihirbazı izle: dil, ana hesap (kullanıcı adı ve parola), sonra tokenı yapıştır. Giriş yap.","dc_install_7":"Token her yeniden başlatmada değişir, bu yüzden her zaman konsoldaki en yenisini kullan. Unlimited framework'ünü, inventory'ni ve slot sayını kendisi bulur ve bununla ilgili tek satır yazdırır, örneğin [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. Veritabanındaki tablolar otomatik oluşturulur.","dc_install_8":"Panel adresi uyuşmuyor mu? Adresler ve portlar bölümüne bak","dc_hosting_1":"Yol","dc_hosting_2":"Adres","dc_hosting_3":"Kendi panel portu (ev sunucusu, VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"Oyun portu (yalnızca oyun portu açık olan oyun hostları)","dc_hosting_5":"Oyun portu üzerinden giderken sondaki / işaretini koru. Resource başlayınca konsol tam adresleri yazdırır.","dc_hosting_6":"Panel portunu (TCP) güvenlik duvarında veya host panelinde aç. Bir oyun hostunda ek port iste ve server.cfg'de ayarla.","dc_hosting_7":"Oyun portu adresini kullanıyorsan aşağıdaki istek sınırı satırlarını ekle. FiveM varsayılan olarak istekleri IP başına sınırlar, bu panel için çok düşüktür.","dc_hosting_8":"HTTPS'li bir alan adı için önüne bir reverse proxy koy (nginx, Caddy veya Cloudflare). Panelin kendisi düz HTTP sunar. Proxy, Host ve X-Forwarded-Proto başlıklarını iletmeli ve WebSocket yükseltmelerine izin vermeli.","dc_hosting_9":"Yalnızca panel başka bir sitede barındırılıyorsa (unlDisableServe true): o sitenin adresini unlPanelAllowedOrigins içine yaz. Panel bu sunucudan açılıyorsa gerekmez.","dc_hosting_10":"429 hatası mı alıyorsun? İstek sınırlarına bak","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"Varsayılan","dc_settings_3":"Ne yapar","dc_settings_4":"Kendi panel portu.","dc_settings_5":"host portu, yoksa 30120","dc_settings_6":"Başlangıç raporunda gösterilen oyun portu.","dc_settings_7":"Başlangıçta genel IP'yi sorgula.","dc_settings_8":"true = paneli bu resource'tan sunma (harici hosting).","dc_settings_9":"boş","dc_settings_10":"Panel API'sini başka bir siteden kullanabilen ek web adresleri, virgülle ayrılmış.","dc_settings_11":"Oyun içi menü için sohbet komutu. RedM varsayılanı: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"Oyuncuların rapor komutu. Menü komutuyla aynı olamaz.","dc_settings_13":"Bir ACE grubunun hangi panel rolünü alacağı, JSON olarak.","dc_settings_14":"Live View motoru: auto, screencapture veya webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (set kullan, asla setr değil).","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API tokenı (set kullan, asla setr değil).","dc_settings_17":"false = konsolda ve Dashboard'da yeni sürüm bildirimi yok.","dc_settings_18":"false = oyun içi menüdeki canlı sunucu konsolunu kapat.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"Kıyafet script'inin event'i; boş = otomatik bul.","dc_settings_21":"config.json anahtarı","dc_settings_22":"inventory'ye bağlı","dc_settings_23":"Depoların, bagajların ve torpido gözlerinin durduğu yer. Inventory'nle eşleşmeli, yoksa depolar boş görünür.","dc_settings_24":"Convar ile aynı. Boş = varsayılan.","dc_settings_25":"Convar ile aynı. Boş = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"Live View için STUN ve TURN sunucuları.","dc_settings_28":"Log türü başına Discord webhook. Diğerleri Discord konusunda listelenir.","dc_settings_29":"true = hiç silah logu tutma.","dc_settings_30":"true = silah logları yalnızca Discord'a gitmez.","dc_settings_31":"config.json geçerli bir JSON olmalı; // ve /* */ yorumlarına izin verilir. Framework adları, inventory ve slotlar çalışan sisteme göre bulunur ve uymayan bir değer konsolda Warning: satırıyla yok sayılır. Eski bir config.json kalabilir.","dc_settings_32":"Discord webhook'ları","dc_backup_1":"Yol","dc_backup_2":"İçinde ne var","dc_backup_3":"Panel kullanıcıları, roller, ayarlar, notlar ve waypoint'ler.","dc_backup_4":"Log dosyaları: player, game, money, dev, web ve scripts.","dc_backup_5":"Kendi ayarların ve webhook'ların.","dc_backup_6":"Yedekle","dc_backup_7":"config.json dosyasını ve unlWeb/ klasörünü güvenli bir yere kopyala.","dc_backup_8":"Güncelle","dc_backup_9":"Yeni dosyaları eski klasörün üzerine kopyala. Önce klasörü silme ve unlWeb/ klasörünü asla silme.","dc_backup_10":"Kendi config.json dosyanı sakla. Yeni seçenekler için yeni olanla karşılaştır.","dc_backup_11":"Sunucuyu yeniden başlat. Sonra rollerini kontrol et: yeni bir izni olmayan rol o butonu kaybeder.","dc_backup_12":"Kaldır","dc_backup_13":"server.cfg'den ensure satırını ve add_filesystem_permission satırlarını sil ve sunucuyu durdur.","dc_backup_14":"Resource klasörünü başka yere taşı. Geri dönme ihtimalin varsa unlWeb/ kopyasını sakla.","dc_backup_15":"Unlimited'ın veritabanında oluşturduğu tablolar (adları unl_ ile başlar) ve iki sütun (bans.tokens ve players.isWhitelisted) kalır. Zararları yoktur; yalnızca emin olduğunda sil.","dc_backup_16":"unlWeb/data.json dosyasını silmek kurulum sihirbazını yeniden başlatır ve tüm panel kullanıcılarını, rolleri, notları ve waypoint'leri siler.","dc_access_1":"Yönetim, Roller: bir rol oluştur ve yalnızca o kişinin ihtiyaç duyduğu izinleri işaretle.","dc_access_2":"Yönetim, Kullanıcılar: kullanıcıyı oluştur ve rolü ata. Rolü olmayan kullanıcı giriş yapamaz.","dc_access_3":"Aynı kullanıcıda FiveM adı (fxname) alanına kişinin identifier'ını yaz, örneğin aşağıdaki kod. Bunsuz oyun içi menü Denied der.","dc_access_4":"Oyunda FiveM'de /admin, RedM'de /unladmin yaz.","dc_access_5":"ACE grubu olan yetkililer (txAdmin veya add_principal ile) kendi panel kullanıcıları olmadan da oyun içi menüyü alır. Her grubun hangi panel rolünü alacağını belirt; o adı taşıyan rol, neler yapabileceklerini belirler. Oyuncuya bağlı bir panel kullanıcısı her zaman önce gelir. Kapatmak için {} kullan.","dc_access_6":"Ne","dc_access_7":"Nasıl değiştirilir","dc_access_8":"Menü komutu: FiveM'de /admin, RedM'de /unladmin","dc_access_9":"Yapılandırma, Oyun içi yönetici menüsü ya da server.cfg'de set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_10":"Oyuncuların rapor komutu: /ureport","dc_access_11":"Yapılandırma, Oyuncu rapor komutu ya da set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"Menü için RedM kısayol tuşu (0x3C0A40F2 gibi bir RDR kontrol hash'i)","dc_access_13":"Menü komutuyla aynı yer. RedM'de script'ler için tuş atama yoktur, bu yüzden isteğe bağlıdır.","dc_access_14":"Başka bir menü /admin komutunu zaten kullanıyorsa (örneğin qbx_adminmenu), konsol başlangıçta bunu söyler: başka bir komut seç. ESX'te esx_adminmenu /adminmenu komutunu korur.","dc_access_15":"İşlem","dc_access_16":"Rol izni","dc_access_17":"Uyar, mesaj gönder","dc_access_18":"Oyuncu: Uyar","dc_access_19":"At","dc_access_20":"Oyuncu: Sunucudan At","dc_access_21":"Yasakla","dc_access_22":"Oyuncu: Yasakla","dc_access_23":"Live View, izleme","dc_access_24":"Oyuncu: Ekranı görüntüle","dc_access_25":"Menüdeki sunucu konsolu: oku / komut çalıştır","dc_access_26":"Yapılandırma: oku / değiştir","dc_access_27":"Sıra: görüntüle / içeri al","dc_access_28":"Whitelist: oku / değiştir","dc_access_29":"Denied mı alıyorsun? Çözüme bak","dc_whitelist_1":"Erişim modu","dc_whitelist_2":"Kontrol yok.","dc_whitelist_3":"Bir lisans veritabanında whitelist'te olmalı.","dc_whitelist_4":"Discord sunucundaki rollere göre belirlenir.","dc_whitelist_5":"Önce yerel whitelist, sonra Discord. Varsayılan budur.","dc_whitelist_6":"Whitelist sayfasını aç ve hazır olduğunda genel zorlamayı aç.","dc_whitelist_7":"Erişim Kontrolü altında erişim modunu seç. Discord rolleri için sunucu (guild) ID'sini ve bot tokenını gir, sonra her role bir öncelik ver.","dc_whitelist_8":"Sıra sınırını (Maks. oyuncu) ayarla. Varsayılanı sv_maxclients'tır ve asla aşılmaz. Hâlâ indiren veya yüklenen oyuncular bağlı sayılır ve yerlerini asla kaybetmez.","dc_whitelist_9":"Slot gruplarıyla yer ayırabilirsin, örneğin yetkililer için. ACE gruplarındaki yetkililer (group.admin, group.moderator) her zaman erişim alır.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: VORP erişime karar verirken bakım modu da kontrol edilir. RSG-Core: rsg-queue çalışıyorsa sıra odur ve oyun içi menü onun listesini salt okunur gösterir. ESX: esx_whitelist çalışıyor ve whitelist'i açıksa kimin girebileceğine o karar verir ve Unlimited yalnızca sırayı yürütür (Yapılandırma, Beyaz liste kaynağı).","dc_security_1":"Kurulum tokenını, unlWeb/data.json dosyasını, Discord bot tokenını, webhook URL'sini, Cloudflare TURN API tokenını veya TURN parolasını asla paylaşma. Destek için konsol çıktısı veya config.json paylaşmadan önce bunları sil.","dc_security_2":"İnternetten erişilebiliyorsa paneli reverse proxy ile HTTPS arkasına koy.","dc_security_3":"Her role yalnızca ihtiyaç duyduğu izinleri ver. Ana hesabı sahibe ayır ve her güncellemeden sonra rolleri kontrol et.","dc_security_4":"Gizli bilgileri server.cfg'ye set ile yaz, asla setr ile değil. setr değeri her oyuncuya gönderir.","dc_security_5":"Kurallarda oyunculara, yetkililerin Live View ile oyun içi sesi dinleyebileceğini ve screencapture yayını ile izlenen oyuncunun bir gösterge gördüğünü belirt.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited bir izleme ve yönetim aracıdır, hile koruması değildir. Ücretli hile menülerini yakalamak için Live View'e güvenme.","dc_liveview_1":"Seçenek","dc_liveview_2":"Ne zaman kullanılır","dc_liveview_3":"Cloudflare yayınlı screencapture","dc_liveview_4":"En kararlı seçenek ve çok sayıda izleyici için. Kurulduğunda otomatik kullanılır, yedek olarak WebRTC vardır.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (yerleşik)","dc_liveview_6":"Doğrudan bağlantılar başarısız oluyor. En kolay çözüm.","dc_liveview_7":"Kendi TURN sunucun (örneğin coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"Zaten birini çalıştırıyorsun ya da sabit kimlik bilgileri istiyorsun.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, adım adım","dc_liveview_10":"Cloudflare panelinde Realtime, sonra TURN Server'ı aç.","dc_liveview_11":"Bir TURN anahtarı oluştur. Turn Token ID ve API Token'ı kopyala.","dc_liveview_12":"Bunları server.cfg'ye set ile yaz.","dc_liveview_13":"Yeniden başlat. Hata Ayıklama Günlüğü açıkken konsol aşağıdaki satırı gösterir.","dc_liveview_14":"Kendi TURN sunucun config.json'a yazılır. STUN satırını koru.","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture yayını: canlı worker'ını kur, sonra aşağıdaki satırları ekle. screencapture resource'u Unlimited'dan önce başlamalı. Sınırlar: 720p, 30 fps, oyun sesi yok, her 30 dakikada yeni yayın. Hiç kullanmamak için unlLiveScreenEngine değerini webrtc yap.","dc_liveview_16":"Mesaj","dc_liveview_17":"Çözüm","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"TURN ekle (yukarıda).","dc_liveview_20":"Turn Token ID yanlış.","dc_liveview_21":"API tokenı yanlış.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"screencapture'ı kur.","dc_liveview_24":"Yayın tekrar tekrar kopuyor","dc_liveview_25":"Oyun portu adresini kullanıyorsan istek sınırı satırlarını kontrol et.","dc_liveview_26":"Ses: Live View, oyuncunun yakın ses kanalını da kendi oyununda çalar. Oyunda olman, panel kullanıcında FiveM adının ayarlı olması, Sesi dinle rol izninin olması ve pma-voice veya mumble-voip bulunması gerekir. Oyunda: /admin, oyuncu, Live View; durdurmak için /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"İstek sınırları","dc_logs_1":"Log","dc_logs_2":"İçeriği","dc_logs_3":"Oyuncu","dc_logs_4":"Karakter işlemleri, girişler, çıkışlar, atmalar, yasaklar, silah vuruşları.","dc_logs_5":"Oyun","dc_logs_6":"Ölümler, canlandırmalar ve diğer resource'ların gönderdikleri.","dc_logs_7":"Para","dc_logs_8":"Hesap, miktar ve nedenle birlikte her para değişikliği.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"Eşya, meslek, çete ve araç değişiklikleri.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"Panel denetim kaydı: IP ile girişler, kimin neyi değiştirdiği.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"Başlangıç, sistem ve hata satırları.","dc_logs_15":"Scriptler","dc_logs_16":"Diğer script'lerin gönderdiği satırlar. Yeni script'ler kendiliğinden görünür.","dc_logs_17":"Ara","dc_logs_18":"Bulur","dc_logs_19":"Bir oyuncu hakkındaki her şey, id veya identifier ile.","dc_logs_20":"Aynısı, karakter adıyla.","dc_logs_21":"Yalnızca bir log türü. Birden fazlası için virgül kullan: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"Tek bir script'in satırları.","dc_logs_23":"Yalnızca info, warn veya error satırları.","dc_logs_24":"Bu metni içeren satırlar.","dc_logs_25":"Operatörleri birleştirebilirsin. Bir oyuncuyla eşleşen düz metin, o oyuncu hakkındaki her şeyi gösterir; aksi halde metni arar.","dc_logs_26":"Script sahipleri Unlimited'a tek bir sunucu tarafı çağrıyla log gönderir. Scriptler sekmesi script, seviye, kategori, oyuncu ve metne göre filtreler ve logs:script rol iznini gerektirir.","dc_logs_27":"Sınırlar: script başına saniyede 20 satır. Script log dosyası 10 MB'ta döner ve 3 eski dosya tutar.","dc_discord_1":"Discord'da: kanal ayarları, Entegrasyonlar, Webhook'lar, Yeni Webhook. Webhook URL'sini kopyala.","dc_discord_2":"Bunu config.json içinde o log türünün anahtarına ya da server.cfg'ye set ile yaz.","dc_discord_3":"Resource'u yeniden başlat. Mesajlar renk kodlu embed olarak gelir.","dc_discord_4":"Anahtar / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (panel denetimi)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (genel)","dc_discord_7":"Webhook URL'si bir paroladır: onu bilen herkes kanalına mesaj yazabilir. Silah logları kapatılabilir (disableWeaponLogs) veya yalnızca Discord dışında tutulabilir (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). Sıranın sıra ayarlarında kendi isteğe bağlı webhook'u vardır. Whitelist için Discord rolleri Whitelist sayfasında ayarlanır.","dc_discord_8":"Whitelist ve sıra","dc_items_1":"Dev, sonra Eşyalar'ı aç ve eşyayı aç.","dc_items_2":"Efekt ekle: can ve zırh, açlık ve susuzluk, ekran efektleri, animasyonlar, sesler, eşyalar ve para. Her efektin milisaniye cinsinden bir gecikmesi ve süresi olabilir (15 saniye 15000'dir).","dc_items_3":"Kaydet. ox_inventory ile FiveM'de efektler, ox_inventory eşyalarında eşyanın üzerine unlEffects olarak kaydedilir ve bunun için yazma izni gerekir.","dc_items_4":"Denemek için eşyayı oyunda kullan.","dc_items_5":"Kaydetme başarısız mı? Yazma iznine bak","dc_items_6":"VORP'lu RedM: eşyayı aç ve Consumable bölümünü kullan. Efektler unl_item_effects tablosuna kaydedilir ve hemen vorp_inventory'ye kaydedilir. Yepyeni bir eşya için yine de vorp_inventory'nin yeniden başlatılması gerekir.","dc_items_7":"vorp_metabolism Config.ItemsToUse içindeki eşyalar vorp_metabolism'e bırakılır, böylece hiçbir şey iki kez çalışmaz.","dc_items_8":"Başka bir script eşyayı zaten kullanılabilir olarak kaydediyorsa buradan efekt verme. vorp_inventory her eşya için tek bir handler tutar.","dc_items_9":"Sprint ve yüzme çarpanları oyun tarafından 1.49 ile sınırlanır. Gözle görülür hızlı hareket için hareket hızı geçersiz kılmayı kullan.","dc_panelclosed_1":"Sunucu konsolunda [Unlimited] ile başlayan satırları bul ve yazdırdıkları adresleri aynen aç.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Oppstart STOPPET satırına bak (başlangıç başarısız, sebep arkasından gelir) ya da aşağıdaki satıra. Port doluysa değiştir.","dc_panelclosed_3":"Konsol Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra diyorsa, kendi port host'unda açık değildir. Sonunda / olan oyun portu adresini kullan.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Paneli Hata Ayıklama Günlüğü açıkken aç. Hiç HTTP GET satırı çıkmıyorsa istek sunucuya ulaşmamıştır: yanlış adres veya port ya da güvenlik duvarı.","dc_panelclosed_5":"Reverse proxy arkasındaysan WebSocket yükseltmelerine izin verdiğinden emin ol.","dc_panelclosed_6":"Adresler ve portlar","dc_denied_1":"Yönetim, Kullanıcılar: kendi kullanıcını aç.","dc_denied_2":"FiveM adını kendi identifier'ına ayarla, örneğin aşağıdaki satır.","dc_denied_3":"Kullanıcının rolünün beklediğin izinlere sahip olduğunu kontrol et.","dc_denied_4":"Ya da bir ACE grubu kullan: kendini group.admin grubuna ekle ve unlAdminMenuAceRoles ayarla, Erişim konusuna bak.","dc_denied_5":"/admin başka bir menü mü açıyor? Komut başka bir script'te. Yapılandırma'dan yeni bir tane seç.","dc_denied_6":"Yetkililere erişim ver","dc_ratelimit_1":"Bu satırları server.cfg'ye, ensure unlimited-reforge satırından önce ekle.","dc_ratelimit_2":"Sunucuyu yeniden başlat.","dc_ratelimit_3":"Ya da bunun yerine kendi panel portunu aç. Bu sınırlardan etkilenmez.","dc_write_1":"Framework'ün için add_filesystem_permission satırlarını ekle. Başlangıç raporu ve editör sayfaları sunucunun ihtiyaç duyduğu satırları aynen gösterir.","dc_write_2":"Bunları ensure unlimited-reforge satırından önce yaz, sonra sunucuyu yeniden başlat.","dc_write_3":"Hâlâ başarısız mı? Unlimited'ın yazdığı resource'un fxmanifest.lua dosyasında genellikle Unlimited ile aynı author olmalıdır. Aşağıdaki satırı ikisine de ekle ve yeniden başlat.","dc_write_4":"Her framework için izin satırlarını göster","dc_console_1":"Konsol mesajı","dc_console_2":"Anlamı ve çözüm","dc_console_3":"Başlangıç başarısız; sebep arkasından gelir. Panel başlamaz.","dc_console_4":"Resource verisini kaydedemiyor. Host'taki dosya izinlerini kontrol et.","dc_console_5":"Aynısı: sunucu işleminin resource klasörüne yazma erişimi olmalı.","dc_console_6":"Panel portu host'unda açık değil. Oyun portu adresini kullan.","dc_console_7":"İstek sınırı satırlarını ekle.","dc_console_8":"Panel bağlantısını kaybetti, çoğu zaman 429 yüzünden. İstek sınırı satırlarını ekle.","dc_console_9":"Live View ağlar arasında başarısız olabilir. TURN kur.","dc_console_10":"Oyuncu ile izleyici arasında bağlantı yok. Live View bölümüne bak.","dc_console_11":"Panelde hata; yukarıdaki satırlar sebebi gösterir.","dc_console_12":"Portu unlWebPort ile değiştir.","dc_console_13":"Framework henüz başlamadı ya da adı farklı. Unlimited'ı ondan sonra başlat.","dc_console_14":"Kurulum tokenı çalışmıyor: her yeniden başlatmada değişir, son başlatmadakini kullan. Ana hesap parolası kayboldu: unlWeb/data.json dosyasını silmek sihirbazı yeniden başlatır ama tüm panel kullanıcılarını, rolleri, notları ve waypoint'leri de siler. Önce dosyayı güvenli bir yere kopyala."},"cn":{"dc_install_t":"安装与首次启动","dc_install_h":"文件夹、server.cfg、设置令牌、首次登录","dc_install_s":"把文件夹放进 resources/，添加 ensure 行，启动服务器，然后在浏览器中完成设置向导。无需导入 SQL，也无需构建。","dc_hosting_t":"游戏主机或自有服务器：地址与端口","dc_hosting_h":"该用哪个地址、防火墙、域名和 HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"面板有自己的端口（默认 3000），也可以通过游戏端口访问。自有端口可访问时优先使用它。如果游戏主机只开放了游戏端口，就使用游戏端口地址。","dc_settings_t":"查找设置","dc_settings_h":"server.cfg 的 convar 和 config.json 的键","dc_settings_s":"大多数设置在面板的 管理，配置 中。下面的 convar 和 config.json 键用于面板启动前就必须存在的内容，以及密钥。convar 会覆盖 config.json 中的同名键。","dc_backup_t":"备份、更新和卸载","dc_backup_h":"要保留什么、如何安全更新、如何移除","dc_backup_s":"你设置的所有内容都在 config.json 和 unlWeb/ 文件夹中。保留这两项，就可以随时替换资源的其余部分。","dc_access_t":"授予员工权限（面板和游戏内）","dc_access_h":"角色、用户、FiveM ID、/admin 和 ACE 组","dc_access_s":"网页面板和游戏内菜单是两种独立的权限。先创建角色，再创建用户，然后把用户关联到其游戏账号。","dc_whitelist_t":"设置白名单和队列","dc_whitelist_h":"访问模式、Discord 角色、队列上限和优先级","dc_whitelist_s":"白名单默认关闭，所以安装不会把任何人挡在门外。准备好后再开启。队列只在服务器满员时才起作用。","dc_security_t":"安全：哪些内容要保密","dc_security_h":"密钥、HTTPS 和最小权限","dc_security_s":"员工用密码登录，而且面板可以修改你的服务器，所以请把它当作管理工具对待。","dc_liveview_t":"设置Live View","dc_liveview_h":"画面和语音，严格网络下使用 TURN","dc_liveview_s":"Live View通过 WebRTC 把玩家的屏幕传到你的浏览器，在游戏和浏览器之间直连。通常无需设置即可使用。如果玩家使用移动网络或限制严格的路由器，请添加 TURN 服务器。仅支持 FiveM。","dc_logs_t":"搜索和查看日志","dc_logs_h":"日志类型、脚本标签页和搜索运算符","dc_logs_s":"日志页面为每种日志类型提供一个实时标签页，还有一个跨所有类型的搜索。历史记录默认保留 90 天（配置）。","dc_discord_t":"把日志发送到 Discord","dc_discord_h":"每种日志类型一个 webhook","dc_discord_s":"每种日志类型都可以通过 webhook 发到各自的 Discord 频道。Money 单独使用一个，因为数量很大。","dc_items_t":"让物品产生效果","dc_items_h":"生命、饥饿、屏幕效果、动画、金钱","dc_items_s":"在面板中给物品添加效果，玩家使用物品时就会触发。无需编写脚本。请使用编辑器，不要手写效果。","dc_panelclosed_t":"面板打不开","dc_panelclosed_h":"地址错误、端口未开放、资源未启动","dc_panelclosed_s":"请按顺序逐步检查。先开启调试日志（配置）：这样每个网页请求都会显示在控制台中。","dc_denied_t":"游戏内显示 \"Denied: admin access required\"","dc_denied_h":"游戏内菜单打不开","dc_denied_s":"游戏内菜单默认不使用 ACE 权限。它会检查面板用户上的 FiveM 名称（fxname）。如果与你的标识符不一致，菜单就会显示 Denied。","dc_ratelimit_t":"出现 429 错误，或Live View不断掉线","dc_ratelimit_h":"FiveM 的请求限制对面板来说太低","dc_ratelimit_s":"通过游戏端口使用面板时会出现这种情况。FiveM 按 IP 限制请求数，而面板需要更多。启动报告会对此发出警告。","dc_write_t":"保存失败：\"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"职业、帮派、物品和载具编辑器需要权限","dc_write_s":"较新的服务器 artifact 只有在 server.cfg 允许时，才让 Unlimited 写入其他资源。编辑器需要这个权限；面板的其余部分不需要。","dc_console_t":"控制台消息是什么意思","dc_console_h":"控制台消息及处理方法","dc_console_s":"控制台默认保持安静：只显示启动摘要、警告和错误。其他内容（网页请求、socket、Live View会话）只有在 配置，调试日志 开启时才会显示。排查问题时开启，恢复正常后再关闭。所有内容始终会写入日志文件。","dc_g_install":"安装与托管","dc_g_access":"访问与员工","dc_g_features":"功能","dc_g_problems":"问题","dc_nav":"文档","dc_title":"文档","dc_lead":"运行 Unlimited Reforged 的简短指南。选择你要做的事，或使用顶部的搜索。","dc_ask":"你需要什么帮助？","dc_back":"返回主题","dc_more":"阅读完整指南","dc_gs":"某一步需要更多帮助？","q12":"为什么游戏显示 \"Denied: admin access required\"？","a12":"游戏内菜单会检查你的面板用户上的 FiveM 名称（fxname）。把它设为你自己的标识符，或者使用 ACE 组。完整步骤见文档。","dc_install_1":"解压 zip，把文件夹放进 resources/。文件夹名就是资源名，也是面板地址的一部分。","dc_install_2":"把你所用框架的行添加到 server.cfg。顺序很重要：先 oxmysql，再框架，再库存，最后是 Unlimited。","dc_install_3":"在较新的服务器 artifact 上，还要在 ensure 行之前添加你所用框架的写入权限行。","dc_install_4":"显示写入权限行","dc_install_5":"启动服务器。控制台会打印一次性设置令牌和面板地址（以 [Unlimited] 开头的行）。","dc_install_6":"打开面板地址并按向导操作：语言、主账号（用户名和密码），然后粘贴令牌。登录。","dc_install_7":"令牌每次重启都会变化，所以请始终使用控制台中最新的那个。Unlimited 会自动检测你的框架、库存和槽位数，并打印一行信息，例如 [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50。数据库中的表会自动创建。","dc_install_8":"面板地址对不上？请看地址与端口","dc_hosting_1":"途径","dc_hosting_2":"地址","dc_hosting_3":"自有面板端口（家用服务器、VPS、Windows）","dc_hosting_4":"游戏端口（只开放了游戏端口的游戏主机）","dc_hosting_5":"通过游戏端口访问时，请保留末尾的 /。资源启动时，控制台会打印确切的地址。","dc_hosting_6":"在防火墙或主机面板中开放面板端口（TCP）。在游戏主机上，请申请一个额外端口，并在 server.cfg 中设置。","dc_hosting_7":"如果你使用游戏端口地址，请添加下面的速率限制行。FiveM 默认按 IP 限制请求数，这对面板来说太低。","dc_hosting_8":"如需使用带 HTTPS 的域名，请在前面放一个反向代理（nginx、Caddy 或 Cloudflare）。面板本身只提供普通 HTTP。代理必须转发 Host 和 X-Forwarded-Proto，并允许 WebSocket 升级。","dc_hosting_9":"仅当面板托管在其他网站时（unlDisableServe true）：把该网站地址列入 unlPanelAllowedOrigins。从本服务器打开面板时不需要。","dc_hosting_10":"遇到 429 错误？请看速率限制","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"默认值","dc_settings_3":"作用","dc_settings_4":"自有面板端口。","dc_settings_5":"主机端口，否则 30120","dc_settings_6":"启动报告中显示的游戏端口。","dc_settings_7":"启动时查询公网 IP。","dc_settings_8":"true = 不从此资源提供面板（外部托管）。","dc_settings_9":"空","dc_settings_10":"允许从其他网站使用面板 API 的额外网址，用逗号分隔。","dc_settings_11":"游戏内菜单的聊天命令。RedM 默认：unladmin。","dc_settings_12":"玩家的举报命令。不能与菜单命令相同。","dc_settings_13":"ACE 组对应的面板角色，使用 JSON。","dc_settings_14":"Live View引擎：auto、screencapture 或 webrtc。","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID（使用 set，不要用 setr）。","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API 令牌（使用 set，不要用 setr）。","dc_settings_17":"false = 控制台和仪表板中不显示新版本通知。","dc_settings_18":"false = 关闭游戏内菜单中的实时服务器控制台。","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"你的服装脚本的事件；空 = 自动检测。","dc_settings_21":"config.json 键","dc_settings_22":"取决于库存","dc_settings_23":"储物箱、后备箱和手套箱所在的位置。必须与你的库存一致，否则储物箱会显示为空。","dc_settings_24":"与 convar 相同。空 = 默认。","dc_settings_25":"与 convar 相同。空 = /ureport。","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"Live View使用的 STUN 和 TURN 服务器。","dc_settings_28":"每种日志类型一个 Discord webhook。其余的列在 Discord 主题中。","dc_settings_29":"true = 完全不记录武器日志。","dc_settings_30":"true = 武器日志只是不发到 Discord。","dc_settings_31":"config.json 必须是有效的 JSON；允许使用 // 和 /* */ 注释。框架名称、库存和槽位会根据运行中的内容自动检测，不合适的值会被忽略，并在控制台显示 Warning: 行。旧的 config.json 可以继续使用。","dc_settings_32":"Discord webhook","dc_backup_1":"路径","dc_backup_2":"内容","dc_backup_3":"面板用户、角色、设置、备注和路径点。","dc_backup_4":"日志文件：player、game、money、dev、web 和 scripts。","dc_backup_5":"你自己的设置和 webhook。","dc_backup_6":"备份","dc_backup_7":"把 config.json 和 unlWeb/ 文件夹复制到安全的地方。","dc_backup_8":"更新","dc_backup_9":"把新文件复制到旧文件夹上覆盖。不要先删除文件夹，也绝不要删除 unlWeb/。","dc_backup_10":"保留你自己的 config.json。把它与新版本对比，查看有没有新选项。","dc_backup_11":"重启服务器。之后检查你的角色：缺少新权限的角色会失去对应的按钮。","dc_backup_12":"卸载","dc_backup_13":"从 server.cfg 中删除 ensure 行和 add_filesystem_permission 行，然后停止服务器。","dc_backup_14":"把资源文件夹移走。如果以后可能回来，请保留一份 unlWeb/ 的副本。","dc_backup_15":"Unlimited 在数据库中创建的表（名称以 unl_ 开头）和两个列（bans.tokens 与 players.isWhitelisted）会保留。它们无害；只有在确定时才删除。","dc_backup_16":"删除 unlWeb/data.json 会重新启动设置向导，并删除所有面板用户、角色、备注和路径点。","dc_access_1":"管理，角色：创建一个角色，只勾选该人需要的权限。","dc_access_2":"管理，用户：创建用户并分配角色。没有角色的用户无法登录。","dc_access_3":"在同一个用户上，用其标识符填写 FiveM 名称（fxname），例如下面的代码。没有它，游戏内菜单会显示 Denied。","dc_access_4":"在游戏中，FiveM 输入 /admin，RedM 输入 /unladmin。","dc_access_5":"属于 ACE 组的员工（来自 txAdmin 或 add_principal）即使没有自己的面板用户，也能使用游戏内菜单。请指定每个组对应的面板角色；同名角色决定他们能做什么。与玩家关联的面板用户始终优先。使用 {} 可关闭此功能。","dc_access_6":"项目","dc_access_7":"如何更改","dc_access_8":"菜单命令：FiveM 为 /admin，RedM 为 /unladmin","dc_access_9":"配置，游戏内管理菜单，或在 server.cfg 中使用 set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\"。","dc_access_10":"玩家举报命令：/ureport","dc_access_11":"配置，玩家举报命令，或使用 set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\"。","dc_access_12":"RedM 的菜单热键（RDR 控制哈希，例如 0x3C0A40F2）","dc_access_13":"与菜单命令在同一位置。RedM 没有脚本用的按键绑定，所以这是可选的。","dc_access_14":"如果别的菜单已经占用了 /admin（例如 qbx_adminmenu），控制台会在启动时提示：请换一个命令。在 ESX 上，esx_adminmenu 保留 /adminmenu。","dc_access_15":"操作","dc_access_16":"角色权限","dc_access_17":"警告、发送消息","dc_access_18":"玩家：警告","dc_access_19":"踢出","dc_access_20":"玩家：踢出","dc_access_21":"封禁","dc_access_22":"玩家：封禁","dc_access_23":"Live View、观战","dc_access_24":"玩家：查看屏幕","dc_access_25":"菜单中的服务器控制台：读取 / 运行命令","dc_access_26":"配置：读取 / 修改","dc_access_27":"队列：查看 / 放行","dc_access_28":"白名单：读取 / 修改","dc_access_29":"出现 Denied？请看解决方法","dc_whitelist_1":"访问模式","dc_whitelist_2":"不检查。","dc_whitelist_3":"许可证必须在数据库中列入白名单。","dc_whitelist_4":"由你的服务器（guild）上的 Discord 角色决定。","dc_whitelist_5":"先查本地白名单，再查 Discord。这是默认值。","dc_whitelist_6":"打开白名单页面，准备好后开启全局强制。","dc_whitelist_7":"在访问控制下选择访问模式。使用 Discord 角色时，输入 guild ID 和机器人令牌，然后给每个角色设置优先级。","dc_whitelist_8":"设置队列上限（最大玩家数）。默认为 sv_maxclients，绝不会超出。仍在下载或加载的玩家算作已连接，不会失去席位。","dc_whitelist_9":"使用槽位组来预留席位，例如留给员工。属于 ACE 组（group.admin、group.moderator）的员工始终可以进入。","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP：VORP 决定访问权限时也会检查维护模式。RSG-Core：rsg-queue 运行时，它就是队列，游戏内菜单只读显示它的列表。ESX：esx_whitelist 运行且其白名单开启时，由它决定谁可以加入，Unlimited 只运行队列（配置，白名单来源）。","dc_security_1":"绝不要分享设置令牌、unlWeb/data.json、Discord 机器人令牌、webhook URL、Cloudflare TURN API 令牌或 TURN 密码。寻求支持前，先把它们从控制台输出或 config.json 中删掉。","dc_security_2":"如果面板可从互联网访问，请用反向代理为它加上 HTTPS。","dc_security_3":"每个角色只授予所需的权限。主账号只留给所有者，并在每次更新后检查角色。","dc_security_4":"把密钥放在 server.cfg 中，用 set，绝不要用 setr。setr 会把值发送给每个玩家。","dc_security_5":"请在规则中告知玩家：员工可以通过Live View监听游戏内语音，玩家被 screencapture 流观看时会看到提示标志。","dc_security_6":"Unlimited 是监控和管理工具，不是反作弊。不要指望用Live View抓出付费作弊菜单。","dc_liveview_1":"选项","dc_liveview_2":"何时使用","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture 搭配其 Cloudflare 流","dc_liveview_4":"最稳定，支持多名观看者。设置好后自动使用，WebRTC 作为备用。","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN（内置）","dc_liveview_6":"直连失败时使用。最简单的解决办法。","dc_liveview_7":"你自己的 TURN 服务器（例如 coturn）","dc_liveview_8":"你已经在运行一个，或者想要固定的凭据。","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN，分步说明","dc_liveview_10":"在 Cloudflare 控制台中打开 Realtime，然后选 TURN Server。","dc_liveview_11":"创建一个 TURN 密钥。复制 Turn Token ID 和 API Token。","dc_liveview_12":"用 set 把它们写入 server.cfg。","dc_liveview_13":"重启。开启调试日志后，控制台会显示下面这一行。","dc_liveview_14":"你自己的 TURN 服务器写在 config.json 中。保留 STUN 那一行。","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture 流：先设置它的 live worker，再添加下面的行。资源 screencapture 必须在 Unlimited 之前启动。限制：720p、30 fps、无游戏音频、每 30 分钟新建一个流。若要完全不使用它，请把 unlLiveScreenEngine 设为 webrtc。","dc_liveview_16":"消息","dc_liveview_17":"解决方法","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"添加 TURN（见上文）。","dc_liveview_20":"Turn Token ID 错误。","dc_liveview_21":"API 令牌错误。","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"安装 screencapture。","dc_liveview_24":"流不断掉线","dc_liveview_25":"如果你使用游戏端口地址，请检查速率限制行。","dc_liveview_26":"语音：Live View还会在你自己的游戏中播放玩家的近距离语音。你需要在游戏中，面板用户上设置了你的 FiveM 名称，角色拥有监听语音权限，并且安装了 pma-voice 或 mumble-voip。在游戏中：/admin，玩家，Live View；用 /unlstopview 停止。","dc_liveview_27":"速率限制","dc_logs_1":"日志","dc_logs_2":"内容","dc_logs_3":"Player","dc_logs_4":"角色上的操作、加入、离开、踢出、封禁、武器命中。","dc_logs_5":"Game","dc_logs_6":"死亡、复活，以及其他资源发送的内容。","dc_logs_7":"Money","dc_logs_8":"每一次金钱变动，包括账户、金额和原因。","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"物品、职业、帮派和载具的更改。","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"面板审计记录：带 IP 的登录，谁改了什么。","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"启动、系统和错误行。","dc_logs_15":"脚本","dc_logs_16":"其他脚本发送进来的行。新脚本会自动出现。","dc_logs_17":"搜索","dc_logs_18":"查找","dc_logs_19":"某个玩家的全部信息，按 ID 或标识符。","dc_logs_20":"同上，按角色名称。","dc_logs_21":"只看一种日志类型。多个用逗号分隔：type:player,game。","dc_logs_22":"来自某个脚本的行。","dc_logs_23":"只看 info、warn 或 error 行。","dc_logs_24":"包含此文本的行。","dc_logs_25":"运算符可以组合使用。匹配某个玩家的纯文本会显示该玩家的全部信息；否则按文本搜索。","dc_logs_26":"脚本作者用一次服务端调用就能把日志写入 Unlimited。脚本标签页可按脚本、级别、分类、玩家和文本筛选，需要角色权限 logs:script。","dc_logs_27":"限制：每个脚本每秒 20 行。脚本日志文件达到 10 MB 时轮转，并保留 3 个旧文件。","dc_discord_1":"在 Discord 中：频道设置，集成，Webhooks，新建 Webhook。复制 webhook URL。","dc_discord_2":"把它放在 config.json 中该日志类型对应的键下，或在 server.cfg 中用 set 设置。","dc_discord_3":"重启资源。消息会以彩色嵌入的形式发送。","dc_discord_4":"键 / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web（面板审计）","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited（通用）","dc_discord_7":"webhook URL 相当于密码：任何拿到它的人都能在你的频道发消息。武器日志可以关闭（disableWeaponLogs），或只是不发到 Discord（excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord）。队列在队列设置中有自己的可选 webhook。白名单的 Discord 角色在白名单页面设置。","dc_discord_8":"白名单和队列","dc_items_1":"打开 Dev，然后打开 物品，再打开该物品。","dc_items_2":"添加效果：生命和护甲、饥饿和口渴、屏幕效果、动画、声音、物品和金钱。每个效果都可以设置延迟和持续时间，单位为毫秒（15 秒是 15000）。","dc_items_3":"保存。在使用 ox_inventory 的 FiveM 上，效果会以 unlEffects 的形式保存在你的 ox_inventory 物品中，这需要写入权限。","dc_items_4":"在游戏中使用该物品进行测试。","dc_items_5":"保存失败？请看写入权限","dc_items_6":"使用 VORP 的 RedM：打开物品并使用 Consumable 部分。效果保存在表 unl_item_effects 中，并立即注册到 vorp_inventory。全新的物品仍需重启 vorp_inventory。","dc_items_7":"列在 vorp_metabolism 的 Config.ItemsToUse 中的物品交给 vorp_metabolism 处理，所以不会重复执行。","dc_items_8":"如果其他脚本已经把该物品注册为可使用，就不要在这里给它加效果。vorp_inventory 每个物品只保留一个处理程序。","dc_items_9":"冲刺和游泳倍率被游戏限制在 1.49。要获得明显更快的移动速度，请使用移动速率覆盖。","dc_panelclosed_1":"在服务器控制台中找到以 [Unlimited] 开头的行，并严格打开它们打印出的地址。","dc_panelclosed_2":"查找 Oppstart STOPPET（启动失败，后面会说明原因）或下面这一行。如果端口被占用，请更换端口。","dc_panelclosed_3":"如果控制台显示 Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra，说明自有端口在你的主机上没有开放。请使用游戏端口地址，并保留末尾的 /。","dc_panelclosed_4":"开启调试日志后打开面板。如果没有出现 HTTP GET 行，说明请求根本没到达服务器：地址或端口错误，或被防火墙拦截。","dc_panelclosed_5":"如果使用反向代理，请确保它允许 WebSocket 升级。","dc_panelclosed_6":"地址与端口","dc_denied_1":"管理，用户：打开你的用户。","dc_denied_2":"把 FiveM 名称设为你自己的标识符，例如下面这一行。","dc_denied_3":"检查该用户的角色是否拥有你期望的权限。","dc_denied_4":"或者使用 ACE 组：把自己加入 group.admin，并设置 unlAdminMenuAceRoles，见访问主题。","dc_denied_5":"/admin 打开的是另一个菜单？说明别的脚本占用了这个命令。请在配置中另选一个。","dc_denied_6":"授予员工权限","dc_ratelimit_1":"把这些行添加到 server.cfg，放在 ensure unlimited-reforge 之前。","dc_ratelimit_2":"重启服务器。","dc_ratelimit_3":"或者改用自有面板端口。它不受这些限制影响。","dc_write_1":"添加你所用框架的 add_filesystem_permission 行。启动报告和编辑器页面会显示你的服务器需要的确切行。","dc_write_2":"把它们放在 ensure unlimited-reforge 之前，然后重启服务器。","dc_write_3":"仍然失败？Unlimited 要写入的资源，其 fxmanifest.lua 中的作者往往必须与 Unlimited 相同。在两边都添加下面这一行，然后重启。","dc_write_4":"显示所有框架的权限行","dc_console_1":"控制台消息","dc_console_2":"含义与解决方法","dc_console_3":"启动失败；后面会说明原因。面板不会启动。","dc_console_4":"资源无法保存其数据。请检查主机上的文件权限。","dc_console_5":"同上：服务器进程需要对资源文件夹有写入权限。","dc_console_6":"面板端口在你的主机上没有开放。请使用游戏端口地址。","dc_console_7":"添加速率限制行。","dc_console_8":"面板断开了连接，通常是 429。添加速率限制行。","dc_console_9":"Live View在不同网络之间可能失败。请设置 TURN。","dc_console_10":"玩家与观看者之间没有连接。请看Live View。","dc_console_11":"面板出错；上面的行显示了原因。","dc_console_12":"用 unlWebPort 更改端口。","dc_console_13":"框架尚未启动或名称不同。请在它之后再启动 Unlimited。","dc_console_14":"设置令牌无效：它每次重启都会变化，请使用最近一次启动时的令牌。忘记了主账号密码：删除 unlWeb/data.json 会重新启动向导，但也会删除所有面板用户、角色、备注和路径点。请先把该文件复制到安全的地方。"},"ta":{"dc_install_t":"நிறுவுதலும் முதல் தொடக்கமும்","dc_install_h":"கோப்புறை, server.cfg, அமைவு டோக்கன், முதல் உள்நுழைவு","dc_install_s":"கோப்புறையை resources/ இல் வைக்கவும், ensure வரியைச் சேர்க்கவும், சர்வரைத் தொடங்கவும், பிறகு உலாவியில் அமைவு வழிகாட்டியை முடிக்கவும். SQL இறக்குமதியோ build படியோ தேவையில்லை.","dc_hosting_t":"கேம் ஹோஸ்ட் அல்லது சொந்த சர்வர்: முகவரிகளும் போர்ட்களும்","dc_hosting_h":"எந்த முகவரியைப் பயன்படுத்துவது, ஃபயர்வால், டொமைன் மற்றும் HTTPS","dc_hosting_s":"பேனல் தனது சொந்த போர்ட்டிலும் (இயல்பாக 3000) கேம் போர்ட் வழியாகவும் பதிலளிக்கும். சொந்த போர்ட்டை அணுக முடிந்தால் அதைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். கேம் போர்ட் மட்டும் திறந்திருக்கும் கேம் ஹோஸ்டில், கேம் போர்ட் முகவரியைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","dc_settings_t":"ஓர் அமைப்பைக் கண்டுபிடி","dc_settings_h":"server.cfg க்கான convar களும் config.json க்கான keys களும்","dc_settings_s":"பெரும்பாலான அமைப்புகள் பேனலில் Management, பிறகு கட்டமைப்பு என்பதில் உள்ளன. கீழே உள்ள convar களும் config.json keys களும் பேனல் இயங்கும் முன்பே இருக்க வேண்டியவற்றுக்கும், ரகசியங்களுக்கும் ஆனவை. ஒரு convar, config.json இல் உள்ள அதே key ஐ மேலெழுதும்.","dc_backup_t":"காப்புப்பிரதி, புதுப்பித்தல் மற்றும் நீக்குதல்","dc_backup_h":"எதை வைத்திருப்பது, பாதுகாப்பாகப் புதுப்பிப்பது எப்படி, நீக்குவது எப்படி","dc_backup_s":"நீங்கள் அமைத்த அனைத்தும் config.json மற்றும் unlWeb/ கோப்புறையில் உள்ளன. அந்த இரண்டையும் வைத்திருந்தால், resource இன் மற்ற பகுதியை எப்போது வேண்டுமானாலும் மாற்றலாம்.","dc_access_t":"பணியாளர்களுக்கு அணுகல் வழங்கு (பேனலும் விளையாட்டிலும்)","dc_access_h":"பாத்திரங்கள், பயனர்கள், FiveM ID, /admin மற்றும் ACE குழுக்கள்","dc_access_s":"வெப் பேனலும் விளையாட்டு மெனுவும் இரண்டு தனித்தனி அணுகல்கள். ஒரு பாத்திரத்தை உருவாக்கவும், பயனரை உருவாக்கவும், பிறகு பயனரை அவர்களின் கேம் கணக்குடன் இணைக்கவும்.","dc_whitelist_t":"அனுமதி பட்டியலையும் வரிசையையும் அமை","dc_whitelist_h":"அணுகல் முறைகள், Discord பாத்திரங்கள், வரிசை வரம்பு மற்றும் முன்னுரிமை","dc_whitelist_s":"அனுமதி பட்டியல் இயல்பாக அணைந்திருக்கும், அதனால் நிறுவுவது யாரையும் வெளியே பூட்டாது. தயாரானதும் இயக்கவும். சர்வர் நிரம்பியிருக்கும்போது மட்டுமே வரிசை தேவைப்படும்.","dc_security_t":"பாதுகாப்பு: எவற்றை ரகசியமாக வைக்க வேண்டும்","dc_security_h":"ரகசியங்கள், HTTPS மற்றும் குறைந்தபட்ச அனுமதி","dc_security_s":"பணியாளர்கள் கடவுச்சொல்லால் உள்நுழைகிறார்கள், பேனல் உங்கள் சர்வரை மாற்ற முடியும். எனவே இதை ஒரு நிர்வாகக் கருவியாகக் கருதுங்கள்.","dc_liveview_t":"Live View ஐ அமை","dc_liveview_h":"திரையும் குரலும், கடுமையான நெட்வொர்க்குகளுக்கு TURN","dc_liveview_s":"Live View, WebRTC மூலம் ஒரு வீரரின் திரையை உங்கள் உலாவிக்கு ஒளிபரப்புகிறது; கேமுக்கும் உலாவிக்கும் இடையே நேரடியாக. இது பெரும்பாலும் அமைப்பு இல்லாமலேயே வேலை செய்யும். வீரர்கள் மொபைல் நெட்வொர்க்கிலோ கடுமையான ரூட்டரிலோ இருந்தால், TURN சர்வரைச் சேர்க்கவும். FiveM மட்டும்.","dc_logs_t":"பதிவுகளைத் தேடு, படி","dc_logs_h":"பதிவு வகைகள், ஸ்கிரிப்ட்கள் தாவல் மற்றும் தேடல் செயற்குறிகள்","dc_logs_s":"பதிவுகள் பக்கத்தில் ஒவ்வொரு பதிவு வகைக்கும் ஒரு நேரலை தாவலும், அனைத்திலும் தேடும் ஒரு தேடலும் உள்ளன. வரலாறு இயல்பாக 90 நாட்கள் வைக்கப்படும் (கட்டமைப்பு).","dc_discord_t":"பதிவுகளை Discord க்கு அனுப்பு","dc_discord_h":"ஒவ்வொரு பதிவு வகைக்கும் ஒரு webhook","dc_discord_s":"ஒவ்வொரு பதிவு வகையும் webhook வழியாகத் தனது சொந்த Discord சேனலுக்கு அனுப்ப முடியும். Money க்கு தனி webhook உண்டு, ஏனெனில் அதன் அளவு அதிகம்.","dc_items_t":"பொருட்களைச் செயல்பட வை (விளைவுகள்)","dc_items_h":"ஆரோக்கியம், பசி, திரை விளைவுகள், அனிமேஷன்கள், பணம்","dc_items_s":"பேனலில் ஒரு பொருளுக்கு விளைவுகளைச் சேர்த்தால், வீரர் அதைப் பயன்படுத்தும்போது அவை இயங்கும். ஸ்கிரிப்டிங் தேவையில்லை. எடிட்டரைப் பயன்படுத்துங்கள்; விளைவுகளைக் கையால் எழுத வேண்டாம்.","dc_panelclosed_t":"பேனல் திறக்கவில்லை","dc_panelclosed_h":"தவறான முகவரி, மூடிய போர்ட், resource தொடங்கவில்லை","dc_panelclosed_s":"படிகளை வரிசையாகச் செய்யுங்கள். முதலில் பிழைத்திருத்த பதிவை (Debug logging) இயக்கவும் (கட்டமைப்பு): அப்போது ஒவ்வொரு வெப் கோரிக்கையும் கன்சோலில் தெரியும்.","dc_denied_t":"விளையாட்டில் \"Denied: admin access required\"","dc_denied_h":"விளையாட்டு மெனு திறக்கவில்லை","dc_denied_s":"விளையாட்டு மெனு இயல்பாக ACE அனுமதிகளைப் பயன்படுத்தாது. இது பேனல் பயனரின் FiveM பெயரை (fxname) சரிபார்க்கும். அது உங்கள் identifier உடன் பொருந்தவில்லை என்றால், மெனு Denied எனக் காட்டும்.","dc_ratelimit_t":"429 பிழைகள் அல்லது Live View தொடர்ந்து துண்டிக்கிறது","dc_ratelimit_h":"பேனலுக்கு FiveM இன் கோரிக்கை வரம்புகள் மிகக் குறைவு","dc_ratelimit_s":"பேனலை கேம் போர்ட் வழியாகப் பயன்படுத்தும்போது இது நடக்கும். FiveM ஒவ்வொரு IP க்கும் கோரிக்கைகளை வரம்பிடுகிறது, பேனலுக்கு அதிகம் தேவை. தொடக்க அறிக்கை இதைப் பற்றி எச்சரிக்கும்.","dc_write_t":"சேமிப்பு தோல்வி: \"write not allowed\"","dc_write_h":"வேலை, கும்பல், பொருள் மற்றும் வாகன எடிட்டர்களுக்கு அனுமதி தேவை","dc_write_s":"புதிய சர்வர் artifacts, server.cfg அனுமதித்தால் மட்டுமே Unlimited ஐ மற்ற resource களில் சேமிக்க விடும். எடிட்டர்களுக்கு இது தேவை; பேனலின் மற்ற பகுதிகள் இல்லாமலும் வேலை செய்யும்.","dc_console_t":"ஒரு கன்சோல் செய்தியின் அர்த்தம்","dc_console_h":"கன்சோல் செய்திகளும் என்ன செய்வதும்","dc_console_s":"கன்சோல் இயல்பாக அமைதியாக இருக்கும்: தொடக்கச் சுருக்கம், எச்சரிக்கைகள் மற்றும் பிழைகளை மட்டும் காட்டும். மற்றவை (வெப் கோரிக்கைகள், sockets, Live View அமர்வுகள்) கட்டமைப்பில் Debug logging இயக்கத்தில் இருக்கும்போது மட்டுமே தெரியும். சிக்கல் தீர்க்கும்போது இயக்கவும், வேலை செய்ததும் அணைக்கவும். எல்லாமே எப்போதும் பதிவுக் கோப்பில் எழுதப்படும்.","dc_g_install":"நிறுவலும் ஹோஸ்டிங்கும்","dc_g_access":"அணுகலும் பணியாளர்களும்","dc_g_features":"அம்சங்கள்","dc_g_problems":"சிக்கல்கள்","dc_nav":"ஆவணங்கள்","dc_title":"ஆவணங்கள்","dc_lead":"Unlimited Reforged ஐ இயக்குவதற்கான சிறு வழிகாட்டிகள். நீங்கள் செய்ய வேண்டியதைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும் அல்லது மேலே உள்ள தேடலைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","dc_ask":"உங்களுக்கு என்ன உதவி வேண்டும்?","dc_back":"தலைப்புகளுக்குத் திரும்பு","dc_more":"முழு வழிகாட்டியைப் படிக்கவும்","dc_gs":"ஒரு படியில் மேலும் உதவி வேண்டுமா?","q12":"விளையாட்டு ஏன் \"Denied: admin access required\" என்று சொல்கிறது?","a12":"விளையாட்டு மெனு உங்கள் பேனல் பயனரின் FiveM பெயரை (fxname) சரிபார்க்கிறது. அதை உங்கள் சொந்த identifier ஆக அமைக்கவும், அல்லது ACE குழுவைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். முழுப் படிகள் ஆவணங்களில் உள்ளன.","dc_install_1":"zip ஐ பிரித்து, கோப்புறையை resources/ இல் வைக்கவும். கோப்புறையின் பெயர்தான் resource பெயர்; அது பேனல் முகவரியின் ஒரு பகுதியும் ஆகும்.","dc_install_2":"உங்கள் framework க்கான வரிகளை server.cfg இல் சேர்க்கவும். வரிசை முக்கியம்: oxmysql, framework, inventory, கடைசியாக Unlimited.","dc_install_3":"புதிய சர்வர் artifacts இல், ensure வரிக்கு முன் உங்கள் framework க்கான எழுது-அனுமதி வரிகளையும் சேர்க்கவும்.","dc_install_4":"எழுது-அனுமதி வரிகளைக் காட்டு","dc_install_5":"சர்வரைத் தொடங்கவும். கன்சோல் ஒருமுறை பயன்படும் அமைவு டோக்கனையும் பேனல் முகவரிகளையும் (வரிசையின் தொடக்கம் [Unlimited]) அச்சிடும்.","dc_install_6":"பேனல் முகவரியைத் திறந்து வழிகாட்டியைப் பின்பற்றவும்: மொழி, மாஸ்டர் கணக்கு (பயனர்பெயர் மற்றும் கடவுச்சொல்), பிறகு டோக்கனை ஒட்டவும். உள்நுழையவும்.","dc_install_7":"டோக்கன் ஒவ்வொரு மறுதொடக்கத்திலும் மாறும், எனவே எப்போதும் கன்சோலில் உள்ள புதிய டோக்கனைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். Unlimited உங்கள் framework, inventory மற்றும் slot எண்ணிக்கையைத் தானாகக் கண்டறிந்து அதைப் பற்றி ஒரு வரியை அச்சிடும், எடுத்துக்காட்டாக [Unlimited] Detected: game fivem | framework qbx (qbx_core) | inventory ox_inventory | slots 50. தரவுத்தளத்தில் அட்டவணைகள் தானாக உருவாக்கப்படும்.","dc_install_8":"பேனல் முகவரி பொருந்தவில்லையா? முகவரிகளும் போர்ட்களும் பகுதியைப் பாருங்கள்","dc_hosting_1":"வழி","dc_hosting_2":"முகவரி","dc_hosting_3":"சொந்த பேனல் போர்ட் (வீட்டு சர்வர், VPS, Windows)","dc_hosting_4":"கேம் போர்ட் (கேம் போர்ட் மட்டும் திறந்துள்ள கேம் ஹோஸ்ட்கள்)","dc_hosting_5":"கேம் போர்ட் வழியாகச் செல்லும்போது, முடிவில் உள்ள / ஐ வைத்திருங்கள். resource தொடங்கும்போது, கன்சோல் சரியான முகவரிகளை அச்சிடும்.","dc_hosting_6":"பேனல் போர்ட்டை (TCP) உங்கள் ஃபயர்வாலில் அல்லது ஹோஸ்ட் பேனலில் திறக்கவும். கேம் ஹோஸ்டில், கூடுதல் போர்ட் கேட்டு அதை server.cfg இல் அமைக்கவும்.","dc_hosting_7":"கேம் போர்ட் முகவரியைப் பயன்படுத்தினால், கீழே உள்ள rate limit வரிகளைச் சேர்க்கவும். FiveM இயல்பாக ஒவ்வொரு IP க்கும் கோரிக்கைகளை வரம்பிடுகிறது, அது பேனலுக்கு மிகக் குறைவு.","dc_hosting_8":"HTTPS உடன் டொமைனுக்கு, முன்னால் ஒரு reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy அல்லது Cloudflare) வைக்கவும். பேனல் தானாக சாதாரண HTTP ஐ மட்டுமே வழங்கும். proxy, Host மற்றும் X-Forwarded-Proto ஐ அனுப்ப வேண்டும், WebSocket upgrades ஐயும் அனுமதிக்க வேண்டும்.","dc_hosting_9":"பேனல் வேறொரு தளத்தில் ஹோஸ்ட் செய்யப்பட்டிருந்தால் மட்டும் (unlDisableServe true): அந்தத் தள முகவரியை unlPanelAllowedOrigins இல் பட்டியலிடவும். இந்த சர்வரிலிருந்து பேனலைத் திறந்தால் இது தேவையில்லை.","dc_hosting_10":"429 பிழைகள் வருகின்றனவா? Rate limits பகுதியைப் பாருங்கள்","dc_settings_1":"Convar","dc_settings_2":"இயல்பு","dc_settings_3":"என்ன செய்கிறது","dc_settings_4":"சொந்த பேனல் போர்ட்.","dc_settings_5":"ஹோஸ்ட் போர்ட், இல்லையெனில் 30120","dc_settings_6":"தொடக்க அறிக்கையில் காட்டப்படும் கேம் போர்ட்.","dc_settings_7":"தொடக்கத்தில் பொது IP ஐத் தேடு.","dc_settings_8":"true = இந்த resource இலிருந்து பேனலை வழங்க வேண்டாம் (வெளி ஹோஸ்டிங்).","dc_settings_9":"வெற்று","dc_settings_10":"வேறொரு தளத்திலிருந்து பேனல் API ஐப் பயன்படுத்த அனுமதிக்கப்பட்ட கூடுதல் வெப் முகவரிகள், கமாவால் பிரிக்கவும்.","dc_settings_11":"விளையாட்டு மெனுவுக்கான சாட் கட்டளை. RedM இயல்பு: unladmin.","dc_settings_12":"வீரர்களின் புகார் கட்டளை. இது மெனு கட்டளையாக இருக்கக் கூடாது.","dc_settings_13":"ஒரு ACE குழு எந்த பேனல் பாத்திரத்தைப் பெறும், JSON ஆக.","dc_settings_14":"Live View இயந்திரம்: auto, screencapture அல்லது webrtc.","dc_settings_15":"Cloudflare TURN Token ID (set பயன்படுத்தவும், setr ஒருபோதும் வேண்டாம்).","dc_settings_16":"Cloudflare TURN API டோக்கன் (set பயன்படுத்தவும், setr ஒருபோதும் வேண்டாம்).","dc_settings_17":"false = கன்சோலிலும் Dashboard இலும் புதிய பதிப்பு அறிவிப்பு இல்லை.","dc_settings_18":"false = விளையாட்டு மெனுவில் நேரலை சர்வர் கன்சோலை அணை.","dc_settings_19":"auto","dc_settings_20":"உங்கள் ஆடை ஸ்கிரிப்டின் event; வெற்று = தானாகக் கண்டறி.","dc_settings_21":"config.json key","dc_settings_22":"inventory ஐப் பொறுத்தது","dc_settings_23":"stashes, trunks மற்றும் gloveboxes எங்கே உள்ளன. உங்கள் inventory உடன் பொருந்த வேண்டும், இல்லையெனில் stashes காலியாகத் தெரியும்.","dc_settings_24":"convar போலவே. வெற்று = இயல்பு.","dc_settings_25":"convar போலவே. வெற்று = /ureport.","dc_settings_26":"Google STUN","dc_settings_27":"Live View க்கான STUN மற்றும் TURN சர்வர்கள்.","dc_settings_28":"ஒவ்வொரு பதிவு வகைக்கும் ஒரு Discord webhook. மற்றவை Discord தலைப்பில் பட்டியலிடப்பட்டுள்ளன.","dc_settings_29":"true = ஆயுதப் பதிவே இல்லை.","dc_settings_30":"true = ஆயுதப் பதிவுகள் Discord இல் மட்டும் வராது.","dc_settings_31":"config.json சரியான JSON ஆக இருக்க வேண்டும்; // மற்றும் /* */ கருத்துகள் அனுமதிக்கப்படும். Framework பெயர்கள், inventory மற்றும் slots இயங்குவதை வைத்துக் கண்டறியப்படும்; பொருந்தாத மதிப்பு புறக்கணிக்கப்பட்டு கன்சோலில் Warning: வரி வரும். பழைய config.json அப்படியே இருக்கலாம்.","dc_settings_32":"Discord webhooks","dc_backup_1":"பாதை","dc_backup_2":"அதில் என்ன உள்ளது","dc_backup_3":"பேனல் பயனர்கள், பாத்திரங்கள், அமைப்புகள், குறிப்புகள் மற்றும் waypoints.","dc_backup_4":"பதிவுக் கோப்புகள்: player, game, money, dev, web மற்றும் scripts.","dc_backup_5":"உங்கள் சொந்த அமைப்புகளும் webhooks உம்.","dc_backup_6":"காப்புப்பிரதி எடு","dc_backup_7":"config.json மற்றும் unlWeb/ கோப்புறையை பாதுகாப்பான இடத்திற்கு நகலெடுக்கவும்.","dc_backup_8":"புதுப்பி","dc_backup_9":"புதிய கோப்புகளை பழைய கோப்புறையின் மேல் நகலெடுக்கவும். முதலில் கோப்புறையை நீக்க வேண்டாம், unlWeb/ ஐ ஒருபோதும் நீக்க வேண்டாம்.","dc_backup_10":"உங்கள் சொந்த config.json ஐ வைத்திருங்கள். புதிய விருப்பங்களுக்காக புதியதுடன் ஒப்பிடுங்கள்.","dc_backup_11":"சர்வரை மறுதொடக்கம் செய்யவும். பிறகு உங்கள் பாத்திரங்களைச் சரிபாருங்கள்: புதிய அனுமதி இல்லாத பாத்திரம் அந்த பொத்தானை இழக்கும்.","dc_backup_12":"நீக்கு","dc_backup_13":"server.cfg இலிருந்து ensure வரியையும் add_filesystem_permission வரிகளையும் நீக்கி, சர்வரை நிறுத்தவும்.","dc_backup_14":"resource கோப்புறையை வேறிடத்திற்கு நகர்த்தவும். மீண்டும் வர வாய்ப்பிருந்தால் unlWeb/ இன் நகலை வைத்திருங்கள்.","dc_backup_15":"Unlimited தரவுத்தளத்தில் உருவாக்கிய அட்டவணைகள் (பெயர்கள் unl_ இல் தொடங்கும்) மற்றும் இரண்டு நெடுவரிசைகள் (bans.tokens மற்றும் players.isWhitelisted) அப்படியே இருக்கும். அவற்றால் தீங்கு இல்லை; உறுதியாக இருந்தால் மட்டும் நீக்குங்கள்.","dc_backup_16":"unlWeb/data.json ஐ நீக்கினால் அமைவு வழிகாட்டி மீண்டும் தொடங்கும், எல்லா பேனல் பயனர்கள், பாத்திரங்கள், குறிப்புகள் மற்றும் waypoints உம் நீக்கப்படும்.","dc_access_1":"Management, பாத்திரங்கள்: ஒரு பாத்திரத்தை உருவாக்கி, அந்த நபருக்குத் தேவையான அனுமதிகளை மட்டும் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","dc_access_2":"Management, பயனர்கள்: பயனரை உருவாக்கி பாத்திரத்தை ஒதுக்கவும். பாத்திரம் இல்லாத பயனரால் உள்நுழைய முடியாது.","dc_access_3":"அதே பயனரில், FiveM பெயரை (fxname) அவர்களின் identifier ஆல் நிரப்பவும், எடுத்துக்காட்டாக கீழே உள்ள குறியீடு. இது இல்லாவிட்டால் விளையாட்டு மெனு Denied எனக் காட்டும்.","dc_access_4":"விளையாட்டில் FiveM இல் /admin, RedM இல் /unladmin என தட்டச்சு செய்யவும்.","dc_access_5":"ACE குழுவில் உள்ள பணியாளர்கள் (txAdmin அல்லது add_principal இலிருந்து) தங்களுக்கென பேனல் பயனர் இல்லாமலேயே விளையாட்டு மெனுவைப் பெறுவார்கள். ஒவ்வொரு குழுவும் எந்த பேனல் பாத்திரத்தைப் பெறும் என்று குறிப்பிடவும்; அதே பெயருள்ள பாத்திரம் அவர்கள் என்ன செய்யலாம் என்பதை முடிவு செய்யும். வீரருடன் இணைக்கப்பட்ட பேனல் பயனருக்கு எப்போதும் முன்னுரிமை. அணைக்க {} பயன்படுத்தவும்.","dc_access_6":"என்ன","dc_access_7":"எப்படி மாற்றுவது","dc_access_8":"மெனு கட்டளை: FiveM இல் /admin, RedM இல் /unladmin","dc_access_9":"கட்டமைப்பு, விளையாட்டு நிர்வாக மெனு, அல்லது server.cfg இல் set unlAdminMenuCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_10":"வீரர்களின் புகார் கட்டளை: /ureport","dc_access_11":"கட்டமைப்பு, வீரர் புகார் கட்டளை, அல்லது set unlReportCommand \"mycommand\".","dc_access_12":"மெனுவுக்கான RedM ஹாட்கீ (0x3C0A40F2 போன்ற RDR control hash)","dc_access_13":"மெனு கட்டளையின் அதே இடத்தில். RedM இல் ஸ்கிரிப்ட்களுக்கு key bindings இல்லை, எனவே இது விருப்பத்திற்குரியது.","dc_access_14":"வேறொரு மெனு ஏற்கனவே /admin ஐ வைத்திருந்தால் (எடுத்துக்காட்டாக qbx_adminmenu), கன்சோல் தொடக்கத்தில் அதைச் சொல்லும்: வேறொரு கட்டளையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும். ESX இல், esx_adminmenu /adminmenu ஐ வைத்திருக்கும்.","dc_access_15":"செயல்","dc_access_16":"பாத்திர அனுமதி","dc_access_17":"எச்சரி, செய்தி அனுப்பு","dc_access_18":"வீரர்: எச்சரி","dc_access_19":"உதை","dc_access_20":"வீரர்: உதை","dc_access_21":"தடை செய்","dc_access_22":"வீரர்: தடை செய்","dc_access_23":"Live View, பார்வையிடு","dc_access_24":"வீரர்: திரையைப் பார்க்கவும்","dc_access_25":"மெனுவில் சர்வர் கன்சோல்: படி / கட்டளைகளை இயக்கு","dc_access_26":"கட்டமைப்பு: படி / மாற்றியமைக்கவும்","dc_access_27":"வரிசை: பார் / உள்ளே விடு","dc_access_28":"அனுமதி பட்டியல்: படி / மாற்றியமைக்கவும்","dc_access_29":"Denied வருகிறதா? தீர்வைப் பாருங்கள்","dc_whitelist_1":"அணுகல் முறை","dc_whitelist_2":"சரிபார்ப்பு இல்லை.","dc_whitelist_3":"ஒரு license தரவுத்தளத்தில் அனுமதி பட்டியலில் இருக்க வேண்டும்.","dc_whitelist_4":"உங்கள் guild இல் உள்ள Discord பாத்திரங்களால் முடிவாகும்.","dc_whitelist_5":"முதலில் உள்ளூர் அனுமதி பட்டியல், பிறகு Discord. இதுவே இயல்பு.","dc_whitelist_6":"அனுமதி பட்டியல் பக்கத்தைத் திறந்து, தயாரானதும் உலகளாவிய செயல்படுத்தலை இயக்கவும்.","dc_whitelist_7":"அணுகல் கட்டுப்பாடு என்பதன் கீழ் அணுகல் முறையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும். Discord பாத்திரங்களுக்கு, guild ID மற்றும் bot டோக்கனை உள்ளிட்டு, ஒவ்வொரு பாத்திரத்திற்கும் முன்னுரிமை கொடுக்கவும்.","dc_whitelist_8":"வரிசை வரம்பை (Max players) அமைக்கவும். இது இயல்பாக sv_maxclients, அது ஒருபோதும் மீறப்படாது. இன்னும் பதிவிறக்கும் அல்லது ஏற்றும் வீரர்கள் இணைந்தவர்களாகக் கணக்கிடப்படுவார்கள்; அவர்கள் தங்கள் இடத்தை இழக்க மாட்டார்கள்.","dc_whitelist_9":"இடங்களை ஒதுக்க slot குழுக்களைப் பயன்படுத்தவும், எடுத்துக்காட்டாக பணியாளர்களுக்கு. ACE குழுக்களில் (group.admin, group.moderator) உள்ள பணியாளர்களுக்கு எப்போதும் அணுகல் கிடைக்கும்.","dc_whitelist_10":"VORP: VORP அணுகலை முடிவு செய்யும்போது பராமரிப்பு முறையும் சரிபார்க்கப்படும். RSG-Core: rsg-queue இயங்கினால் அதுவே வரிசை, விளையாட்டு மெனு அதன் பட்டியலைப் படிக்க மட்டும் காட்டும். ESX: esx_whitelist இயங்கி அதன் அனுமதி பட்டியல் இயக்கத்தில் இருந்தால், யார் சேரலாம் என்பதை அது முடிவு செய்யும்; Unlimited வரிசையை மட்டும் இயக்கும் (கட்டமைப்பு, அனுமதிப் பட்டியல் மூலம்).","dc_security_1":"அமைவு டோக்கன், unlWeb/data.json, Discord bot டோக்கன், webhook URL, Cloudflare TURN API டோக்கன் அல்லது TURN கடவுச்சொல்லை ஒருபோதும் பகிர வேண்டாம். ஆதரவுக்காக கன்சோல் வெளியீட்டையோ config.json ஐயோ பகிரும் முன் அவற்றை நீக்கவும்.","dc_security_2":"பேனலை இணையத்திலிருந்து அணுக முடிந்தால், reverse proxy மூலம் HTTPS பின்னால் வைக்கவும்.","dc_security_3":"ஒவ்வொரு பாத்திரத்திற்கும் தேவையான அனுமதிகளை மட்டும் கொடுங்கள். மாஸ்டர் கணக்கை உரிமையாளருக்கு மட்டும் வைத்து, ஒவ்வொரு புதுப்பிப்புக்குப் பிறகும் பாத்திரங்களைச் சரிபாருங்கள்.","dc_security_4":"ரகசியங்களை server.cfg இல் set மூலம் வையுங்கள், setr ஒருபோதும் வேண்டாம். setr மதிப்பை ஒவ்வொரு வீரருக்கும் அனுப்பும்.","dc_security_5":"Live View மூலம் பணியாளர்கள் விளையாட்டுக் குரலைக் கேட்க முடியும் என்றும், screencapture stream மூலம் பார்க்கப்படும்போது வீரருக்கு ஒரு குறியீடு தெரியும் என்றும் உங்கள் விதிகளில் வீரர்களுக்குச் சொல்லுங்கள்.","dc_security_6":"Unlimited ஒரு கண்காணிப்பு மற்றும் நிர்வாகக் கருவி, anti-cheat அல்ல. கட்டணம் செலுத்திய cheat மெனுக்களைப் பிடிக்க Live View ஐ நம்ப வேண்டாம்.","dc_liveview_1":"விருப்பம்","dc_liveview_2":"எப்போது பயன்படுத்துவது","dc_liveview_3":"screencapture மற்றும் அதன் Cloudflare stream","dc_liveview_4":"மிகவும் நிலையானது, பல பார்வையாளர்களுக்கு ஏற்றது. அமைத்திருந்தால் தானாகப் பயன்படுத்தப்படும், WebRTC மாற்றாக இருக்கும்.","dc_liveview_5":"Cloudflare TURN (உள்ளமைந்தது)","dc_liveview_6":"நேரடி இணைப்புகள் தோல்வியடையும்போது. எளிதான தீர்வு.","dc_liveview_7":"உங்கள் சொந்த TURN சர்வர் (எடுத்துக்காட்டாக coturn)","dc_liveview_8":"நீங்கள் ஏற்கனவே ஒன்றை இயக்குகிறீர்கள், அல்லது நிலையான சான்றுகள் வேண்டும்.","dc_liveview_9":"Cloudflare TURN, படிப்படியாக","dc_liveview_10":"Cloudflare dashboard இல் Realtime ஐத் திறந்து, பிறகு TURN Server ஐத் திறக்கவும்.","dc_liveview_11":"ஒரு TURN key ஐ உருவாக்கவும். Turn Token ID ஐயும் API Token ஐயும் நகலெடுக்கவும்.","dc_liveview_12":"அவற்றை set மூலம் server.cfg இல் வையுங்கள்.","dc_liveview_13":"மறுதொடக்கம் செய்யவும். Debug logging இயக்கத்தில் இருந்தால், கன்சோல் கீழே உள்ள வரியைக் காட்டும்.","dc_liveview_14":"உங்கள் சொந்த TURN சர்வர் config.json இல் செல்லும். STUN வரியை வைத்திருங்கள்.","dc_liveview_15":"screencapture stream: அதன் live worker ஐ அமைத்து, பிறகு கீழே உள்ள வரிகளைச் சேர்க்கவும். screencapture resource, Unlimited க்கு முன் தொடங்க வேண்டும். வரம்புகள்: 720p, 30 fps, கேம் ஆடியோ இல்லை, ஒவ்வொரு 30 நிமிடத்திற்கும் புதிய stream. இதை ஒருபோதும் பயன்படுத்த வேண்டாம் என்றால், unlLiveScreenEngine ஐ webrtc ஆக அமைக்கவும்.","dc_liveview_16":"செய்தி","dc_liveview_17":"தீர்வு","dc_liveview_18":"Could not connect to the player's game (network/NAT)","dc_liveview_19":"TURN ஐச் சேர்க்கவும் (மேலே).","dc_liveview_20":"தவறான Turn Token ID.","dc_liveview_21":"தவறான API டோக்கன்.","dc_liveview_22":"Continuous live view requires screencapture.","dc_liveview_23":"screencapture ஐ நிறுவவும்.","dc_liveview_24":"stream மீண்டும் மீண்டும் துண்டிக்கிறது","dc_liveview_25":"கேம் போர்ட் முகவரியைப் பயன்படுத்தினால் rate limit வரிகளைச் சரிபாருங்கள்.","dc_liveview_26":"குரல்: Live View வீரரின் அருகாமைக் குரலை உங்கள் சொந்த விளையாட்டிலும் ஒலிக்கும். நீங்கள் விளையாட்டில் இருக்க வேண்டும், உங்கள் பேனல் பயனரில் உங்கள் FiveM பெயர் அமைக்கப்பட்டிருக்க வேண்டும், பாத்திரத்தில் குரலைக் கேள் அனுமதி இருக்க வேண்டும், மேலும் pma-voice அல்லது mumble-voip வேண்டும். விளையாட்டில்: /admin, வீரர், Live View; நிறுத்த /unlstopview.","dc_liveview_27":"Rate limits","dc_logs_1":"பதிவு","dc_logs_2":"உள்ளடக்கம்","dc_logs_3":"Player","dc_logs_4":"கதாபாத்திரங்களின் செயல்கள், சேர்தல், வெளியேறுதல், உதைகள், தடைகள், ஆயுதத் தாக்குதல்கள்.","dc_logs_5":"Game","dc_logs_6":"இறப்புகள், உயிர்ப்பித்தல்கள், மற்றும் பிற resource கள் அனுப்புபவை.","dc_logs_7":"Money","dc_logs_8":"கணக்கு, தொகை மற்றும் காரணத்துடன் ஒவ்வொரு பண மாற்றமும்.","dc_logs_9":"Dev","dc_logs_10":"பொருட்கள், வேலைகள், கும்பல்கள் மற்றும் வாகனங்களில் மாற்றங்கள்.","dc_logs_11":"Web","dc_logs_12":"பேனல் தணிக்கைத் தடம்: IP உடன் உள்நுழைவுகள், யார் எதை மாற்றினார்.","dc_logs_13":"Unlimited","dc_logs_14":"தொடக்கம், கணினி மற்றும் பிழை வரிகள்.","dc_logs_15":"ஸ்கிரிப்ட்கள்","dc_logs_16":"பிற ஸ்கிரிப்ட்கள் அனுப்பும் வரிகள். புதிய ஸ்கிரிப்ட்கள் தாமாகவே தோன்றும்.","dc_logs_17":"தேடு","dc_logs_18":"கண்டுபிடிப்பது","dc_logs_19":"ஒரு வீரரைப் பற்றிய அனைத்தும், id அல்லது identifier மூலம்.","dc_logs_20":"அதே, கதாபாத்திரப் பெயர் மூலம்.","dc_logs_21":"ஒரு பதிவு வகை மட்டும். பலவற்றுக்கு கமா பயன்படுத்தவும்: type:player,game.","dc_logs_22":"ஒரு ஸ்கிரிப்டின் வரிகள்.","dc_logs_23":"info, warn அல்லது error வரிகள் மட்டும்.","dc_logs_24":"இந்த உரையைக் கொண்ட வரிகள்.","dc_logs_25":"செயற்குறிகளை இணைக்கலாம். ஒரு வீரருடன் பொருந்தும் சாதாரண உரை அந்த வீரரைப் பற்றிய அனைத்தையும் காட்டும்; இல்லையெனில் உரையைத் தேடும்.","dc_logs_26":"ஸ்கிரிப்ட் உரிமையாளர்கள் ஒரே சர்வர்-பக்க அழைப்பு மூலம் Unlimited இல் பதிவு செய்கிறார்கள். ஸ்கிரிப்ட்கள் தாவல் ஸ்கிரிப்ட், நிலை, வகை, வீரர் மற்றும் உரை மூலம் வடிகட்டும்; பாத்திர அனுமதி logs:script தேவை.","dc_logs_27":"வரம்புகள்: ஒரு ஸ்கிரிப்டுக்கு வினாடிக்கு 20 வரிகள். ஸ்கிரிப்ட் பதிவுக் கோப்பு 10 MB இல் சுழலும், 3 பழைய கோப்புகளை வைத்திருக்கும்.","dc_discord_1":"Discord இல்: சேனல் அமைப்புகள், Integrations, Webhooks, New Webhook. webhook URL ஐ நகலெடுக்கவும்.","dc_discord_2":"அதை config.json இல் அந்த பதிவு வகைக்கான key இன் கீழ் வையுங்கள், அல்லது server.cfg இல் set மூலம் வையுங்கள்.","dc_discord_3":"resource ஐ மறுதொடக்கம் செய்யவும். செய்திகள் நிறக் குறியிடப்பட்ட embeds ஆக வரும்.","dc_discord_4":"Key / convar","dc_discord_5":"Web (பேனல் தணிக்கை)","dc_discord_6":"Unlimited (பொது)","dc_discord_7":"webhook URL ஒரு கடவுச்சொல் போன்றது: அது உள்ள எவரும் உங்கள் சேனலில் இடுகையிடலாம். ஆயுதப் பதிவுகளை அணைக்கலாம் (disableWeaponLogs) அல்லது Discord இல் மட்டும் தவிர்க்கலாம் (excludeWeaponLogsFromDiscord). வரிசைக்கு வரிசை அமைப்புகளில் தனி விருப்ப webhook உண்டு. அனுமதி பட்டியலுக்கான Discord பாத்திரங்கள் அனுமதி பட்டியல் பக்கத்தில் அமைக்கப்படும்.","dc_discord_8":"அனுமதி பட்டியலும் வரிசையும்","dc_items_1":"Dev ஐத் திறந்து, பிறகு பொருட்கள், பிறகு அந்தப் பொருளைத் திறக்கவும்.","dc_items_2":"விளைவுகளைச் சேர்க்கவும்: ஆரோக்கியம் மற்றும் கவசம், பசி மற்றும் தாகம், திரை விளைவுகள், அனிமேஷன்கள், ஒலிகள், பொருட்கள் மற்றும் பணம். ஒவ்வொரு விளைவுக்கும் தாமதமும் கால அளவும் மில்லிவினாடிகளில் வைக்கலாம் (15 வினாடி என்பது 15000).","dc_items_3":"சேமிக்கவும். ox_inventory உள்ள FiveM இல், விளைவுகள் உங்கள் ox_inventory பொருட்களில் unlEffects ஆகப் பொருளுடன் சேமிக்கப்படும்; இதற்கு எழுது-அனுமதி தேவை.","dc_items_4":"சோதிக்க விளையாட்டில் பொருளைப் பயன்படுத்திப் பாருங்கள்.","dc_items_5":"சேமிப்பு தோல்வியா? எழுது-அனுமதி பகுதியைப் பாருங்கள்","dc_items_6":"VORP உள்ள RedM: பொருளைத் திறந்து Consumable பகுதியைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். விளைவுகள் unl_item_effects அட்டவணையில் சேமிக்கப்பட்டு உடனே vorp_inventory இல் பதிவு செய்யப்படும். முற்றிலும் புதிய பொருளுக்கு இன்னும் vorp_inventory மறுதொடக்கம் தேவை.","dc_items_7":"vorp_metabolism இன் Config.ItemsToUse இல் பட்டியலிடப்பட்ட பொருட்கள் vorp_metabolism க்கே விடப்படும், அதனால் எதுவும் இரண்டு முறை இயங்காது.","dc_items_8":"வேறொரு ஸ்கிரிப்ட் ஏற்கனவே பொருளைப் பயன்படுத்தக்கூடியதாகப் பதிவு செய்திருந்தால், இங்கே அதற்கு விளைவுகளைக் கொடுக்க வேண்டாம். vorp_inventory ஒரு பொருளுக்கு ஒரு handler மட்டுமே வைத்திருக்கும்.","dc_items_9":"ஓட்டம் மற்றும் நீச்சல் பெருக்கிகள் கேமால் 1.49 இல் வரம்பிடப்படுகின்றன. கண்ணுக்குத் தெரியும் வேகமான இயக்கத்திற்கு move rate override ஐப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","dc_panelclosed_1":"சர்வர் கன்சோலில் [Unlimited] என்று தொடங்கும் வரிகளைக் கண்டுபிடித்து, அவை அச்சிடும் முகவரிகளையே சரியாகத் திறக்கவும்.","dc_panelclosed_2":"Oppstart STOPPET (தொடக்கம் தோல்வி, காரணம் தொடரும்) அல்லது கீழே உள்ள வரியைத் தேடுங்கள். போர்ட் வேறு யாராலோ எடுக்கப்பட்டிருந்தால் போர்ட்டை மாற்றவும்.","dc_panelclosed_3":"கன்சோல் Unlimited svarer lokalt, men ikke på ... utenfra என்று சொன்னால், சொந்த போர்ட் உங்கள் ஹோஸ்டில் திறக்கப்படவில்லை. கேம் போர்ட் முகவரியை, முடிவில் / உடன் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","dc_panelclosed_4":"Debug logging இயக்கத்தில் பேனலைத் திறக்கவும். HTTP GET வரிகள் வரவில்லை என்றால், கோரிக்கை சர்வரை எட்டவே இல்லை: தவறான முகவரி அல்லது போர்ட், அல்லது ஃபயர்வால்.","dc_panelclosed_5":"reverse proxy பின்னால் இருந்தால், அது WebSocket upgrades ஐ அனுமதிக்கிறதா என உறுதி செய்யுங்கள்.","dc_panelclosed_6":"முகவரிகளும் போர்ட்களும்","dc_denied_1":"Management, பயனர்கள்: உங்கள் பயனரைத் திறக்கவும்.","dc_denied_2":"FiveM பெயரை உங்கள் சொந்த identifier ஆக அமைக்கவும், எடுத்துக்காட்டாக கீழே உள்ள வரி.","dc_denied_3":"பயனரின் பாத்திரத்தில் நீங்கள் எதிர்பார்க்கும் அனுமதிகள் உள்ளனவா எனச் சரிபாருங்கள்.","dc_denied_4":"அல்லது ACE குழுவைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்: உங்களை group.admin இல் சேர்த்து unlAdminMenuAceRoles ஐ அமைக்கவும், அணுகல் தலைப்பைப் பாருங்கள்.","dc_denied_5":"/admin வேறொரு மெனுவைத் திறக்கிறதா? வேறொரு ஸ்கிரிப்ட் அந்தக் கட்டளையை வைத்திருக்கிறது. கட்டமைப்பில் புதிய ஒன்றைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","dc_denied_6":"பணியாளர்களுக்கு அணுகல் வழங்கு","dc_ratelimit_1":"இந்த வரிகளை server.cfg இல், ensure unlimited-reforge க்கு முன் சேர்க்கவும்.","dc_ratelimit_2":"சர்வரை மறுதொடக்கம் செய்யவும்.","dc_ratelimit_3":"அல்லது அதற்குப் பதிலாக சொந்த பேனல் போர்ட்டைத் திறக்கவும். அது இந்த வரம்புகளால் பாதிக்கப்படாது.","dc_write_1":"உங்கள் framework க்கான add_filesystem_permission வரிகளைச் சேர்க்கவும். தொடக்க அறிக்கையும் எடிட்டர் பக்கங்களும் உங்கள் சர்வருக்குத் தேவையான சரியான வரிகளைக் காட்டும்.","dc_write_2":"அவற்றை ensure unlimited-reforge க்கு முன் வைத்து, சர்வரை மறுதொடக்கம் செய்யவும்.","dc_write_3":"இன்னும் தோல்வியா? Unlimited எழுதும் resource இன் fxmanifest.lua வில் உள்ள author, பெரும்பாலும் Unlimited போலவே இருக்க வேண்டும். கீழே உள்ள வரியை இரண்டிலும் சேர்த்து, மறுதொடக்கம் செய்யவும்.","dc_write_4":"அனைத்து framework களுக்கான அனுமதி வரிகளைக் காட்டு","dc_console_1":"கன்சோல் செய்தி","dc_console_2":"அர்த்தமும் தீர்வும்","dc_console_3":"தொடக்கம் தோல்வி; காரணம் தொடரும். பேனல் தொடங்காது.","dc_console_4":"resource தனது தரவைச் சேமிக்க முடியவில்லை. ஹோஸ்டில் கோப்பு அனுமதிகளைச் சரிபாருங்கள்.","dc_console_5":"அதே: சர்வர் செயல்முறைக்கு resource கோப்புறையில் எழுதும் அனுமதி தேவை.","dc_console_6":"பேனல் போர்ட் உங்கள் ஹோஸ்டில் திறக்கப்படவில்லை. கேம் போர்ட் முகவரியைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","dc_console_7":"rate limit வரிகளைச் சேர்க்கவும்.","dc_console_8":"பேனல் தன் இணைப்பை இழந்தது, பெரும்பாலும் 429. rate limit வரிகளைச் சேர்க்கவும்.","dc_console_9":"நெட்வொர்க்குகளுக்கு இடையே Live View தோல்வியடையலாம். TURN ஐ அமைக்கவும்.","dc_console_10":"வீரருக்கும் பார்வையாளருக்கும் இடையே இணைப்பு இல்லை. Live View பகுதியைப் பாருங்கள்.","dc_console_11":"பேனலில் பிழை; மேலே உள்ள வரிகள் காரணத்தைக் காட்டும்.","dc_console_12":"unlWebPort மூலம் போர்ட்டை மாற்றவும்.","dc_console_13":"framework இன்னும் தொடங்கவில்லை அல்லது வேறு பெயர் உள்ளது. அதற்குப் பிறகு Unlimited ஐத் தொடங்கவும்.","dc_console_14":"அமைவு டோக்கன் வேலை செய்யவில்லை: அது ஒவ்வொரு மறுதொடக்கத்திலும் மாறும், சமீபத்திய தொடக்கத்தில் உள்ளதைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். மாஸ்டர் கடவுச்சொல் தொலைந்துவிட்டதா: unlWeb/data.json ஐ நீக்கினால் வழிகாட்டி மீண்டும் தொடங்கும், ஆனால் எல்லா பேனல் பயனர்கள், பாத்திரங்கள், குறிப்புகள் மற்றும் waypoints உம் நீக்கப்படும். முதலில் அந்தக் கோப்பை பாதுகாப்பான இடத்தில் நகலெடுக்கவும்."}};var N=window.I18N_N=window.I18N_N||{};for(var c in D){N[c]=N[c]||{};for(var k in D[c])N[c][k]=D[c][k];}})();
